  FT["MY-H1550"] = {"id":"MY-H1550","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第17号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 17) ORDER 2018","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 17) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 17) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 17) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 17) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 17) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)155-2018_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1550-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel )\n(No. 17) 2018.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 5 Julai 2018.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H1550-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1550-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga  Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel ) (No. 16) 2018 [P.U. (A) 143/2018] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 27 Jun 2018 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 17) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the Price Control and\nAnti-Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723], the Controller, with the approval of the Minister,\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\nClass of petrol and diesel\n\nHarga seliter/\nPrice per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97/\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.58\n\nPetrol RON95/\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.20\n\nDiesel Euro2/\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.18\n\nDiesel Euro5/\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.28\n\nDibuat 4 Julai 2018\nMade 4 July 2018\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XIX]\n\nDATO' SRI JAMIL BIN SALLEH\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 4 Julai 2018\nApproved 4 July 2018\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XIX]\n\nDATO' SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1551"] = {"id":"MY-H1551","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年消费税（豁免领牌）令","en":"EXCISE DUTIES (EXEMPTION FROM LICENSING) ORDER 2019","orig":"EXCISE DUTIES (EXEMPTION FROM LICENSING) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Duti Eksais (Pengecualian daripada Pelesenan) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tiêu thụ đặc biệt (Miễn cấp phép) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งภาษีสรรพสามิต (การยกเว้นการขอใบอนุญาต) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Cukai (Pembebasan dari Perizinan) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2019_P.U.(A)155-2019_EXCISE DUTIES (EXEMPTION FROM LICENSING) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1551-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Pengilang berlesen di bawah seksyen 65A Akta Kastam 1967 [Akta 235]."}},{"id":"MY-H1551-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Mana-mana pengeluar isi rumah wain merah."}},{"id":"MY-H1551-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Pengilang yang mengeluarkan barang-barang di bawah kepala 20.09 yang\n\njumlah kandungan gulanya ialah 12 gram tiap-tiap 100 mililiter (12g/100ml)\n\natau kurang."}},{"id":"MY-H1551-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Pengilang yang mengeluarkan minuman di bawah kepala 22.02 yang jumlah\n\nkandungan gulanya ialah 5 gram tiap-tiap 100 mililiter (5g/100ml)\n\natau kurang."}},{"id":"MY-H1551-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Pengilang yang mengeluarkan minuman di bawah kepala 22.02, yang\n\nberasaskan susu sebagaimana yang dinyatakan di bawah Bab 4, yang jumlah\n\nkandungan gulanya ialah 7 gram tiap-tiap 100 mililiter (7g/100ml)\n\natau kurang.\n\nDibuat 30 Mei 2019\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/19-8 Klt.3 Sk.26; Perb. 0.9060/18(SJ.34); PN(PU2)337/XXIII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\n\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE DUTIES (EXEMPTION FROM LICENSING) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 20(2) of the Excise Act 1976 [Act 176],\n\nthe Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Excise (Exemption from Licensing)\n\nOrder 2019.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 July 2019.\n\nInterpretation\n\n2. In this Order—\n\n\"sugars\" means all monosaccharides and disaccharides contained in a food and\n\nbeverage either naturally occurring or added;\n\n\"heading 20.09\" means goods described in columns (1), (2) and (3) in relation to\n\nheading 20.09 of Chapter 20 of the First Schedule to the Customs Duties Order 2017\n\n[P.U. (A) 5/2017];\n\n\"heading 22.02\" means goods described in columns (1), (2) and (3) in relation to\n\nheading 22.02 of Chapter 22 of the First Schedule to the Customs Duties Order 2017;\n\n\"Chapter 4\" means goods described in columns (1), (2) and (3) in relation to\n\nChapter 4 of the First Schedule to the Customs Duties Order 2017.\n\nExemption\n\n3. The class of persons specified in the Schedule are exempted from the\n\nsubsection 20(1) of the Excise Act 1976.\n\nRevocation\n\n4. The Excise (Exemption from Licensing) Order 1984 [P.U. (A) 5/84] is revoked.\n\nSchedule\n\n[Paragraph 3]\n\n1. Manufacturers licensed under section 65A of the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235].\n\n2. Any household producer of red wine.\n\n3. Manufacturers who produce goods under the heading 20.09 of which the total\n\nsugars content is 12 grams per 100 millilitres (12g/100ml) or less.\n\n4. Manufacturers who produce beverages under the heading 22.02 of which the\n\ntotal sugars content is 5 grams per 100 millilitres (5g/100ml) or less.\n\n5. Manufacturers who produce beverages under the heading 22.02, based on\n\nmilk as specified under Chapter 4, of which the total sugars content is 7 grams\n\nper 100 millilitres (7g/100ml) or less.\n\nMade 30 May 2019\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/19-8 Klt.3 Sk.26; Perb. 0.9600/18(SJ.34); PN(PU2)337/XXIII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\n\nMinister of Finance"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1552"] = {"id":"MY-H1552","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第3号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 3) ORDER 2020","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 3) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 3) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 3) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)155-2020_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 3) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1552-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Ha rga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 3) 2020.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 20 Mei 2020\nhingga 3 Jun 2020.\n\nHarga pengeluar maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H1552-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga pengeluar maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Pertama bagi Negeri-Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H1552-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H1552-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Ketiga bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wila yah-Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 3) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the Price Control and\nAnti-Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723], the Controller, with the approval of the Minister,\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1553"] = {"id":"MY-H1553","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2021&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":8,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年传染病预防与控制（疫区地方措施）（有条件行动管制）（第4号）（修正）（第6号）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) REGULATIONS 2021","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Các biện pháp trong khu vực bị nhiễm bệnh) (Kiểm soát di chuyển có điều kiện) (số 4) (Sửa đổi) (số 6) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (มาตรการในท้องที่ที่ติดเชื้อ) (การควบคุมการเคลื่อนย้ายแบบมีเงื่อนไข) (ฉบับที่ 4) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Tindakan di Wilayah Lokal Terinfeksi) (Pengendalian Mobilitas Bersyarat) (Nomor 4) (Perubahan) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2021","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah dalam Kawasan Tempatan Berjangkit) (Kawalan Pergerakan Bersyarat) (Bilangan 4) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 6) 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 8 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)155-2021_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITION.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1553-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Negeri Johor 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1553-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Negeri Kelantan 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1553-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Negeri Pulau Pinang 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nKawasan Tempatan Jangkitan/Bahagian/Daerah\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh"}},{"id":"MY-H1553-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. Negeri Sarawak 30.3.2021 – 12.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1553-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Negeri Selangor 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1553-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1553-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. Daerah Kuala Muda, Negeri Kedah 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1553-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. Daerah Seremban, Negeri Sembilan 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\".\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT\n\nCONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342],\n\nthe Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas)\n\n(Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) (Amendment) (No. 6) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 April 2021.\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule\n\n2. The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) Regulations 2021\n\n[P.U. (A) 97/2021] are amended by substituting for the First Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\nAPPLICATION\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n1. State of Johore 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n2. State of Kelantan 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n3. State of Penang 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n4. State of Sarawak 30.3.2021 – 12.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n5. State of Selangor 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n6. Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n7. Kuala Muda District, State of Kedah 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n8. Seremban District, State of Negeri Sembilan 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\".\n\nMade 31 March 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1554"] = {"id":"MY-H1554","coverage":"partial","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年地方限速（联邦道路）（砂拉越）（修正）令","en":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022","orig":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Sarawak) (Pindaan) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ địa phương (Đường bộ liên bang) (Sarawak) (Sửa đổi) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วท้องถิ่น (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ซาราวัก) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Lokal (Jalan Raya Federal) (Sarawak) (Perubahan) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2022_P.U.(A)155-2022_LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1554-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan\n\nPersekutuan) (Sarawak) (Pindaan) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Mei 2022.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H1554-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Persekutuan) (Sarawak) 2019 [P.U. (A) 144/2019]\n\ndipinda dalam Jadual, dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 2 dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nNama jalan dan lokasi\n\n(2)\n\nHad Laju\n\n(km/j)\n\n\"3. Laluan 1 – Bulatan Serian–Jambatan Sungai Kerang\n\nbermula dari persimpangan Jambatan Serian\n\nU 1.181715, T 110.564557 sehingga kawasan hadapan\n\nGereja St. Theresa U 1.161429, T 110.568955 di kedua-dua\n\narah (jarak sepanjang 3.095 km);"}},{"id":"MY-H1554-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Laluan 1 – Bulatan Serian–Jambatan Sungai Kerang\n\nbermula dari kawasan hadapan Gereja St. Theresa\n\nU 1.161429, T 110.568955 sehingga kawasan\n\nKg. Rasau Tebas U 1.134051, T 110.614818 di kedua-dua\n\narah (jarak sepanjang 6.042 km);"}},{"id":"MY-H1554-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Laluan 1 – Persimpangan Bintangor–Jambatan Sungai\n\nJikang bermula dari kawasan hadapan Stadium William\n\nMawan U 2.060171, T 111.903057 sehingga persimpangan\n\nJambatan Julau U 2.058248, T 111.908623 di kedua-dua\n\narah (jarak sepanjang 0.663 km);"}},{"id":"MY-H1554-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Laluan 1 – Jalan Nyabau–Simpang Jalan Bakun bermula dari\n\nkawasan di hadapan Kedai Tayar Hock Hiin U 3.192390,\n\nT 113.091270 sehingga ke persimpangan Jambatan Nyabau\n\nU 3.196082, T 113.101435 di kedua-dua arah (jarak\n\nsepanjang 1.6 km).\n\n60\".\n\nDibuat 11 Mei 2022\n\n[KKR.PUU.100-1/8/3 Jld.2; PN(PU2)460/Jld. 117]\n\n DATO‘ SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Menteri Kanan Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nLOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1555"] = {"id":"MY-H1555","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":8,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年马来西亚橡胶局（发牌与许可证）（修正）条例","en":"MALAYSIAN RUBBER BOARD (LICENSING AND PERMIT) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2023","orig":"MALAYSIAN RUBBER BOARD (LICENSING AND PERMIT) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2023","ms":"Peraturan Lembaga Getah Malaysia (Pelesenan dan Permit) (Pindaan) 2023","vi":"Quy định về Ủy ban Cao su Malaysia (Cấp phép và giấy phép) (Sửa đổi) năm 2023","th":"ข้อบังคับคณะกรรมการยางมาเลเซีย (การออกใบอนุญาต) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Peraturan Dewan Karet Malaysia (Perizinan dan Izin) (Perubahan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 8 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2023_P.U.(A)155-2023_MALAYSIAN RUBBER BOARD (LICENSING AND PERMIT) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1555-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nLembaga Getah Malaysia (Pelesenan dan Permit) (Pindaan) 2023.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 24 Mei 2023.\n\nPindaan am"}},{"id":"MY-H1555-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Lembaga Getah Malaysia (Pelesenan Dan Permit) 2014\n\n[P.U. (A) 119/2014], yang disebut \"Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nini, dipinda dalam teks bahasa Inggeris, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"smallholder\"\n\ndi mana-mana jua terdapat dengan perkataan \"rubber smallholder\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H1555-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan 2 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan takrif\n\n\"pekebun kecil getah\" dengan takrif yang berikut:\n\n‘ \"pekebun kecil getah\" ertinya seseorang yang memiliki atau\n\nmengendalikan satu ladang getah atau lebih dalam suatu Negeri yang jumlah\n\nkeseluruhannya tidak melebihi 40 hektar;'.\n\nPindaan peraturan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H1555-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Peraturan 3 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam perenggan (1)(c), dengan memotong perkataan \"atau\";\n\n(b) dalam perenggan (1)(d), dengan menggantikan koma di hujung perenggan\n\nitu dengan perkataan \"; atau\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (1)(d) perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(e) membeli getah atau menjual bahan tanaman getah secara\n\n bergerak,\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 22"}},{"id":"MY-H1555-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Subperaturan 22(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nperkataan \"dan\" di hujung perenggan (b) dengan perkataan \"atau\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 25"}},{"id":"MY-H1555-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Subperaturan 25(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nperkataan \"40.46 hektar\" dengan perkataan \"40 hektar\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 42"}},{"id":"MY-H1555-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. Peraturan 42 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dengan menomborkan semula subperaturan (6) sebagai subperaturan (7);\n\ndan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan sebelum subperaturan (7) yang dinomborkan itu\n\nsubperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"(6) Subperaturan (2), (3), (4) dan (5) tidak terpakai bagi\n\nresit rasmi yang dikeluarkan di bawah subperaturan (1) dalam bentuk\n\ncetakan komputer dibuat melalui aplikasi yang dibangunkan oleh\n\nLembaga.\".\n\nPenggantian Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H1555-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual Kedua dengan\n\nJadual yang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Peraturan 4, 5, 8, 12, 15, 16, 23, 24, 25, 30, 35, 36, 44, 45, 47, 48 dan 51]\n\nBil. Perkara Peraturan Tujuan/Aktiviti Fi"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1556"] = {"id":"MY-H1556","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年所得税（豁免）（第12号）（修正）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 12) ORDER 2018 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 12) ORDER 2018 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 12) (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (Số 12) (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 12) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 12) (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2024_P.U.(A)155-2024_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 12) ORDER 2018 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1556-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian)\n(No. 12) 2018 (Pindaan) 2024.\n\nPindaan perenggan 4"}},{"id":"MY-H1556-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (No. 12) 2018 [ P.U. (A) 391/2018 ]\ndipinda dalam subperenggan 4(3) dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"31 Disember 2022\" dengan perkataan \"31 Disember 2024\".\n\nDibuat 28 Mei 2024\n[Perb. MOF.TAX(S)700-2/1/131 Jld. 2; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-357; PN(PU2)80/JLD.111]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 12) ORDER 2018 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1557"] = {"id":"MY-H1557","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 155/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年移民（豁免）（第7号）令","en":"IMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2026","orig":"IMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Imigresen (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 7) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Xuất nhập cảnh (Miễn trừ) (số 7) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งการตรวจคนเข้าเมือง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 7) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Imigrasi (Pembebasan) (Nomor 7) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA155","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)155-2026_IMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1557-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Imigresen (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 7) 2026.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1557-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan mana-mana orang yang memasuki Malaysia melalui darat\n\nmelalui jalan dari Pekan Siam (Thailand) dan berada di Jalan Sadao hingga tiba\n\ndi Kompleks Imigresen, Padang Besar daripada pemakaian peraturan 36\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan Imigresen, 1963 [L.N. 228/63].\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2026\n\n[KDN.IM.S.600-1/3/4Jld.19(8); PN(PU2)100/JLD.19]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nIMMIGRATION ACT 1959/63\n\nIMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 55 of the Immigration Act 1959/63\n\n[Act 155], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1558"] = {"id":"MY-H1558","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2011&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年工厂与机械（豁免 PETRONAS GAS 有限公司（柔佛昔加末区域作业区压缩机站））令","en":"FACTORIES AND MACHINERY (EXEMPTION TO PETRONAS GAS BERHAD, SEGAMAT COMPRESSOR STATION, SEGAMAT REGIONAL OPERATION, JOHOR) ORDER 2011","orig":"FACTORIES AND MACHINERY (EXEMPTION TO PETRONAS GAS BERHAD, SEGAMAT COMPRESSOR STATION, SEGAMAT REGIONAL OPERATION, JOHOR) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Kilang dan Jentera (Pengecualian kepada PETRONAS GAS Berhad, Stesen Pemampat Segamat, Operasi Serantau Segamat, Johor) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Nhà máy và máy móc (Miễn trừ cho PETRONAS GAS Berhad, Trạm Nén Segamat, Vận hành Khu vực Segamat, Johor) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งโรงงานและเครื่องจักร (การยกเว้นให้ PETRONAS GAS Berhad, สถานีอัดก๊าซเซอกามัต, ปฏิบัติการภูมิภาคเซอกามัต, ยะโฮร์) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Pabrik dan Mesin (Pembebasan bagi PETRONAS GAS Berhad, Stasiun Kompresor Segamat, Operasi Regional Segamat, Johor) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2011_P.U.(A)156-2011_FACTORIES AND MACHINERY (EXEMPTION TO PETRONAS GAS BERHAD, SEGAMAT COMPRESSOR STATION, SEGAMAT.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1558-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kilang dan Jentera (Pengecualian\n\nkepada Petronas Gas Berhad, Stesyen Pemampat Segamat, Pusat Operasi\n\nSerantau Segamat, Johor) 2011.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1558-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Semua bejana tekanan tidak berapi yang didaftarkan dengan Ketua Pemeriksa,\n\ndengan nombor pendaftaran dan perihalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) dan (2)\n\nJadual, atas nama Petronas Gas Berhad, Stesyen Pemampat Segamat, Pusat Operasi\n\nSerantau Segamat, Johor yang telah diberikan perakuan kelayakan, dikecualikan\n\ndaripada persediaan yang dikehendaki di bawah perenggan 17(b) Peraturan-Peraturan\n\n(Pemberitahu, Perakuan Kelayakan dan Pemeriksaan) Kilang dan Jentera 1970\n\n[P.U. (A) 43/1970] bagi pemeriksaan ulangan yang berikutnya selepas habisnya tempoh\n\nperakuan kelayakan itu pada 12 Disember 2010.\n\nSyarat pengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1558-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Pengecualian di bawah perenggan 2 tertakluk kepada syarat bahawa semua\n\nbejana tekanan tidak berapi yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual menjalani pemeriksaan\n\nluaran dan ujian tanpa musnah dan Pemeriksa berpuas hati dengan keputusan\n\npemeriksaan dan ujian itu.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\n\nNo. Pendaftaran\n\n(2)\n\nPerihalan Bejana Tekanan Tidak Berapi\n\nPMT 101484 Stesen Turas Pemisah (atas) A\n\nPMT 101485 Stesen Turas Pemisah (atas) B\n\nPMT 101486 Turas Pemisah Gas Bahan Api A\n\nPMT 101487 Turas Pemisah Gas Bahan Api B\n\nPMT 101488 Pemisah Cecair Udara Termampat\n\nPMT 101543 Pembau\n\nPMT 101544 Penerima Udara Penimbal\n\nPMT 101545 Penerima Udara Alatan\n\nPMT 101546 Penerima Udara Utiliti\n\nPMT 101547 Stesen Turas Pemisah (bawah) A\n\nPMT 101548 Stesen Turas Pemisah (bawah) B\n\nPMT 107982 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 1\n\nPMT 107983 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 2\n\nPMT 107984 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 3\n\nPMT 107985 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 4\n\nPMT 107986 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 5\n\nPMT 107987 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 6\n\nPMT 107988 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 7\n\nPMT 107989 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 8\n\nPMT 107990 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 9\n\nPMT 107991 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 10\n\nPMT 107992 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 11\n\nPMT 107993 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 12\n\nPMT 107994 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 1\n\nPMT 107995 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 2\n\nPMT 107996 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 3\n\nPMT 107997 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 4\n\nPMT 107998 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 5\n\nPMT 107999 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 6\n\nPMT 108000 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 7\n\nPMT 108001 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 8\n\nPMT 108002 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 9\n\nPMT 108003 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 10\n\nPMT 108004 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 11\n\nPMT 108005 Penukar Haba Dingin Udara No. 12\n\nPMT 108006 Penukar Haba Minyak Pelincir No. 1\n\nPMT 108007 Penukar Haba Minyak Pelincir No. 2\n\nPMT 108008 Turas Minyak Pelincir No. 1\n\n(1)\n\nNo. Pendaftaran\n\n(2)\n\nPerihalan Bejana Tekanan Tidak Berapi\n\nPMT 108009 Turas Minyak Pelincir No. 2\n\nPMT 108010 Turas Minyak Pelincir No. 1\n\nPMT 108011 Turas Minyak Pelincir No. 2\n\nPMT 108925 Pemisah Udara/Minyak\n\nPMT 118926 Pemisah Udara/Minyak\n\nPMT 118927 Penukar Haba Minyak Pelincir No. 1\n\nPMT 118928 Penukar Haba Minyak Pelincir No. 2\n\nDibuat 15 April 2011\n\n[KSM/PUU/T/01/02/03 Jld. 14; PN(PU2)235/XXVIII]\n\nDATUK DR. SUBRAMANIAM A/L K.V. SATHASIVAM\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nFACTORIES AND MACHINERY ACT 1967\n\nFACTORIES AND MACHINERY (EXEMPTION TO PETRONAS GAS BERHAD, SEGAMAT\n\nCOMPRESSOR STATION, SEGAMAT REGIONAL OPERATION, JOHOR) ORDER 2011\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 55(3) of the Factories and Machinery\n\nAct 1967 [Act 139], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Factories and Machinery (Exemption to\n\nPetronas Gas Berhad, Segamat Compressor Station, Segamat Regional Operation,\n\nJohor) Order 2011.\n\nExemption\n\n2. All unfired pressure vessels registered with the Chief Inspector, with the\n\nregistration number and description as specified in columns (1) and (2) of the Schedule,\n\nin the name of Petronas Gas Berhad, Segamat Compressor Station, Segamat Regional\n\nOperation, Johor which have been issued with certificates of fitness, are exempted from\n\nthe preparation required under paragraph 17(b) of the Factories and Machinery\n\n(Notification, Certificate of Fitness and Inspection) Regulations 1970 [P.U. (A) 43/1970]\n\nfor subsequent regular inspection after the expiry of such certificates of fitness on\n\n12 December 2010.\n\nCondition of exemption\n\n3. The exemption under paragraph 2 is subject to the condition that all of the\n\nunfired pressure vessels as specified in the Schedule undergo an external inspection\n\nand non-destructive tests and the Inspector is satisfied with the result of such\n\ninspection and tests.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRegistration No.\n\n(2)\n\nDescription of Unfired Pressure Vessels\n\nPMT 101484 Station Filter Separator (top) A\n\nPMT 101485 Station Filter Separator (top) B\n\nPMT 101486 Fuel Gas Filter Separator A\n\nPMT 101487 Fuel Gas Filter Separator B\n\nPMT 101488 Compressed Air Liquid Separator\n\nPMT 101543 Odorizer\n\nPMT 101544 Buffer Air Receiver\n\nPMT 101545 Instrument Air Receiver\n\nPMT 101546 Utility Air Receiver\n\nPMT 101547 Station Filter Separator (bottom) A\n\nPMT 101548 Station Filter Separator (bottom) B\n\nPMT 107982 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 1\n\nPMT 107983 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 2\n\nPMT 107984 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 3\n\nPMT 107985 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 4\n\nPMT 107986 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 5\n\nPMT 107987 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 6\n\nPMT 107988 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 7\n\nPMT 107989 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 8\n\nPMT 107990 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 9\n\nPMT 107991 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 10\n\nPMT 107992 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 11\n\nPMT 107993 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 12\n\nPMT 107994 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 1\n\nPMT 107995 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 2\n\nPMT 107996 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 3\n\nPMT 107997 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 4\n\nPMT 107998 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 5\n\nPMT 107999 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 6\n\nPMT 108000 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 7\n\nPMT 108001 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 8\n\nPMT 108002 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 9\n\nPMT 108003 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 10\n\nPMT 108004 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 11\n\nPMT 108005 Air Cooled Heat Exchanger No. 12\n\nPMT 108006 Lube Oil Heat Exchanger No. 1\n\nPMT 108007 Lube Oil Heat Exchanger No. 2\n\nPMT 108008 Lube Oil Filter No. 1\n\nPMT 108009 Lube Oil Filter No. 2\n\n(1)\n\nRegistration No.\n\n(2)\n\nDescription of Unfired Pressure Vessels\n\nPMT 108010 Lube Oil Filter No. 1\n\nPMT 108011 Lube Oil Filter No. 2\n\nPMT 108025 Air/Oil Separator\n\nPMT 108926 Air/Oil Separator\n\nPMT 118927 Lube Oil Heat Exchanger No. 1\n\nPMT 118928 Lube Oil Heat Exchanger No. 2\n\nMade 15 April 2011\n\n[KSM/PUU/T/01/02/03 Jld. 14; PN(PU2)235/XXVIII]\n\nDATUK DR. SUBRAMANIAM A/L K.V. SATHASIVAM\n\nMinister of Human Resources"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1559"] = {"id":"MY-H1559","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2012&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年关税（禁止进口）（修正）令","en":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012","orig":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Larangan Import) (Pindaan) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Cấm nhập khẩu) (Sửa đổi) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (การห้ามนำเข้า) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Larangan Impor) (Perubahan) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2012_P.U.(A)156-2012_CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1559-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai\nImport) (Pindaan) 2012.\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 25 Mei 2012.\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1559-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Kas tam (Larangan Mengenai Import) 2008 [ P.U. (A) 86/2008 ], yang\ndisebut \"Perintah i bu\" da lam Perintah ini dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama dengan\nmemotong butiran 1 dan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengan butiran itu.\nPindaan Jadual Keempat"}},{"id":"MY-H1559-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Jadual Keempat Perintah ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 51\ndalam Bahagian 1 Jadual Keempat butiran yang berikut:\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\nItem\nNo.\nDescription of Goods Heading/\nSubheading\nCountry Manner of Import\n\"52. Articles bearing the\nimprint or reproduction\nof any currency note,\nbank note or coin which\nare current or have at\nany time been issued or\ncurrent in any country:\nAll countries That the import is\naccompanied by a\nletter of approval\nissued by or on behalf\nof the Minister of\nHome Affairs\n(a) Printing plates 8442.50 000\n(b) Die for stamping 8207.30 000 \".\n\nP .U. (A)156\nDibuat 24 Mei 2012\n[16 Sulit KE. HT(96)669/15-36 SK.48; Perb. 0.9060/Jld.28(SK.12); PN(PU2)338C/XVI]\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nP .U. (A)156\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\nCUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012\nIN exe rcise of the power s conferred by subsection 31(1) of the Customs Act 1967\n[Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H156"] = {"id":"MY-H156","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=135&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1961年合伙法","en":"PARTNERSHIP ACT 1961","orig":"PARTNERSHIP ACT 1961","vi":"Luật về Hợp danh năm 1961","th":"พระราชบัญญัติห้างหุ้นส่วน ค.ศ. 1961","id":"Undang-Undang Persekutuan Firma Tahun 1961","ms":"Akta Perkongsian 1961"},"level":"law","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT135","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1961","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\1961_135_PARTNERSHIP ACT 1961.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H156-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Short title.\n\nPART I\n\nPRELIMINARY"}},{"id":"MY-H156-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"chapter":{"en":"PART I"},"text":{"en":"2. Interpretation.\n\n2       No. 1 of 1961)       Partnership\n\n\\ PART II\nNATURE OF PARTNERSHIP\nSECTION"}},{"id":"MY-H156-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"chapter":{"en":"PART I"},"text":{"en":"3. Definition of partnership.\n4, Certain circumstances not prima facie partnerships.\n\n5; Postponement of rights of person lending or selling in COn\nsideration of share of profits in case of bankruptcy.\n\n6. Meaning of firm and firm-name.\n\nPART III\n\nRELATIONS OF PARTNERS TO PERSONS DEALING WITH THEM\n\n7. Power of partner to bind firm.\n\n8. Partners bound by acts on behalf of firm.\n\n9. Partner using credit of firm for private purposes.\n\n10. Effect of notice that firm will not be bound by acts of partner\n\n11. Liability of partners.\n\n12. Liability of firm for wrongs.\n\n13. Misapplication of money or property received for or in custody\nof tirm.\n\n14. Liability for wrongs joint and several.\n\n15. Improper employment of trust property for partnership\npurposes.\n\n16. Persons liable by \"holding out\".\n\n17. Admissions and representations of partner.\n\n18. Notice to acting partner to be notice to firm.\n\n19. Liability of incoming and out-going partners.\n\n20. Revocation of continuing guarantee by change in firm.\n\nPART IV\nRELATIONS OF PARTNERS TO ONE ANOTHER\n\n21. Variation by consent of terms of partnership.\n\n22. Partnership property.\n\n23. Property bought with partnership money.\n\n24. Conversion into personal estate of land held as partnership\nproperty.\n\n25. Procedure against partnership property for partner's separate\njudgment debt.\n\nPartnership      (No. 1 of 1961     3\n\nSECTION\n\n26. Rulds as to interests and duties of partners, subject to special\nagreement.\n\n27. Expulsion of partner.\n\n28. Retirement from partnershiv at will.\n\n29. Where partnership for term is continued over, continuance on\nold terms, presumed.\n\n30. Duty of partners to render accounts ete.\n\n31. Accountability of partners for private profits.\n\n32. Duty of partner not to compete with firm.\n\n33. Rights of assignee of share in partnership,\n\nPART V\n\nDISSOLUTION OF PARTNERSHIP AND ITS CONSEQUENCES\n\n34. Dissolution by expiration or notice.\n\n35. Dissolution by bankruptcy, death, or charge.\n\n36. Dissolution by illegality of partnership.\n\n37. Dissolution by the court.\n\n38. Rights of persons dealing with firm against apparent mem-\nbers of firm.                 ;\n\n39. Right of partner to notify dissolution.\n\n40. Continuing authority of partners for purposes of winding-up.\n\n41. Rights of partners as to application of partnership property.\n\n42. Apportionment of premium  where partnership prematurely\ndissolved.                                       ;\n\n43. Rights where partnership dissolved for.fraud or misrepresenta-\ntion.\n\n44. Rights of outgoing partner in certain ‘cases to share profits\nmade after dissolution.\n\n45. Retiring or deceased partner's share to be a debt.\n\n46. Rules for distribution of assets on final settlement of accounts.\n\n47. Saving.\n\nEnacted by the Legislature of North Borneo as follows:—"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1560"] = {"id":"MY-H1560","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2013&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年牙科（附表二修正）（第2号）令","en":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013","orig":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) (Bilangan 2) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Nha khoa (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) (số 2) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งทันตกรรม (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Kedokteran Gigi (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2013_P.U.(A)156-2013_DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1560-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan Jadual Kedua)\n\n(No. 2) 2013.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H1560-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Kedua kepada Akta dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas butiran\n\n\"Canada\" dan butiran yang berhubung dengannya butiran yang berikut:\n\nNegara yang\n\nmemberikan\n\nkelulusan\n\nInstitusi yang\n\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\nPerihal kelulusan\n\n\"Denmark University of Copenhagen Master of Sciences in\n\nDentistry\n\n(M. Sc.)\".\n\nDibuat 14 Mei 2013\n\n[KKM-60(20/2)/1/7; PN(PU2)93/IV]\n\nDATO' SRI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nDENTAL ACT 1971\n\nDENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(2) of the Dental Act 1971 [Act 51],\n\nthe Minister, after consulting the Council, makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1561"] = {"id":"MY-H1561","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2014&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年国民登记（修正）条例","en":"NATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014","orig":"NATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014","ms":"Peraturan Pendaftaran Negara (Pindaan) 2014","vi":"Quy định về Đăng ký quốc gia (Sửa đổi) năm 2014","th":"ข้อบังคับการขึ้นทะเบียนประชาชน (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Peraturan Registrasi Nasional (Perubahan) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)156-2014_NATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1561-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPendaftaran Negara (Pindaan) 2014.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Jun 2014.\n\nPindaan peraturan 5"}},{"id":"MY-H1561-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Pendaftaran Negara 1990 [P.U. (A) 472/1990] dipinda\n\ndalam peraturan 5—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"; dan\" di hujung subperenggan\n\n(3)(c)(ii) dengan tanda noktah;\n\n(b) dengan memotong perenggan (3)(d); dan\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas subperaturan (3) subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(3A) Walau apa pun subperaturan (3), dalam hal seseorang yang\n\ndidaftarkan di bawah Akta Pencegahan Jenayah 1959 [Akta 297],\n\nKetua Pengarah, selain boleh menyebabkan supaya dimasukkan\n\nke dalam kad pengenalan itu suatu kod atau maklumat yang sesuai,\n\nkad pengenalan yang dikeluarkan kepada orang itu hendaklah dalam\n\nwarna coklat.\".\n\nDibuat 9 April 2014\n\n[KDN(S):PP147/11/28/3 klt.6(16); PN(PU2)223/XII]\n\n DATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\n Menteri Dalam Negeri\n\nNATIONAL REGISTRATION ACT 1959\n\nNATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 6 of the National Registration Act 1959\n\n[Act 78], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1562"] = {"id":"MY-H1562","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年供应管制（管制物品）（第3号）令","en":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2016","orig":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang Kawalan) (Bilangan 3) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát nguồn cung (Hàng hóa được kiểm soát) (số 3) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมเสบียง (สิ่งของควบคุม) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Persediaan (Barang yang Dikendalikan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2016_P.U.(A)156-2016_CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1562-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Bekalan\n\n(Barang-Barang Kawalan) (No. 3) 2016.\n\nBarang-barang kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1562-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nbarang-barang kawalan bagi tempoh dari 14 Jun 2016 hingga 9 Jun 2017.\n\nJADUAL\n\nBARANG-BARANG KAWALAN\n\n1. Semua jenis mentega\n\n2. Semua jenis keju\n\n3. Semua jenis marjerin\n\n4. Semua jenis minuman kotak atau botol\n\n5. Semua jenis serbuk penaik dan esen membuat kuih-muih dan konfeksi\n\n6. Jeli dan agar-agar\n\n7. Daging dan jeroan mentah (segar atau dijeruk)\n\n8. Itik dan burung-burung lain, tidak termasuk ayam\n\n9. Telur dan telur diawet\n\n10. Buah-buahan mentah yang diimport (segar atau dijeruk)\n\n11. Bawang besar dan bawang merah\n\n12. Bawang putih\n\n13. Cili kering\n\n14. Lada hitam dan semua jenis rempah\n\n15. Kelapa (sebiji atau yang diparut)\n\n16. Semua jenis kacang pea dan kacang\n\n17. Semua jenis kacang tanah\n\n18. Cendawan dan kulat\n\n19. Minyak sapi\n\n20. Asam jawa\n\n21. Makanan laut (dikeringkan atau dijeruk)\n\n22. Tepung beras\n\n23. Tepung jagung\n\n24. Tepung beras pulut\n\n25. Ubi kentang\n\nDibuat 10 Jun 2016\n\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/13; PN(PU2)188/X]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\n\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri,\n\nKoperasi dan Kepenggunaan\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES ACT 1961\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the Control of Supplies Act 1961\n\n[Act 122], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Control of Supplies (Controlled Articles)\n\n(No. 3) Order 2016.\n\nControlled articles\n\n2. The articles specified in the Schedule are declared to be controlled articles for\n\nthe period from 14 June 2016 to 9 June 2017.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nCONTROLLED ARTICLES\n\n1. All types of butter\n\n2. All types of cheese\n\n3. All types of margarine\n\n4. All types of packed or bottled drinks\n\n5. All types of baking powder and essences for making cakes and\n\nconfectionery\n\n6. Jelly and agar-agar\n\n7. Raw meat and offal (fresh or preserved)\n\n8. Duck and other birds, excluding chicken\n\n9. Eggs and preserved eggs\n\n10. Raw imported fruits (fresh or preserved)\n\n11. Onion and shallot\n\n12. Garlic\n\n13. Dried chillies\n\n14. Black pepper and all types of spices\n\n15. Coconuts (whole or scraped)\n\n16. All types of peas and beans\n\n17. All types of groundnuts\n\n18. Mushroom and fungi\n\n19. Ghee\n\n20. Tamarind\n\n21. Seafood (dried or preserved)\n\n22. Rice flour\n\n23. Corn flour\n\n24. Glutinous rice flour\n\n25. Potatoes\n\nMade 10 June 2016\n\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/13; PN(PU2)188/X]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\n\nMinister of Domestic Trade,\n\nCo-operatives and Consumerism"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1563"] = {"id":"MY-H1563","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年纳闽商业活动税（豁免）（2013年）（修正）令","en":"LABUAN BUSINESS ACTIVITY TAX (EXEMPTION) 2013 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2017","orig":"LABUAN BUSINESS ACTIVITY TAX (EXEMPTION) 2013 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan Labuan (Pengecualian) (Tahun 2013) (Pindaan) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế hoạt động kinh doanh Labuan (Miễn trừ) (năm 2013) (Sửa đổi) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งภาษีกิจกรรมทางธุรกิจลาบวน (การยกเว้น) (ค.ศ. 2013) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Pajak Kegiatan Usaha Labuan (Pembebasan) (Tahun 2013) (Perubahan) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2017_P.U.(A)156-2017_LABUAN BUSINESS ACTIVITY TAX (EXEMPTION) 2013 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1563-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bo lehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan\nLabuan (Pengecualian) 2013 (Pindaan) 2017.\n\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa mulai tahun\ntaksiran 2013 dan tahun-tahun taksiran yang berikutnya.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H1563-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan Labuan (Pengecualian) 2013\n[P.U. (A) 99/2013 ] dipinda dalam perenggan 2 dengan menggantikan takrif\n\"aktiviti yang layak\" dengan takrif yang berikut:\n\n ‘ \"aktiviti yang layak\" ertinya perdagangan dengan syarikat bukan pemastautin\ndalam mata wang selain mata wang Malaysia bagi produk fizikal dan instrumen terbitan\nyang berkaitan berhubung dengan gas asli cecair.'.\n\nDibuat 23 Mei 2017\n[Perb.(C)0.217(SJ.21)JLD.8(SK.5)A; LHDN.01/35/(S)/42/51/360 KULIT 6;\nPN(PU2)491/II]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 26(2) Akta Cukai Aktiviti\nPerniagaan Labuan 1990]\n\nLABUAN BUSINESS ACTIVITY TAX ACT 1990\n\nLABUAN BUSINESS ACTIVITY TAX (EXEMPTION) 2013 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the power s conferred by subsection 26(1) of the\nLabuan Business Activity Tax Act  1990 [ Act 445 ], the Minister makes the following\norder:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1564"] = {"id":"MY-H1564","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年所得税（加速资本免税额）（信息通信技术设备）规则","en":"INCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE) (INFORMATION AND COMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGY EQUIPMENT) RULES 2018","orig":"INCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE) (INFORMATION AND COMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGY EQUIPMENT) RULES 2018","ms":"Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Elaun Modal Dipercepat) (Peralatan Teknologi Maklumat dan Komunikasi) 2018","vi":"Quy tắc về Thuế thu nhập (Khấu trừ vốn được gia tốc) (Thiết bị công nghệ thông tin và truyền thông) năm 2018","th":"กฎภาษีเงินได้ (ค่าเผื่อทุนแบบเร่งรัด) (อุปกรณ์เทคโนโลยีสารสนเทศและการสื่อสาร) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Tata Tertib Pajak Penghasilan (Tunjangan Modal Dipercepat) (Peralatan Teknologi Informasi dan Komunikasi) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)156-2018_INCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE) (INFORMATION AND COMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGY EQUIPMENT).txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1564-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1)  Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Cukai\nPendapatan (Elaun Modal Dipercepat)  (Kelengkapan Teknolo gi Maklumat dan\nKomunikasi) 2018.\n\n(2)  Kaedah-Kaedah ini disifatkan telah mu la berkuat kuasa mulai tahun\ntaksiran 2017.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H1564-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  Dalam Kaedah-Kaedah ini—\n\n\"kelengkapan teknologi maklumat dan komunikasi\" ertinya kelengkapan\nteknologi maklumat dan komunikasi sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual;\n\n\"pembelian apa -apa kelengk apan teknologi maklumat dan komunikasi\"\ntermasuklah pemasangan kelengkapan itu.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H1564-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3.  Kaedah-Kaedah ini terpakai bagi seseorang pemastautin di Malaysia, berkenaan\ndengan perbelanjaan modal yang dilakukan oleh orang itu dalam tempoh asas bagi\nsuatu tahun taksiran daripada suatu punca yang terdiri daripada perniagaan nya\nberhubung dengan  pembelian apa -apa kelengkapan teknologi maklumat dan\nkomunikasi yang digunakan bagi maksud perniagaan itu.\n\nElaun permulaan"}},{"id":"MY-H1564-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4.  Orang yang disebut dalam kaedah 3 lay ak untuk mendapat elaun permulaan\nyang diperuntukkan dalam perenggan 10 Jadual 3 kepada Akta yang hendaklah\nbersamaan dengan satu per lima daripada perbelanjaan moda l yang dilakukan bagi\npembelian apa-apa kelengkapan teknologi maklumat dan komunikasi.\n\nElaun tahunan"}},{"id":"MY-H1564-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5.  Orang yang disebut dalam kaedah 3 layak untuk mendapat elaun tahunan yang\ndiperuntukkan dalam perenggan 15 Jadual 3 kepada Akta yang hendaklah bersamaan\ndengan satu per lima daripada perbelanjaan modal yang dilakukan bagi pembelian\napa-apa kelengkapan teknologi maklumat dan komunikasi.\n\nKetidakpakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H1564-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6.  Kaedah-Kaedah ini tidak terpakai bagi seseorang yang telah melakukan\nperbelanjaan modal ke atas kelengkapan teknologi maklumat dan komunikasi bagi\ntempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran ji ka dalam tempoh asas tersebut orang itu layak\ndan telah menuntut berkenaan dengan kelengkapan teknologi maklumat dan\nkomunikasi itu—\n\n(a)  elaun cukai pelaburan  di bawah Akta Penggalakan Pelaburan 1986\n[Akta 327];\n\n(b)  elaun pelaburan semula di bawah Jadual 7A Akta;\n\n(c) elaun pelaburan bagi sektor perkhidmatan di bawah Jadual 7B Akta;\n\n(d)  elaun modal dipercepat di bawah mana-mana kaedah-kaedah yang dibuat\ndi bawah seksyen 154 Akta; atau\n\n(e)  pengecualian cukai di bawah mana -mana perintah yang dibua t di bawah\nseksyen 127 Akta  berkenaan dengan pendapatan berkanun orang itu\n\nyang bersamaan dengan sebahagian atau keseluruhan amaun\nperbelanjaan modal yang layak yang dilakukan oleh orang itu.\n\nJADUAL\n[Kaedah 2]\n\nSistem kawalan laluan masuk\nSistem perbankan\nKelengkapan kod bar\nPeletus/pengumpul aing\nKabel dan penyambung\nReka Bentuk Bantuan Komputer (CAD)\nPembuatan Bantuan Komputer (CAM)\nKejuruteraan Bantuan Komputer (CAE)\nPembaca kad\nKomputer dan komponen\nUnit Pemprosesan Pusat (CPU)\nStoran\nSkrin\nPencetak\nPengimbas/pembaca\nAksesori\nKomunikasi dan rangkaian\nSistem perisian atau pakej perisian\n\nDibuat 27 Jun 2018\n[Perb. CR(8.09)681/2-61(SJ.18)JLD.14(SK.9); LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1/7(21); PN(PU2)80/XCI]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subsek syen 154(2)\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE)\n(INFORMATION AND COMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGY EQUIPMENT) RULES 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 154(1) (b) of,\nand paragraphs 10 and 15 of Schedule 3 to , the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53 ],\nthe Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1.  (1)  These rules may be cited as the Income Tax (Accelerated Capital\nAllowance) (Information and Communication Technology Eq uipment)\nRules 2018.\n\n(2)  These Rules are deemed to have effect from the year of assessment 2017.\n\nInterpretation\n2.  In these Rules—\n\n \"information and communication technology equipment\" means information and\ncommunication technology equipment as specified in the Schedule;\n\n\"purchase of any information and communication technology equipment\"\nincludes the installation of such equipment.\n\nApplication\n3.  These Rules apply to a resident in Malaysia, in respect of capital expenditur e\nincurred by such person  in the basis period for a year of assessment from a source\nconsisting of his business in relation to  the purchase of any information and\ncommunication technology equipment used for the purpose of that business.\n\nInitial allowance\n4.  The person referred to in rule 3 qualifies for an initial allowance as provided for\nin paragraph 10 of Schedule 3 to the Act which shall be equal to one -fifth of the capital\nexpenditure incurred for the purchase of any information and communication\ntechnology equipment.\n\nAnnual allowance\n5.  The person referred to in rule 3 qualifies for an annual allowance as provided for\nin paragraph 15 of Schedule 3 to the Act wh ich shall be equal to one -fifth of the capital\nexpenditure incurred for the purchase of  any information and communication\ntechnology equipment.\n\nNon-application\n6.  These Rules shall not apply to a person who has incurred qualifying capital\nexpenditure on an information and communication technology equipment for a basis\nperiod for a year of assessment where during that basis period the person is eligible and\nhas claimed in respect of that information and communication technology equipment—\n\n(a)  investment tax allowance  under the Promotion of Investments Act 1986\n[Act 327];\n\n(b)  reinvestment allowance under Schedule 7A to the Act;\n\n(c)  investment allowance for service sector under Schedule 7B to the Act;\n\n(d)  accelerated capital allowance  under any rules made under\nsection 154 of the Act; or\n\n(e)  tax exemption under any or der made under section 127 of the Act  in\nrespect of his statutory income which is equivalent to any part or the\nwhole of the amount of the qualifying capital expenditure incurred by the\nperson.\n\nSCHEDULE\n[Rule 2]\n\nAccess control system\nBanking systems\nBarcode equipment\nBursters/decollators\nCables and connectors\nComputer Assisted Design (CAD)\nComputer Assisted Manufacturing (CAM)\nComputer Assisted Engineering (CAE)\nCard readers\nComputers and components\nCentral Processing Units (CPU)\nStorages\nScreens\nPrinters\nScanners/readers\nAccessories\nCommunications and networks\nSoftware systems or software packages\n\nMade 27 June 2018\n[Perb. CR(8.09)681/2-61(SJ.18)JLD.14(SK.9); LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1/7(21); PN(PU2)80/XCI]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMinister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 1 54(2) of the\nIncome Tax Act 1967]"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1565"] = {"id":"MY-H1565","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年价格管制与反暴利（管制商品标价）（第2号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2020","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barang Kawalan Harga) (Bilangan 2) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Niêm yết giá hàng hóa thuộc diện kiểm soát giá) (số 2) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การแสดงราคาสินค้าควบคุมราคา) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barang yang Dikendalikan Harganya) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)156-2020_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 202.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1565-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barangan Harga Terkawal) (No. 2) 2020.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini b erkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai  20 Mei 2020\nhingga  3 Jun 2020.\n\nPenandaan harga"}},{"id":"MY-H1565-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Mana-mana orang yang  menjual atau menawarkan untuk menjual apa-apa\nbarangan harga terkawal yang disiarkan dalam Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan ( Penentuan Harga Maksi mum) (No. 3) 2020 [P.U. (A) 155/2020]\nhendaklah meletakkan label berwarna merah jambu yang menunjukkan harga bagi\nsetiap unit atau setiap unit timbangan, nama yang memerihalkan barangan  harga\nterkawal itu dan gred atau kualiti, jika ada, bagi barangan harga terkawal itu.\n\n (2) Mana-mana orang yang tidak mematuhi subperenggan (1) melakukan suatu\nkesalahan dan boleh, apabila disabitkan—\n\n(a) jika orang itu suatu pertubuhan perbadanan, didenda tidak melebihi\ndua puluh ribu ringgit dan, bagi kesalahan kali yang  kedua atau yang\nberikutnya, didenda tidak melebihi lima puluh ribu ringgit; atau\n\n(b) jika orang itu bukan suatu pertubuhan perbadanan, didenda tidak\nmelebihi sepuluh ribu ringgit dan, bagi kesalahan kali yang kedua atau\nyang berikutnya, didenda tidak melebihi dua puluh ribu ringgit.\n\nDibuat 18 Mei 2020\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/XXVI]\n\nDATUK ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri\ndan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 10 of the\nPrice Control and  Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Minister makes\nthe following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1566"] = {"id":"MY-H1566","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2021&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":10,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年传染病预防与控制（疫区地方措施）（复苏式行动管制）（第3号）（修正）（第6号）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (RECOVERY MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 3) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (RECOVERY MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 3) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) REGULATIONS 2021","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Các biện pháp trong khu vực bị nhiễm bệnh) (Kiểm soát di chuyển phục hồi) (số 3) (Sửa đổi) (số 6) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (มาตรการในท้องที่ที่ติดเชื้อ) (การควบคุมการเคลื่อนย้ายระยะฟื้นฟู) (ฉบับที่ 3) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Tindakan di Wilayah Lokal Terinfeksi) (Pengendalian Pergerakan Pemulihan) (Nomor 3) (Perubahan) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2021","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah dalam Kawasan Tempatan Berjangkit) (Kawalan Pergerakan Pemulihan) (Bilangan 3) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 6) 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 10 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)156-2021_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (RECOVERY.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1566-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Negeri Kedah kecuali Daerah Kuala Muda 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Negeri Melaka 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Negeri Sembilan kecuali Daerah Seremban 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nKawasan Tempatan Jangkitan/Bahagian/Daerah\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. Negeri Pahang 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Negeri Perak 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. Negeri Perlis 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. Negeri Sabah kecuali Daerah Keningau 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. Negeri Terengganu 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. Wilayah Persekutuan Putrajaya 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1566-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"en":"10. Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\".\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (RECOVERY MOVEMENT CONTROL)\n\n(NO. 3) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of\n\nthe Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342],\n\nthe Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control of\n\nInfectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas) (Recovery Movement\n\nControl) (No. 3) (Amendment) (No. 6) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 April 2021.\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule\n\n2. The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (Recovery Movement Control) (No. 3) Regulations 2021\n\n[P.U. (A) 98/2021] are amended by substituting for the First Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\nAPPLICATION\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n1. State of Kedah except Kuala Muda District 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n2. State of Malacca 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n3. State of Negeri Sembilan except Seremban District 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n4. State of Pahang 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n5. State of Perak 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n6. State of Perlis 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n7. State of Sabah except Keningau District 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n8. State of Terengganu 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n9. Federal Territory of Putrajaya 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\n\n10. Federal Territory of Labuan 1.4.2021 – 14.4.2021\".\n\nMade 31 March 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1567"] = {"id":"MY-H1567","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年关税（禁止进口）（修正）（第3号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2022","orig":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Larangan Import) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 3) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Cấm nhập khẩu) (Sửa đổi) (số 3) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (การห้ามนำเข้า) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Larangan Impor) (Perubahan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2022_P.U.(A)156-2022_CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1567-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai\nImport) (Pindaan) (No. 3) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 17 Mei 2022.\n\nPindaan Jadual Ketiga"}},{"id":"MY-H1567-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Kastam (Larangan  Mengenai Import) 2017 [ P.U. (A) 103/2017 ]\ndipinda dalam Jadual Ketiga—\n\n(a) dalam Bahagian I, berhubung dengan butiran 67,  dalam ruang (5) ,\ndengan menggantikan subbutiran dan butir -butir yang berhubungan\ndengannya dengan subbutiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(5)\nManner of Import\n\n\"That the import is accompanied by an import license issued by\nthe Director General except for goods—\n\n(i) in the course of transhipment in a full container load;\n\n(ii) intended for private consumption; or\n\n(iii) intended for the official use of the embassy, consular office or\ninternational organization\"\n\n;\n\n(b) dalam Bahagian II, berhubung dengan butiran 1, dalam ruang (5),\nberhubung dengan subbutiran C(a)—\n\n(i) dalam perenggan (ii), dengan memotong perkataan \"or\";\n\n(ii) dalam perenggan (iii), dengan memasukkan selepas\nperkataan \"organizations\" perkataan \"; or\"; dan\n\n(iii) dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (iii) perenggan\nyang berikut:\n\n\"(iv) transit for the sole purpose of being carried out to\nanother country\"; dan\n\n(c) dalam Bahagian II, berhubung dengan butiran 3, dalam ruang (5) ,\ndengan menggantikan sub butiran dan butir -butir yang berhubungan\ndengannya dengan subbutiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(5)\nManner of Import\n\n\"Every bottle, can, keg or other container of the goods must be affixed\nwith tax stamp approved by the Director General except:\n\n(i) in the course of transhipment in a full container load;\n\n(ii) intended for private consumption;\n\n(iii) intended for the official use of the embassy, consular office or\ninternational organization;\n\n(iv) transit for the sole purpose of being carried out to\nanother country; or\n\n(5)\nManner of Import\n\n(v) for the purpose of affixing tax stamp at the places or premises\napproved by the Director General\"\n\n.\n\nDibuat 11 Mei 2022\n[SULIT KE.HT (96)669/15-36 Klt.19 Sk.13;  MOF.TAX (S) 700-2/1/16 JLD.9;  PN(PU2)338C/XXX]\n\n        TENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n                                                 Menteri Kewangan\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 3) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 31(1) of the\nCustoms Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1568"] = {"id":"MY-H1568","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年供应管制（管制物品）（第3号）令","en":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023","orig":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang Kawalan) (Bilangan 3) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát nguồn cung (Hàng hóa được kiểm soát) (số 3) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมเสบียง (สิ่งของควบคุม) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Persediaan (Barang yang Dikendalikan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2023_P.U.(A)156-2023_CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1568-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Bekalan\n\n(Barang-Barang Kawalan) (No. 3) 2023.\n\nBarang-barang kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1568-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nbarang-barang kawalan bagi tempoh mulai 27 Mei 2023 hingga 4 Jun 2023.\n\nJADUAL\n\nBARANG-BARANG KAWALAN\n\n1. Daging kerbau import (India) (tidak termasuk bahagian batang pinang)\n\n2. Kepak ayam\n\n3. Kubis bulat import (Indonesia dan China, tidak termasuk kubis Beijing)\n\n4. Babi hidup\n\n5. Daging babi (perut)\n\n6. Daging babi (daging dan lemak)\n\nDibuat 17 Mei 2023\n\n[KPDN (PGK) (S) 0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/Jld. 18]\n\n DATUK SERI SALAHUDDIN BIN AYUB\n\n Menteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Kos Sara Hidup\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES ACT 1961\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 3) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the\n\nControl of Supplies Act 1961 [Act 122], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Control of Supplies\n\n(Controlled Articles) (No. 3) Order 2023.\n\nControlled articles\n\n2. The articles specified in the Schedule are declared to be controlled articles\n\nfor the period from 27 May 2023 to 4 June 2023.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nCONTROLLED ARTICLES\n\n1. Imported buffalo meat (India) (not including tenderloin)\n\n2. Chicken wing\n\n3. Imported round cabbage (Indonesia and China, not including\n\nBeijing cabbage)\n\n4. Live pig\n\n5. Pork (belly)\n\n6. Pork (lean and fat)\n\nMade 17 May 2023\n\n[KPDN (PGK) (S) 0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/Jld. 18]\n\n DATUK SERI SALAHUDDIN BIN AYUB\n\n Minister of Domestic Trade and Cost of Living"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1569"] = {"id":"MY-H1569","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年联邦道路（砂拉越）（修正）（第5号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 5) ORDER 2024","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 5) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Sarawak) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 5) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Sarawak) (Sửa đổi) (số 5) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (ซาราวัก) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 5) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Sarawak) (Perubahan) (Nomor 5) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2024_P.U.(A)156-2024_FEDERAL ROADS (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 5) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1569-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Sarawak)\n\n(Pindaan) (No. 5) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 14 Jun 2024.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1569-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Sarawak) 1996 [P.U. (A) 551/1996], yang disebut\n\n\"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama, di bawah kepala\n\nLEBUH RAYA PAN BORNEO, dengan memasukkan selepas butiran (jm)\n\nbutiran yang berikut:\n\n\"(jn) (Laluan 1): Lapangan Terbang Sibu-Jambatan Sungai Kua\n\nBermula di koordinat U 2.273565, T 111.962425 dan berakhir\n\ndi koordinat U 2.447042, T 112.268941 termasuk jalan sambungannya\n\ndi dalam sempadan hak lalu lalang sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan\n\ndalam PETA LAPANGAN TERBANG SIBU-JAMBATAN SUNGAI KUA\n\n(jarak sepanjang 45.776 km). \".\n\nPindaan Jadual Ketiga"}},{"id":"MY-H1569-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Ketiga dengan memasukkan selepas\n\nPETA LADANG ALAM BUMI-SIMPANG LADANG TIGA peta yang berikut:\n\n\"PETA LAPANGAN TERBANG SIBU-JAMBATAN SUNGAI KUA\n\nDibuat 10 Jun 2024\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/23; PN(PU2)391/JLD.49]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\n\".\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (SARAWAK) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 5) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Federal Roads Act 1959\n\n[Act 376], the Minister, after consultation with the State Government of Sarawak,\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H157"] = {"id":"MY-H157","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=13&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1960年法定声明法","en":"STATUTORY DECLARATIONS ACT 1960","orig":"STATUTORY DECLARATIONS ACT 1960","vi":"Luật về Tuyên bố theo luật định năm 1960","th":"พระราชบัญญัติถ้อยคำแถลงตามกฎหมาย ค.ศ. 1960","id":"Undang-Undang Pernyataan Resmi Tahun 1960","ms":"Akta Akuan Berkanun 1960"},"level":"law","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT13","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1960","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\1960_13_STATUTORY DECLARATIONS ACT 1960.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H157-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Statutory Declarations Act,"}},{"id":"MY-H157-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. It shall be lawful for any President of a Sessions Court,\nMagistrate, Commissioner for Oaths or, subject to the\nprovisions of section 4 of the Notaries Public Ordinance,\n1959, any notary public appointed under the Notaries Public\nOrdinance, 1959, to take and receive the declaration of any\nperson voluntarily making the same in Malay or English in\nthe form in the Schedule."}},{"id":"MY-H157-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Declarations made by virtue of the provisions of this Act\nshall be deemed to be such declarations as are referred to\nin sections 199 and 200 of the Penal Code.\n\n4, A person making any declaration by virtue of the\nprovisions of this Act shall pay to the officer or Commis-\nsioner taking the same such fees as the Minister may\nfrom time to time by notification in the Gazette prescribe."}},{"id":"MY-H157-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Any reference in any federal law in force in Sabah to the\nStatutory Declarations Ordinance of Sabah and any\nreference in any federal law in force in Sarawak to the\nStatutory Declarations Ordinance of Sarawak or to the\nStatutory Declarations Act, 1835, of the United Kingdom,\nshall be deemed to be a reference to this Act.\n\nShort title.\n\nForm of\nDeclaration.\n\n41/59.\n\nFalse decla-\nration\npunishable\nunder\n\nPenal Code.\nF.M.S.\n\nCap. 45,\nSabah 3/59,\nSwk, Cap.\n\nFees.\n\nReferences\nin Sabah\nand\nSarawak\nfederal laws\nto repealed\naws,\n\nCap. 138,\nCap. 52.\n5&6Wm.,\nIV,C, 62,\n\n[Sch.]\n\n4                   Act [3\n\nSCHEDULE\n(Section 2)\nIn Malay\nBORANG AKUAN\nSaya, oo. cccccccecccceeececesseeeeesestseeeeettraasase dengan sa-sunggoh dan\nSa-benar-nya mengaku bahawa ........:cccscccssssscsssereeesensenenereseseeees\n\nUNE Eee eee eee reer eee eee e eee EEE HEE EEE ETE HEHE OE EE REET ETOH OEE E OHO EHE TEESE ETRE EES HE EH OO EE\n\ndan saya membuat akuan ini dengan keperchayaan bahawa apa?\nyang tersebut di-dalam-nya ada-lah benar, serta menurut Akta Akuan\nBerkanun, 1960.\n\nDi-perbuat dan dengan sa-benar™nya di-aku\noleh yang tersebut nama-nya di-atas ia-itu\n\neee meee reer et erat HOT NI sne nan sees coer rere sees eerseeee sees\n\npada ............... hadbalan wan sana\n\n(Tandatangan Yang di-Pertua,\nMahkamah Seshen, Mejisteret\natau Pesurohjaya Sumpah)   |\n\nIn English\nFORM OF DECLARATION\n\nPTUPERUSULESELERERERETESESERESE EEO SE RECS EEC eECOTCC Eee eee ee ee eee ee errr ere reer rere rere ers Sry\n\nand I make this solemn declaration conscientiously believing the same\nto be true, and by virtue of the provisions of the Statutory Declarations\nAct, 1960.\n\nSubscribed and solemnly declared-by the above: |\n\nTAME\" ooo... ee en errr nennen anakan naaa\nQl esse R———— MR\nin the State Of.......... memana naaana\nthis a. day 0E A ea\nL9...\n\nBefore me,\n\n(Sienature of President of Sessions\nCourt, Magistrate or Commis-\nsioner for Oaths\n\n[List of Amendments)\nLAWS OF MALAYSIA\nAct 13\n\nSTATUTORY DECLARATIONS ACT, 1960\n(Revised—1969)\n\nParticulars under section 7 (ii) and (iii) of the Revision\nof Laws Act, 1968 (Act 1)\n\nLIST OF AMENDMENTS\n\nAmending law                                 Short title                       In force from\n\nP.U. 488/1968 ...    ... Modification of Laws (Statu- 28-11-1968\ntory Declarations) (Modifi-\ncation and Extension to\nBorneo States) Order, 1968\n\nLIST OF LAWS OR PARTS THEREOF SUPERSEDED\n\nNo.                   Title\n20 of 1960 ... Statutory Declarations Act, 1960\n\nKUALA LUDLPUR\nDI-CHETAK OLEH PENCHETAR KERAJAAN DAN DI-TERBITKAN DENGAN PERENTAB PADA\nSHB APRIL, 1970\n\nHarga: 75 sen"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
