  FT["MY-H1571"] = {"id":"MY-H1571","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 156/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年移民（豁免）（第8号）令","en":"IMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026","orig":"IMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Imigresen (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 8) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Xuất nhập cảnh (Miễn trừ) (số 8) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งการตรวจคนเข้าเมือง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 8) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Imigrasi (Pembebasan) (Nomor 8) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA156","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)156-2026_IMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1571-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Imigresen (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 8) 2026.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1571-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan mana-mana orang yang memasuki Malaysia\n\nmelalui darat dari Thailand melalui Jalan Betong (Thailand)/Kroh dan berada\n\ndi jalan ini hingga tiba di Pos Kawalan Imigresen, Bukit Berapit daripada pemakaian\n\nperaturan 36 Peraturan-Peraturan Imigresen, 1963 [L.N. 228/63].\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2026\n\n[KDN.IM.S.600-1/3/4 Jld.19(10); PN(PU2)100/JLD.19]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nIMMIGRATION ACT 1959/63\n\nIMMIGRATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 55 of the Immigration Act 1959/63\n\n[Act 155], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1572"] = {"id":"MY-H1572","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 157/2011&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年关税（计价）（棕榈油）（第19号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 19) ORDER 2011","orig":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 19) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Nilai) (Minyak Sawit) (Bilangan 19) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Trị giá) (Dầu cọ) (số 19) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (มูลค่า) (น้ำมันปาล์ม) (ฉบับที่ 19) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Nilai) (Minyak Kelapa Sawit) (Nomor 19) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA157","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2011_P.U.(A)157-2011_CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 19) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1572-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Nilai -Nilai) (Minyak\nKelapa Sawit) (No. 19) 2011 dan hendaklah mula berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari\n9 Mei 2011 hingga 15 Mei 2011.\nPemungutan dan pembayaran duti kastam"}},{"id":"MY-H1572-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Bagi maksud pemungutan dan pembayaran duti -duti kastam, menurut\nperuntukan-peruntukan Perintah Duti Kastam 2007 [ P.U. (A) 441/2007], nilai bagi tiap -\ntiap satu barang berduti yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) dan (2) Jadu al mengikut\nunitnya yang tersebut dalam ruang (3) hendaklah nilai yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (4).\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\nCUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 19) ORDER 2011\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 12 of the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235], the\nMinister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\nBarang\n(Goods)\n(1)\nSubkepala\n(Subheading)\n(2)\nUnit\n(Unit)\n(3)\nNilai\n(Value)\n(4)\nCrude Palm Oil 1511.10 100 tonne RM3,375.77\nDibuat 6 Mei 2011\nMade 6 May 2011\n[KE.HT(94)819/03-6/KLT. 10(24); Perb.(8.20)116/1-4; PN(PU2)338/XXVIII]\nDengan arahan Menteri Kewangan.\nBy direction of the Minister of Finance.\nBagi pihak dan atas nama Menteri Kewangan/\nOn behalf and in the name of the Minister of Finance\nDATO' SITI HALIMAH BINTI ISMAIL\nSetiausaha\nBahagian Analisa Cukai"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
