  FT["MY-H1714"] = {"id":"MY-H1714","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 165/2011&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年关税（计价）（原油）（第10号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (CRUDE PETROLEUM OIL) (NO. 10) ORDER 2011","orig":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (CRUDE PETROLEUM OIL) (NO. 10) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Nilai) (Minyak Mentah Petroleum) (Bilangan 10) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Trị giá) (Dầu thô) (số 10) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (มูลค่า) (น้ำมันดิบ) (ฉบับที่ 10) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Nilai) (Minyak Bumi Mentah) (Nomor 10) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA165","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2011_P.U.(A)165-2011_CUSTOMS (VALUES) (CRUDE PETROLEUM OIL) (NO. 10) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1714-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Nilai -Nilai) (Minyak Mentah\nPetroleum) (No. 10) 2011 dan hendaklah mula berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari\n19 Mei 2011  hingga 1 Jun 2011.\nPemungutan dan pembayaran duti kastam"}},{"id":"MY-H1714-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Bagi maksud pemungutan dan pembayaran duti -duti kastam, menurut\nperuntukan-peruntukan Perintah Duti Kastam 2007 [P.U. (A) 441/2007], nilai bagi tiap-tiap\nsatu barang berduti yang diny atakan dalam ruang (1) dan (2) Jadual mengikut unitnya\nyang tersebut dalam ruang (3) hendaklah nilai yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (4).\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\nCUSTOMS (VALUES) (CRUDE PETROLEUM OIL) (NO. 10) ORDER 2011\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 12 of the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235], the\nMinister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\nBarang\n(Goods)\n(1)\nSubkepala\n(Subheading)\n(2)\nUnit\n(Unit)\n(3)\nNilai\n(Value)\n(4)\nTapis Blend 2709.00.100 per barrel RM350.44\nLabuan Crude 2709.00.100 per barrel RM350.44\nMiri Light Crude 2709.00.100 per barrel RM350.44\nDulang 2709.00.100 per barrel RM349.56\nBintulu Crude 2709.00.100 per barrel RM349.56\nTerengganu Condensate 2709.00.900 per barrel RM346.90\nBintulu Condensate 2709.00.900 per barrel RM347.20\nMasa 2709.00.100 per barrel RM350.44\nAsam Paya 2709.00.100 per barrel RM350.50\nKidurong 2709.00.100 per barrel RM280.46\nPenara Blend 2709.00.100 per barrel RM341.20\nMinyak Mentah Fairley Baram 2709.00.100 per barrel RM216.34\nCakerawala Condensate 2709.00.900 per barrel RM350.83\nAngsi Crude 2709.00.100 per barrel RM301.95\nCendor Crude 2709.00.100 per barrel RM305.88\nAbu Blend 2709.00.100 per barrel RM339.31\nKikeh Crude 2709.00.100 per barrel RM352.30\nBunga Orkid 2709.00.100 per barrel RM351.36\nBunga Kekwa 2709.00.100 per barrel RM326.88\nMuda Condensate 2709.00.900 per barrel RM298.56\nDibuat 13 Mei 2011\nMade 13 May 2011\n[KE. HT(94)819/01-1/Klt. 13/(10); R.9003/54Z-40; PN(PU2)338/XXVIII]\nDengan arahan Menteri Kewangan.\nBy direction of the Minister of Finance.\nBagi pihak dan atas nama Menteri Kewangan/\nOn behalf and in the name of the Minister of Finance\nDATO' SITI HALIMAH BINTI ISMAIL\nSetiausaha\nBahagian Analisa Cukai"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
