  FT["MY-H1792"] = {"id":"MY-H1792","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 16/2019&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年联邦道路（西马来西亚）（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Semenanjung Malaysia) (Pindaan) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Malaysia Barat) (Sửa đổi) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (มาเลเซียตะวันตก) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Malaysia Barat) (Perubahan) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA16","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en；已清除正文中的 1 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2019_P.U.(A)16-2019_FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1792-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Malaysia Barat) (Pindaan) 2019.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Januari 2019.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1792-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Malaysia Barat) 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] dipinda\n\ndalam Jadual Pertama di bawah kepala \"Negeri Kedah Darul Aman\"—\n\n(a) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 64 butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"65. (Laluan 270): Jalan Sungai Layar-Semeling\n\nDari persimpangannya dengan Laluan 257, Jalan Lencongan Barat\n\ndi koordinat U 5.676093, T 100.471106 dan berakhir\n\ndi persimpangan dengan Laluan K1, Jalan Bedong-Singkir\n\ndi koordinat U 5.706145, T 100.473238 di dalam sempadan hak\n\nlalu-lalang sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam PETA: JALAN\n\nSUNGAI LAYAR-SEMELING (jarak sepanjang 3.46 km).\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas PETA: JALAN SULTAN ABDUL HALIM,\n\nPULAU LANGKAWI peta yang berikut:\n\nJalan BedongSingkir\n\n\"PETA: JALAN SUNGAI LAYAR-SEMELING\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\nDibuat 14 Januari 2019\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/4 Jld.2; PN(PU2)426/LXVII]\n\nPETUNJUK:\n\nJALAN YANG DIWARTAKAN\n\nSEBAGAI JALAN PERSEKUTUAN\n\nJALAN NEGERI\n\nJALAN PERSEKUTUAN\n\nU 5.706145\n\nT 100.473238\n\nNOMBOR LALUAN\n\nKOORDINAT\n\nK167\n\n\".\n\nJalan Lencongan Barat\n\nU 5.676093\n\nT 100.471106\n\nK1\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the\n\nFederal Roads Act 1959 [Act 376], the Minister, after consultation with the\n\nState Government of Kedah, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1793"] = {"id":"MY-H1793","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 16/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2020","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA16","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)16-2020_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1793-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinama kan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) 2020.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 20 Januari 20 20\nhingga 2 Februari 2020.\n\nHarga pengeluar maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H1793-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga pengeluar maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan\ndalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,\nNegeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut\nkawasan dan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H1793-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Pers ekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan\ndan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H1793-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Ketiga bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan\ndan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
