  FT["MY-H1862"] = {"id":"MY-H1862","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 174/2013&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年贷款担保（法人团体）（税收与印花税豁免）（第3号）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 3) ORDER 2013","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 3) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Korporat) (Remisi Cukai dan Duti Setem) (Bilangan 3) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Pháp nhân) (Giảm miễn thuế và thuế tem) (số 3) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (นิติบุคคล) (การงดเว้นภาษีและอากรแสตมป์) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Hukum) (Pembebasan Pajak dan Bea Meterai) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA174","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2013_P.U.(A)174-2013_LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 3) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1862-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.   (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman\n(Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Peremitan Cukai dan Duti Setem) (No. 3) 2013.\n\n (2)   Subperenggan 2 (a) disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada\n16 April 2013.\n\n (3) Subperenggan 2 (b) disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada\n12 April 2013.\n\n (4) Subperenggan 2(c) disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 8 Ogos 2012.\n\nPeremitan cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H1862-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.   Apa-apa cukai yang ke na dibayar di bawah Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967\n[Akta 53] hendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya berkenaan dengan Perjanjian Kemudahan\nyang dibuat antara Jambatan Kedua Sdn. Bhd. (\"Peminjam\") dengan Pemberi Pinjam\nseperti yang berikut:\n\n(a) Maybank Islamic Bank Berhad (\"Pemberi Pinjam\") berhubung dengan\nperuntukan kemudahan pinjaman berjangka (\"Kemudahan\") hingga\namaun agregat lima ratus juta ringgit (RM500,000,000);\n\n(b) AmIslamic Bank Berhad (\"Pemberi Pinjam\") berhubung dengan\nperuntukan kemudahan pinjaman berjangka (\"Kemudahan\") hingga\namaun agregat lima ratus juta ringgit (RM500,000,000); dan\n\n(c) Hong Leong Islamic Bank Berhad (\"Pemberi Pinjam\") berhubung dengan\nperuntukan kemudahan pinjaman berjangka (\"Kemudahan\") hingga\namaun agregat tiga ratus lima puluh juta ringgit (RM350,000,000),\n\nkepada Peminjam yang kena dibayar oleh—\n\n(i)\n\n(ii)\n\n(iii) -\n-\n\nPeremitan duti setem"}},{"id":"MY-H1862-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa du ti setem yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Setem 1949 [ Akta 378 ]\nberkenaan dengan Perjanjian Kemudahan hendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya.\n\nDibuat 28 Mei 2013\n[KK/BPKA/M3/(S)/168/1/2 Jld. 4; PN(PU2)232/VIII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY)\n(NO. 3) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(1) of the Loans Guarantee (Bodies\nCorporate) Act 1965 [Act 96], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1863"] = {"id":"MY-H1863","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 174/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年合作社（接管控制）（再委任）（第2号）令","en":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2014","orig":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Kawalan) (Pelantikan Semula) (Bilangan 2) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Hợp tác xã (Tiếp nhận kiểm soát) (Tái bổ nhiệm) (số 2) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งสหกรณ์ (การเข้าควบคุม) (การแต่งตั้งอีกครั้ง) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Kendali) (Pengangkatan Kembali) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA174","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2014_P.U.(A)174-2014_CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1863-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan\nKawalan) (Pelantikan Semula) (No. 2) 2014.\n\nPelantikan semula bagi pengambilalihan kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1863-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  Suruhanjaya telah melantik semula Syarikat Rakyat Asset Management Sdn. Bhd.\n(No. Syarikat 452759 -X) iaitu subsidiari kepada Bank Kerjasama Rakyat Malaysia\nBerhad untuk mengambil alih kawalan semua hart a, urusan, aktiviti dan hal ehwal\nKoperasi Jimat Cermat Dan Pinjaman Mercantile Berhad dan perbadanan yang\nberkaitan dengannya, dan menjalankan kesemua urusan, aktiviti dan hal ehwalnya\nberkuat kuasa mulai 15 Jun 2013 hingga 14 Jun 2014.\n\nKos dan perbelanjaan"}},{"id":"MY-H1863-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3.  Apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang ditanggung oleh Suruhanjaya berhubung\ndengan pengambilalihan kawalan di bawah perenggan 2 hendaklah kena dibayar\ndaripada dana dan harta Koperasi Jimat Cermat Dan Pinjaman Mercantile Berhad\nsebagai suatu caj pertama.\n\nDibuat  10 Jun 2014\n[SKM.IP.(Sulit)690/49 SJ.1 JLD. 3(48); PN(PU2)527/XVI]\n\nDATUK NIK ALI BIN MAT YUNUS\nPengerusi Eksekutif\nSuruhanjaya Koperasi Malaysia\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES ACT 1993\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT) (NO. 2)\nORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 69(2) (a) and subsection 69 A(2)\nof the Co -operative Societies Act 1993 [ Act 502 ], the Commission makes the following\norder:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1864"] = {"id":"MY-H1864","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 174/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（吉隆坡—加叻大道）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)(KUALA LUMPUR-KARAK HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)(KUALA LUMPUR-KARAK HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Kuala Lumpur-Karak) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc Kuala Lumpur-Karak) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางหลวงกัวลาลัมเปอร์-การัก) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Raya Kuala Lumpur-Karak) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA174","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)174-2015_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)(KUALA LUMPUR-KARAK HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1864-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Kuala Lumpur-Karak)\n\n(Pindaan) (No. 2) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Ogos 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1864-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuh Raya Kuala Lumpur-Karak) 1994 [P.U. (A) 369/1994] dipinda dalam\n\nJadual Pertama dengan menggantikan perkataan \"31 JULAI 2015\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"31 OGOS 2015\".\n\nDibuat 30 Julai 2015\n\n[KKR/PUU/110-1/7/3; PN(PU2)426/LVIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(KUALA LUMPUR-KARAK HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of\n\nthe Federal Roads (Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1865"] = {"id":"MY-H1865","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 174/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第4号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2016","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 4) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 4) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA174","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2016_P.U.(A)174-2016_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1865-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 4) 2016.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari 16 Jun 2016 hingga\n6 Julai 2016.\n\nHarga maksimum pengeluar"}},{"id":"MY-H1865-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga ma ksimum pengeluar bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan\ndalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,\nNegeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut\nkawasan dan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga maksimum borong"}},{"id":"MY-H1865-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga maksimum borong bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilaya h-Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga maksimum runcit"}},{"id":"MY-H1865-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga maksimum runcit bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Ketiga bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semen anjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1866"] = {"id":"MY-H1866","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 174/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）（第3号）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 3) ORDER 2017","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 3) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Bilangan 3) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) (số 3) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA174","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)174-2017_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 3) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1866-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) (No. 3) 2017.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 16 Jun 2017.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H1866-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua,\n\nmelainkan di atas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama,\n\nbagi tempoh yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya Larangan\n\nTerpakai\n\n (2)\n\nJalan Arah\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh Larangan\n\nSebahagian jalan dari Kuala\n\nKetil ke Merbau Pulas bermula\n\ndari seksyen FT136/079/15\n\nhingga seksyen FT136/079/20\n\nsebagaimana yang ditunjukkan\n\ndalam peta dalam Jadual\n\nKedua\n\nKenderaan dari Kuala Ketil ke\n\nMerbau Pulas dan sebaliknya\n\nhendaklah menggunakan\n\njalan lencongan sementara\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\n16 Jun 2017 hingga\n\n31 Disember 2018\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nDibuat 14 Jun 2017\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15; PN(PU2)460/XCI]\n\n DATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\nMerbau Pulas Kuala Ketil\n\nFT136/079/20\n\nPetunjuk :\n\nJALAN YANG BAGINYA PERINTAH LARANGAN TERPAKAI\n\nJALAN LENCONGAN SEMENTARA\n\nFT136/079/15\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 3)\n\nORDER 2017\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 292/2017 published on 1 June 2017, notice was given of the\n\nintention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the\n\nmaking of such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to in\n\nsubsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport (Prohibition of Use of\n\nRoad) (Federal Roads) (No. 3) Order 2017.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 16 June 2017.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road specified in column (1) of the\n\nFirst Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than on the\n\nroutes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified in\n\ncolumn (3) of the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which Prohibition\n\nApplies\n\n(2)\n\nRoutes\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition Period\n\nPart of the road from Kuala\n\nKetil to Merbau Pulas starting\n\nfrom section FT136/079/15\n\nto section FT136/079/20 as\n\nshown on the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nVehicle from Kuala Ketil to\n\nMerbau Pulas and vice versa\n\nshall use the temporary\n\ndiversion road as shown on\n\nthe map in the Second\n\nSchedule\n\n16 June 2017 to\n\n31 December 2018\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nMade 14 June 2017\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15; PN(PU2)460/XCI]\n\n DATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works\n\nMerbau Pulas Kuala Ketil\n\nFT136/079/20\n\nLegend :\n\nFT136/079/15\n\nROAD TO WHICH PROHIBITION ORDER IS APPLICABLE\n\nTEMPORARY DIVERSION ROAD"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1867"] = {"id":"MY-H1867","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 174/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年自雇人员社会保障（供应）条例","en":"SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2018","orig":"SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2018","ms":"Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja Sendiri (Bekalan) 2018","vi":"Quy định về An sinh xã hội cho người tự làm việc (Cung ứng) năm 2018","th":"ข้อบังคับประกันสังคมผู้ประกอบอาชีพอิสระ (การจัดหา) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Peraturan Jaminan Sosial Pekerja Mandiri (Pasokan) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA174","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)174-2018_SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1867-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKeselamatan Sosial Pekerjaan Sendiri (Perbekalan) 2018.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa\n\npada 1 Januari 2018.\n\nPengeluaran bagi perbelanjaan bagi tahun 2018"}},{"id":"MY-H1867-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Suatu jumlah wang yang tidak melebihi dua puluh dua juta enam ratus enam\n\npuluh ribu ringgit (RM22,660,000) hendaklah dikeluarkan daripada Kumpulan Wang\n\nKeselamatan Sosial Pekerjaan Sendiri bagi perbelanjaan untuk pentadbiran\n\nSkim Keselamatan Sosial Pekerjaan Sendiri bagi tahun 2018 sebagaimana yang\n\ndiperuntukkan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\nMaksud Peruntukan\n\nEmolumen RM 1,118,000\n\nBekalan dan perkhidmatan RM 323,500\n\nPerbelanjaan lain RM 6,218,500\n\nHarta tanah, loji dan peralatan RM 15,000,000\n\nJumlah RM 22,660,000\n\nDibuat 24 Julai 2018\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/11/5; PN(PU2)744]\n\nM. KULA SEGARAN\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nSELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY ACT 2017\n\nSELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (SUPPLY) REGULATIONS 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 47(1) of\n\nthe Self-Employment Social Security Act 2017 [Act 789], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Self-Employment Social Security\n\n(Supply) Regulations 2018.\n\n(2) These Regulations are deemed to have come into operation\n\non 1 January 2018.\n\nIssue for expenditure for the year 2018\n\n2. A sum not exceeding twenty-two million six hundred and sixty thousand ringgit\n\n(RM22,660,000) shall be issued out of the Self-Employment Social Security Fund for\n\nexpenditure on the administration of the Self-Employment Social Security Scheme for\n\nthe year 2018 as provided in the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPurpose Allocation\n\nEmoluments RM 1,118,000\n\nSupplies and services RM 323,500\n\nOther expenditures RM 6,218,500\n\nLanded properties, plants and equipment RM 15,000,000\n\n__________________\n\nTotal RM 22,660,000\n\nMade 24 July 2018\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/11/5; PN(PU2)744]\n\nM. KULA SEGARAN\n\nMinister of Human Resources"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
