  FT["MY-H1877"] = {"id":"MY-H1877","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2013&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年合作社（接管控制）（再委任）令","en":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT) ORDER 2013","orig":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Kawalan) (Pelantikan Semula) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Hợp tác xã (Tiếp nhận kiểm soát) (Tái bổ nhiệm) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งสหกรณ์ (การเข้าควบคุม) (การแต่งตั้งอีกครั้ง) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Kendali) (Pengangkatan Kembali) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2013_P.U.(A)175-2013_CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1877-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan\nKawalan) (Pelantikan Semula) 2013.\n\nPelantikan semula bagi pengambilalihan kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1877-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Suruhanjaya telah melantik semula Haji Mohd Azmy bin Deris untuk mengambil\nalih kawalan semua harta, urusan, aktiviti dan hal ehwal Koperasi Kakitangan Kerajaan\ndan Badan -Badan Berkanun Terengganu (K OKANUN) Berhad  dan perbadanan  yang\nberkaitan dengannya , dan menjalankan kesemua urusan, aktiviti dan hal  ehwalnya\nmulai 20 Oktober 2012 hingga 19 Jun 2013.\n\nKos dan perbelanjaan"}},{"id":"MY-H1877-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang ditanggung oleh Suruhanjaya berhubung\ndengan pengambilalihan kawalan d i bawah perenggan 2 hendaklah kena dibayar\ndaripada dana dan harta Koperasi Kakitangan Kerajaan dan Badan -Badan Berkanun\nTerengganu (KOKANUN) Berhad sebagai suatu caj pertama.\n\nDibuat 24 Mei 2013\n[SKM.IP.(AM)7849 JLD.2(48); PN(PU2)527/XV]\n\nDATUK NIK ALI BIN MAT YUNUS\nPengerusi Eksekutif\nSuruhanjaya Koperasi Malaysia\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES ACT 1993\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL) (REAPPOINTMENT)\nORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 69(2)(a) and subsection 69A(2) of the\nCo-operative Societies Act 1993 [Act 502], the Commission makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1878"] = {"id":"MY-H1878","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2014&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年道路交通（联邦道路广告牌构筑物搭建费用）（修正）规则","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (FEE AND CHARGE FOR ERECTING STRUCTURES FOR BILLBOARD ON FEDERAL ROAD) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2014","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (FEE AND CHARGE FOR ERECTING STRUCTURES FOR BILLBOARD ON FEDERAL ROAD) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2014","ms":"Kaedah Pengangkutan Jalan (Fi dan Caj bagi Mendirikan Struktur Papan Iklan di Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Pindaan) 2014","vi":"Quy tắc về Vận tải đường bộ (Phí và lệ phí dựng kết cấu biển quảng cáo trên đường bộ liên bang) (Sửa đổi) năm 2014","th":"กฎการขนส่งทางถนน (ค่าธรรมเนียมและค่าใช้จ่ายในการติดตั้งโครงสร้างป้ายโฆษณาบนทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Tata Tertib Angkutan Jalan (Biaya dan Retribusi Pendirian Struktur Papan Reklame di Jalan Raya Federal) (Perubahan) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2014_P.U.(A)175-2014_ROAD TRANSPORT (FEE AND CHARGE FOR ERECTING STRUCTURES FOR BILLBOARD ON FEDERAL ROAD) (AMENDMEN.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1878-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Fi dan Caj bagi Mendirikan Struktur bagi Papan Iklan di Jalan Persekutuan)\n\n(Pindaan) 2014.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1878-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Pengangkutan Jalan (Fi dan Caj bagi Mendirikan Struktur bagi\n\nPapan Iklan di Jalan Persekutuan) 2010 [P.U. (A) 405/2010], yang disebut\n\n\"Kaedah-Kaedah ibu\" dalam Kaedah-Kaedah ini, dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama dengan\n\nmemasukkan selepas butiran 7 butiran yang berikut:\n\nJenis Papan Iklan Jumlah Fi\n\n(RM)\n\n\"8. Bebat Tiang 300\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H1878-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Jadual Kedua kepada Kaedah-Kaedah ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas\n\nbutiran 7 butiran yang berikut:\n\nJenis Papan Iklan Jumlah Caj Mengikut Zon\n\n(RM)\n\n\"8. Bebat Tiang Zon 1\n\nZon 2\n\nZon 3\n\n800\".\n\nDibuat 19 Jun 2014\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-2/9/7; PN(PU2)460/LXXVI]\n\nDATUK HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (FEE AND CHARGE FOR ERECTING STRUCTURES FOR BILLBOARD\n\nON FEDERAL ROAD) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 85A(3) of the Road Transport\n\nAct 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1879"] = {"id":"MY-H1879","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（东海岸大道（第一期））（修正）（第2号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY-PHASE 1) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY-PHASE 1) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Pantai Timur Fasa 1) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc Bờ Đông - Giai đoạn 1) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางด่วนชายฝั่งตะวันออก ระยะที่ 1) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Tol Pantai Timur Tahap 1) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)175-2015_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY-PHASE 1) (AMEND.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1879-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Pantai Timur-Fasa 1)\n\n(Pindaan) (No. 2) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Ogos 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1879-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuh Raya Pantai Timur-Fasa 1) 2007 [P.U. (A) 250/2007] dipinda dalam\n\nJadual Pertama dengan menggantikan perkataan \"31 JULAI 2015\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"31 OGOS 2015\".\n\nDibuat 30 Julai 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/3/1 Jld.2; PN(PU2)426/LVIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(EAST COAST EXPRESSWAY-PHASE 1) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of\n\nthe Federal Roads (Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H188"] = {"id":"MY-H188","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=184&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":7,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1977年国际货币基金组织（协定条款第二次修正案的批准）法","en":"INTERNATIONAL MONETARY FUND (RATIFICATION OF SECOND AMENDMENT TO THE ARTICLES OF AGREEMENT) ACT 1977","orig":"INTERNATIONAL MONETARY FUND (RATIFICATION OF SECOND AMENDMENT TO THE ARTICLES OF AGREEMENT) ACT 1977","vi":"Luật về Quỹ Tiền tệ Quốc tế (Phê chuẩn sửa đổi lần thứ hai Điều lệ Hiệp định) năm 1977","th":"พระราชบัญญัติกองทุนการเงินระหว่างประเทศ (การให้สัตยาบันการแก้ไขข้อบังคับความตกลงครั้งที่สอง) ค.ศ. 1977","id":"Undang-Undang Dana Moneter Internasional (Ratifikasi Amandemen Kedua Anggaran Dasar Perjanjian) Tahun 1977","ms":"Akta Tabung Kewangan Antarabangsa (Pengesahan Pindaan Kedua Perkara-Perkara Perjanjian) 1977"},"level":"law","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT184","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1977","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 7 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1977_184_INTERNATIONAL MONETARY FUND (RATIFICATION OF SECOND AMENDMENT TO THE ARTICLES OF AGREEMENT) ACT.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H188-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the International Monetary short title,\nFund (Ratification of Second Amendment to the Articles\nof Agreement) Act 1977."}},{"id":"MY-H188-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. In this Act—                                     Inter-\npretation.\n\"International Monetary Fund\" (hereinafter referred to\nas the \"Fund\") means the International Monetary Fund of\nwhich Malaysia is a member by virtue of section 3 of the\nBretton Woods Agreements Ordinance 1957;              75157,\n\n\"Articles of Agreement\" means the Articles of Agreement\nof the said Fund as amended pursuant to Resolution No.\n31-4 adopted by the Board of Governors of the Fund on\nApril 30, 1976;\n\n\"Special Drawing Rights Department\" means the Account\nthrough which the Fund will conduct all operations and\ntransactions involving Special Drawing Rights allocated\n\n[S. 2-4]\n\nAuthorisa-\ntion to ratify\namendments\nof Articles\nof Agree:\nment of\n\nthe Fund.\n\nExtension of\nP.U. (A)\n7 505/69.\n\n>\n\n4                             Acr 184\n\nunder Article XV of the Articles of Agreement, except\noperations and transactions pursuant to section 2 of Article\nXVII of the Articles of Agreement;\n\n\"General Department\" means the Account through which\nthe Fund will conduct all other operations and transactions\nauthorised by the Articles of Agreemenit;\n\n\"General Resources Account\" means the Account of the\nGenetal Department through which the Fund will conduct\nall its operations and transactions using the general resources\nof the Fund;\n\n\"Special Disbursement Account\" means the Account of\nthe General Department in which profits from the sale of\nthe Fund's gold shall be held for use in accordance with\nthe provisions governing that Account in section 12 of\nArticle V and Schedule B to the Articles of Agreement;\n\n\"Investment Account\" means the Account of the General\nDepartment established under section 6 (f) (i) of Article XII\nof the Articles of Agreement, in which the Fund's resources\nused for and resulting from investment will be held."}},{"id":"MY-H188-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may by instrument under\nhis hand empower such person as he may name in such\ninstrument—\n\n(a) to accept on behalf of Malaysia the Second Amend-\n\nment to the Articles of Agreement of the Fund\n\n- annexed to the March 1976 Report by the Executive\n\na to the Board of Governors of the Fund;\nan\n\n(b) to deposit on behalf of Malaysia with the Fund an\ninstrument setting forth that the Government, in\naccordance with the laws of Malaysia, undertakes\nall the obligations of a member of the Fund under\nthe Second Amendment of the Articles of Agreement\nof the Fund and that the Government has taken all\nsteps necessary to enable it to carry out all of these\nobligations."}},{"id":"MY-H188-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. The Bretton Woods Agreements Order 1969 shall be\n\ndeemed to refer to all rights and obligations with respect\n\nto the General Resources Account, the Special Disbursement\n\nAccount and the Investment Account of the General Depart-\n\npen, of the Fund under the Articles of Agreement of the\nun\n\nIS. 5-6]\n\nu                    INTERNATIONAL MONETARY FUND (RATIFICATION OF SECOND   |  5\nAMENDMENT TO THE ARTICLES OF AGREEMENT)"}},{"id":"MY-H188-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Subsection (2) of section 5 of the International Monetary Conse-\nFund (Ratification of Amendments to the Articles of Agree- gucny!\nment) Act 1969 is amended by—                             ments to\nCc   ,\n(a) substituting for the words \"Article XXIV\" appearing.\nin paragraph (5) (i) the words \"Article XV\";\n\n(b) substituting for the words \"Article XXVI, Article\nXXX and Article XXX1\" appearing in paragraphs\n(b) (iii) and (iv) the words \"Article XX, Article\nXXIV and Article XXV\";          |\n\n|                            6. The Central Bank of Malaysia Ordinance 1958 is amended Conse.\n\nD                 by—                                                      amendments\n\n(a) substituting for subsection (1) of section 19 the Dahan\nfollowing new subsection—                         61/58.\n\n\"(1) The parity of the ringgit shall be deter-\nmined by the Minister on the recommendation of\nthe Bank in terms either of the currency or\ncurrencies of other members of the International\nMonetary Fund, the Special Drawing Right, the\ncommon' denominator prescribed by the Inter-\nnational Monetary Fund under paragraph 1 of\nSchedule C to the Articles of Agreement of the\nInternational Monetary Fund, or any other\ndenominator consistent with the obligations of\nMalaysia under Article IV and Schedule C to the\nArticles of Agreement of the International Mone-\ntary Fund:\n\nProvided that if and when the Bank notifies\nthe International Monetary Fund of the parity of\nthe ringgit upon the International Monetary Fund\n\n- deciding under the Articles of Agreement to\nintroduce a widespread system of exchange\narrangements based on stable but adjustable par\nvalues, such parity shall be published in the\nGazette and shall take effect accordingly.\";\n\n(b) substituting for the words \"Notwithstanding sub-\nsection (1), the\" appearing in subsection (2) of section\n19 the word \"The\";\n\n(c) substituting for the words \"mentioned in\" appearing\nin subsection (3) of section 19 the words \"gazetted\nunder\";\n\n(S. 6]"}},{"id":"MY-H188-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6                         — Acr 184\n\n(d) adding immediately after subsection (3) of section\n19 the following new subsection—\n\n\"(4) Notwithstanding subsection (1), the\nMinister may decide on the recommendation of\nthe Bank that it is necessary and expedient for\nMalaysia not to determine a parity for the ringgit,\nbut instead to apply any exchange arrangement\nfor the ringgit that is not inconsistent with the.\nArticles of Agreement of the International Mone-\ntary Fund, including, but not limited to, the\nsevering of the parity of the ringgit to any\ncurrency or currencies or any denominator.\";\n\n(e) substituting for the proviso appearing in section 21\nthe following new proviso~—\n\n' \"Provided that the rate of exchange quoted for\n\nany such transaction shall be consistent with the\n\nArticles of Agreement of the International\n‘Monetary Fund.\";\n\n(f) substituting for the words \"section 5\" appearing in\nparagraph (00) (iii) of subsection (1) of section 30\nthe words \"section 4\";\n\n(g) adding immediately after paragraph (00) (v) of sub-\nsection (1) of section 30 the following new para-\ngraph—\n\n\"(vi) exchange, if requested by other members\nof the International Monetary Fund at the time\nof purchase, balances of Malaysian currency pur-\nchased by other members from the International\nMonetary Fund, or obtained by other members\nin exchange for currency purchased from the\nInternational Monetary Fund, for a freely usable\ncurrency (defined in Article XXX (f) of the\nArticles of Agreement of the International Mone-\ntary Fund) selected by the Bank at an exchange\nrate between the ringgit and that currency as may\nbe consistent with section 7 (a) of Article XIX\nof the Articles of Agreement of the International\nMonetary Fund;\".\n\n[S. 7]\n\nINTERNATIONAL MONETARY FUND (RATIFICATION OF SECOND      ;   7\nAMENDMENT TO THE ARTICLES OF AGREEMENT)"}},{"id":"MY-H188-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. The provisions of the Bretton Woods Agreements Act in\nOrdinance 1957, and the International Monetary Fund j7@sionte\n\n(Ratification of Amendments to the Articles of Agree- 4c /2.\nment) Act 1969, shall be read subject to the provisions\nof this Act.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\nDICETAX OLEH KETUA PENGARAL PERCETAKAN DAN DITERBITKAN DENGAN PERINTAH PADA\nStn UN 1977\n\nHarga: 50 sen"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1880"] = {"id":"MY-H1880","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年价格管制与反暴利（管制商品标价）（第4号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 4) ORDER 2016","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 4) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barang Kawalan Harga) (Bilangan 4) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Niêm yết giá hàng hóa thuộc diện kiểm soát giá) (số 4) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การแสดงราคาสินค้าควบคุมราคา) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barang yang Dikendalikan Harganya) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2016_P.U.(A)175-2016_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 4) ORDER 201.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1880-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barangan Harga Terkawal) (No. 4) 2016.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini b erkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari  16 Jun 2016\nhingga  6 Julai 2016.\n\nPenandaan harga"}},{"id":"MY-H1880-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Mana-mana orang yang  menjual atau menawarkan untuk menjual  apa-\napa barangan harga terkawal yang disiarkan dalam Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan ( Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 4) 2016 [P.U. (A) 174 /2016]\nhendaklah meletakkan label berwarna merah jambu yang menunjukkan harga bagi\nsetiap unit atau setiap unit timbangan, nama yang memerihalkan barangan harga\nterkawal itu dan gred atau kualiti, jika ada, bagi barangan harga terkawal itu.\n\n (2) Mana-mana orang yang tidak mematuhi subperenggan (1) melakukan\nsuatu kesalahan dan boleh, apabila disabitkan—\n\n(a) jika orang itu suatu pertubuhan perbadanan, didenda tidak\nmelebihi dua puluh ribu ringgit dan, bagi kesalahan kali yang\nkedua atau yang berikutnya, didenda tidak melebihi lima puluh\nribu ringgit; atau\n\n(b) jika orang itu bukan suatu pertubuhan perbadanan,  didenda tidak\nmelebihi sepuluh ribu ringgit dan, bagi kesalahan kali yang kedua\natau yang berikutnya, didenda tidak melebihi dua puluh ribu\nringgit.\n\nDibuat  15 Jun 2016\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri,\nKoperasi dan Kepenggunaan\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 4) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by sect ion 10 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Minister makes the following\norder:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1881"] = {"id":"MY-H1881","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年地方限速（联邦道路）（指定时段禁止）（第2号）令","en":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SPECIFIED TIME PROHIBITION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","orig":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SPECIFIED TIME PROHIBITION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Larangan Masa Ditetapkan) (Bilangan 2) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ địa phương (Đường bộ liên bang) (Cấm trong khung giờ quy định) (số 2) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วท้องถิ่น (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (การห้ามในช่วงเวลาที่กำหนด) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Lokal (Jalan Raya Federal) (Larangan Waktu Tertentu) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2017_P.U.(A)175-2017_LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SPECIFIED TIME PROHIBITION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1881-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Tempatan\n\n(Jalan Persekutuan) (Larangan Masa Tertentu) (No. 2) 2017.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa mulai 18 Jun 2017 hingga 2 Julai 2017.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H1881-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Pemanduan kenderaan motor dengan kelajuan yang lebih daripada 80\n\nkilometer sejam di atas semua jalan Persekutuan di Malaysia, selain jalan yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual Pertama kepada Perintah Had Laju Tempatan\n\n(Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) 1992 [P.U. (A) 462/1991], dilarang.\n\n(2) Larangan dalam subperenggan (1) hendaklah terhenti berkuat kuasa\n\napabila habis tempoh Perintah ini.\n\nDibuat 14 Jun 2017\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/8/1 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/XCI]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nLOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (SPECIFIED TIME PROHIBITION)\n\n(NO. 2) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1882"] = {"id":"MY-H1882","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年地方限速（联邦道路）（西马来西亚）（修正）令","en":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018","orig":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Semenanjung Malaysia) (Pindaan) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ địa phương (Đường bộ liên bang) (Malaysia Barat) (Sửa đổi) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วท้องถิ่น (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (มาเลเซียตะวันตก) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Lokal (Jalan Raya Federal) (Malaysia Barat) (Perubahan) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2018_P.U.(A)175-2018_LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1882-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Tempatan\n\n(Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) (Pindaan) 2018.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 30 Julai 2018.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1882-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) 1992\n\n[P.U. (A) 462/1991] dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama di bawah kepala\n\n\"NEGERI PAHANG\"—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan butiran 71 dengan butiran yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nNama jalan dan lokasi\n\n(2)\n\nHad Laju\n\n(km/j)\n\n\"71. Laluan 12 – Lebuh Raya Kuantan-Segamat\n\ndari Bandar Satelit Muadzam Shah\n\nU 3.069348, T 103.068725 sehingga\n\nBeef Lembaga Kemajuan Pahang\n\nTenggara (DARA) U 3.101235, T 103.086376\n\n(jarak sepanjang 4.04 km)\n\n60\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 97 butiran yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nNama jalan dan lokasi\n\n(2)\n\nHad laju\n\n(km/j)\n\n\"98. Laluan 12 – Lebuh Raya Kuantan-Segamat\n\ndari Jambatan Sg. Gadak U 3.025018,\n\nT 103.038881 sehingga Ladang Teh Lembaga\n\nKemajuan Pahang Tenggara (DARA)\n\nU 3.062034, T 103.064198 (jarak sepanjang\n\n4.98 km)\n\n60\".\n\nDibuat 26 Julai 2018\n\n[KKR/PUU.110-1/8/1 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/XCVII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nLOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT)\n\nORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1883"] = {"id":"MY-H1883","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年所得税（利息可扣除性限制）规则","en":"INCOME TAX (RESTRICTION ON DEDUCTIBILITY OF INTEREST) RULES 2019","orig":"INCOME TAX (RESTRICTION ON DEDUCTIBILITY OF INTEREST) RULES 2019","ms":"Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Kekangan atas Kebolehtolakan Faedah) 2019","vi":"Quy tắc về Thuế thu nhập (Hạn chế khả năng khấu trừ lãi vay) năm 2019","th":"กฎภาษีเงินได้ (ข้อจำกัดการหักดอกเบี้ย) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Tata Tertib Pajak Penghasilan (Pembatasan atas Dapat Dikurangkannya Bunga) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)175-2019_INCOME TAX (RESTRICTION ON DEDUCTIBILITY OF INTEREST) RULES 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1883-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini  bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Cukai\nPendapatan (Sekatan ke atas Kebolehpotongan Faedah) 2019.\n\n         (2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Julai 2019.\n\nPemakaian dan ketidakpakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H1883-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Kaedah-Kaedah ini terpakai—\n\n(a) bagi orang yang telah diberikan apa-apa bantuan kewangan dalam\ntransaksi terkawal dan jumlah amaun apa-apa perbelanjaan faedah\nbagi semua bantuan kewangan itu melebihi lima ratus ribu ringgit\n(RM500,000.00) dalam tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran; dan\n\n(b) berkenaan dengan tempoh  asas yang bermula pada atau\nselepas 1 Julai 2019 dan tempoh-tempoh asas yang berikutnya.\n\n(2) Jika Ketua Pengarah mengarahkan bahawa tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun\ntaksiran hendaklah terdiri daripada suatu tempoh atau tempoh -tempoh sebagaimana\nyang dinyatakan dalam arahan itu, jumlah amaun perbelanjaan faedah bagi bantuan\nkewangan itu bagi tempoh atau tempoh-tempoh itu hendaklah disifatkan sebagai terakru\nsama rata  sepanjang tempoh atau tempoh-tempoh itu.\n\n(3)  Walau apa pun subkaedah (1), Kaedah-Kaedah ini tidak terpakai bagi—\n\n(a) seorang individu\n\n(b) suatu bank berlesen, bank pelaburan berlesen, penanggung\ninsurans berlesen dan penanggung insurans semula profesional\nsebagaimana yang ditakrifkan di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan\nKewangan 2013 [Akta 758];\n\n(c) suatu bank Islam berlesen, pengendali takaful berlesen dan\npengendali takaful semula profesional sebaga imana yang\nditakrifkan di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam 2013\n[Akta 759];\n\n(d) suatu bank Labuan dan bank pelaburan Labuan yang dilesenkan\ndi bawah Bahagian VI Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan dan Sekuriti\nLabuan 2010 [Akta 704];\n\n(e) suatu bank Islam Labuan dan bank pelaburan Islam Labuan yang\ndilesenkan di bawah Bahagian VI Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan\ndan Sekuriti Islam Labuan 2010 [Akta 705];\n\n(f) seorang penanggung insurans Labuan dan penanggung insurans\nsemula termasuk perniagaan insurans kaptif Labuan yang\ndilesenkan di bawah Bahagian VII Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan\ndan Sekuriti Labuan 2010;\n\n(g) seorang pengendali takaful Labuan dan pengendali taka ful semula\nLabuan termasuk perniagaan takaful kaptif Labuan yang dilesenkan\ndi bawah Bahagian VII Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan dan Sekuriti\nIslam  Labuan 2010;\n\n(h) suatu institusi kewangan pembangunan sebagaimana yang\nditetapkan di bawah Akta Institusi Kewangan  Pembangunan 2002\n[Akta 618];\n\n(i) seorang kontraktor pembinaan sebagaimana yang\nditakrifkan di bawah Peraturan -Peraturan Cukai Pendapatan\n(Kontrak Pembinaan) 2007 [P.U. (A) 276/2007];\n\n(j) seorang pemaju harta sebagaimana yang ditakrifkan di bawah\nPeraturan-Peraturan Cukai Pendapatan (Pemajuan Harta) 2007\n[P.U. (A) 277/2007];\n\n(k) seseorang yang telah diberikan pengecualian di bawah\nperenggan 127(3) (b) atau subseksyen 127(3 A) Akta berkenaan\ndengan pendapatan larasan orang itu.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H1883-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Dalam Kaedah -Kaedah ini, melainkan jika konteksnya menghendaki makna\nyang lain—\n\n \"bantuan kewangan\", \"perbelanjaan faedah\" dan \"transaksi terkawal\" mempunyai\nerti yang diberikan kepadanya di bawah seksyen 140C Akta;\n\n \"cukai-EBITDA\" ertinya suatu amaun yang ditentukan di bawah kaedah 5;\n\n \"EBITDA\" ertinya pendapatan sebelum faedah, cukai, susut nilai dan pelunasan.\n\nAmaun faedah maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H1883-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Amaun faedah maksimum yang disebut dalam seksyen 140C Akta hendaklah suatu\namaun yang bersamaan dengan dua puluh peratus cukai -EBITDA orang itu daripada\nsetiap puncanya yang terdiri daripada perniagaan bagi tempoh asas bagi suatu\ntahun taksiran.\n\nPenentuan cukai-EBITDA"}},{"id":"MY-H1883-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Amaun cukai -EBITDA hendaklah ditentukan mengikut formula\nyang berikut:\n\nA + B + C\n\niaitu A ialah amaun pendapatan larasan  orang itu daripada\nsumbernya yang terdiri daripada perniagaan bagi\ntempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran sebelum\napa-apa sekatan ke atas kebolehpotongan faedah\ndi bawah seksyen 140C Akta dibuat;\n\n B ialah jumlah amaun potongan kelayakan yang\ndibenarkan dalam menentukan amaun pendapatan\nlarasan dalam A;\n\n C ialah jumlah amaun perbelanjaan faedah yang\ndilakukan berhubung dengan pendapatan kasar\norang itu bagi apa-apa bantuan kewangan dalam\ntransaksi terkawal daripada puncanya yang terdiri\ndaripada perniagaan bagi tempoh asas ba gi suatu\ntahun taksiran.\n\n(2) Dalam kaedah ini, \"potongan kelayakan\" ertinya—\n\n(a) suatu amaun yang bersamaan dengan amaun perbelanjaan yang\ndilakukan oleh orang itu yang dihitung dalam apa -apa potongan\nyang kena dibuat di bawah Akta yang amaun potongan itu ialah\ndua kali ganda amaun perbelanjaan yang dilakukan oleh orang itu;\n\n(b) apa-apa tuntutan bagi potongan di bawah mana -mana\nkaedah-kaedah yang dibuat di bawah perenggan 154(1) (b) Akta\nyang po tongan itu dibenarkan bagi maksud  menentukan\npendapatan larasan orang itu.\n\nBawa ke depan perbelanjaan faedah"}},{"id":"MY-H1883-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Tertakluk kepada subkaedah (2), dalam hal suatu syarikat, jika syarikat itu\nmempunyai perbelanjaan faedah yang melebihi amaun faedah maksimum sebagaimana\nyang ditentukan di bawah kaedah 4 bagi tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran, amaun\nlebihan itu hendaklah dibenarkan untuk dibawa ke depan dan dipotong terhadap\npendapatan larasan syarikat itu bagi  tahun-tahun taksiran  yang berikutnya tertakluk\nkepada amaun faedah maksimum yang ditentukan di bawah kaedah 4 bagi tahun taksiran\nyang berkenaan walaupun syarikat itu tiada perbelanjaan faedah bagi mana-mana tahun\ntaksiran yang berikutnya, sehingga keseluruhan amaun lebihan itu telah digunakan\nsepenuhnya.\n\n (2) Lebihan amaun faedah maksimum bagi tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun\ntaksiran dan apa-apa lebihan amaun faedah maksimum yang dibawa ke depan daripada\nmana-mana tahun taksiran tertentu sebelum tahun itu hendaklah dibenarkan  untuk\ndibawa ke depan jika Ketua Pengarah berpuas ha ti bahawa pemegang syer syarikat itu\npada hari  pertama dan hari  terakhir tempoh asas bagi tahun taksiran selepas tahun\ntaksiran yang amaun itu ditentukan adalah sebahagian besarnya sama.\n\n(3)  Bagi maksud subkaedah (2)—\n\n(a) pemegang syer syarikat itu pada mana-mana tarikh adalah\nsebahagian besarnya  sama dengan pemegang syer pada\nmana-mana tarikh lain jika pada kedua-dua tarikh tersebut—\n\n(i) lebih daripada lima puluh peratus modal berbayar\nberkenaan dengan syer biasa syarikat itu dipegang oleh atau\nbagi pihak orang yang sama; dan\n\n(ii) lebih daripada lima puluh peratus nilai syer yang\ndiumpukkan berkenaan dengan syer biasa dalam syarikat itu\ndipegang oleh atau bagi pihak orang yang sama; dan\n\n(b) syer dalam syarikat itu yang dipegang oleh atau bagi pihak syarikat\nyang lain hendaklah disifatkan sebagai dipegang oleh pemegang\nsyer syarikat yang terakhir disebut.\n\n(4) Dalam subkaedah (3), \"syer biasa\" ertinya apa-apa syer selain suatu syer\nyang hanya membawa hak bagi apa-apa dividen yang merupakan—\n\n(a) suatu amaun tetap atau pada suatu kadar tetap peratus nilai syer\nitu; atau\n\n(b) suatu kadar tetap peratus keuntungan syarikat itu.\n\nDibuat 24 Jun 2019\n[Perb.MOF.TAX(S)700-2/3/49; PN(PU2)80/XCIV]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 154(2)\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (RESTRICTION ON DEDUCTIBILITY OF INTEREST) RULES 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 154(1)(ed) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1884"] = {"id":"MY-H1884","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2020&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年关税（禁止进口）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2020","orig":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Larangan Import) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Cấm nhập khẩu) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (การห้ามนำเข้า) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Larangan Impor) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2020_P.U.(A)175-2020_CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1884-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai\nImport) (Pindaan) (No. 2) 2020.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 2 Jun 2020.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H1884-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.        Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai Import) 201 7 [P.U. (A) 103/2017] dipinda\ndalam Jadual Kedua, dalam Bahagian I , berhubung dengan butiran 9,\ndengan memasukkan selepas subbutiran (19) dalam ruang (2) dan butir -butir\nyang bersetentangan dengannya dalam ruang (3) subbutiran dan butir -butir\nyang berikut:\n\n(1)\nItem\nNo.\n(2)\nDescription of Goods\n(3)\nChapter/\nHeading/\nSubheading\n(4)\nCountry\n(5)\nMinistry/\nDepartment/\nStatutory Body\nIssuing License\n\n\"(20)   3,4 -MDP-2-P methyl\nglycidate (PMK\nglycidate)\n\n(21)     3,4-MDP-2-P methyl\nglycidic acid (PMK\nglycidic acid)\n\n(22)     Alpha-\nphenylacetoacetamide\n(APAA) (including its\noptical isomers)\n\n2932.99.90 00\n\n2932.99.90 00\n\n2924.29.90 00\".\n\nDibuat 28 Mei 2020\n[SULIT KE.HT (96)669/15-36 Klt. 19 Sk.4; MOF.TAX(S) 700-2/1/16 JLD. 5; PN(PU2)338C/XXX]\n\nTENGKU DATO' SRI ZAFRUL TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n                                                                  CUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 31(1) of the\nCustoms Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1885"] = {"id":"MY-H1885","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2021&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":8,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年传染病预防与控制（疫区地方措施）（有条件行动管制）（第4号）（修正）（第9号）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 9) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 9) REGULATIONS 2021","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Các biện pháp trong khu vực bị nhiễm bệnh) (Kiểm soát di chuyển có điều kiện) (số 4) (Sửa đổi) (số 9) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (มาตรการในท้องที่ที่ติดเชื้อ) (การควบคุมการเคลื่อนย้ายแบบมีเงื่อนไข) (ฉบับที่ 4) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 9) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Tindakan di Wilayah Lokal Terinfeksi) (Pengendalian Mobilitas Bersyarat) (Nomor 4) (Perubahan) (Nomor 9) Tahun 2021","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah dalam Kawasan Tempatan Berjangkit) (Kawalan Pergerakan Bersyarat) (Bilangan 4) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 9) 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 8 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)175-2021_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITION.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1885-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Negeri Johor 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1885-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Negeri Kelantan kecuali Daerah Kota Bharu,\n\nPasir Mas, Pasir Puteh, Bachok, Machang, Tumpat\n\n16.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nKawasan Tempatan Jangkitan/Bahagian/Daerah\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh\n\ndan Tanah Merah"}},{"id":"MY-H1885-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Negeri Pulau Pinang 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1885-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. Negeri Sarawak 13.4.2021 – 26.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1885-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Negeri Selangor 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1885-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1885-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. Daerah Kuala Muda, Negeri Kedah 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H1885-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. Daerah Seremban, Negeri Sembilan 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\".\n\nDibuat 15 April 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT\n\nCONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 9) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342],\n\nthe Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas)\n\n(Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) (Amendment) (No. 9) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 16 April 2021.\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule\n\n2. The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) Regulations 2021\n\n[P.U. (A) 97/2021] are amended by substituting for the First Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\nAPPLICATION\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n1. State of Johore 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n2. State of Kelantan except Kota Bharu, Pasir Mas,\n\nPasir Puteh, Bachok, Machang, Tumpat and\n\nTanah Merah Districts\n\n16.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n3. State of Penang 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n4. State of Sarawak 13.4.2021 – 26.4.2021\n\n5. State of Selangor 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n6. Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n7. Kuala Muda District, State of Kedah 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n8. Seremban District, State of Negeri Sembilan 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\".\n\nMade 15 April 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1886"] = {"id":"MY-H1886","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年销售税（免税货物）令","en":"SALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) ORDER 2022","orig":"SALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Cukai Jualan (Barang yang Dikecualikan daripada Cukai) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế bán hàng (Hàng hóa được miễn thuế) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งภาษีขาย (สินค้าที่ได้รับการยกเว้นภาษี) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Pajak Penjualan (Barang yang Dibebaskan dari Pajak) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)175-2022_SALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1886-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah     ini     bolehlah     dinamakan     Perintah     Cukai     Jualan\n(Barang yang Dikecualikan daripada Cukai) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2022.\n\nPengecualian daripada cukai jualan"}},{"id":"MY-H1886-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Tertakluk kepada perenggan 3, barang yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3)\nJadual A dikecualikan daripada cukai jualan.\n\nTakat pengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1886-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Pengecualian yang disebut dalam perenggan 2 hendaklah diberikan sepenuhnya\nberkenaan dengan barang yang disebut dalam ruang (3) Jadual A.\n\nPenjenisan barang"}},{"id":"MY-H1886-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Penjenisan barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual A hendaklah mematuhi\nRukun Tafsiran Am Sistem Berharmonis di bawah Konvensyen Antarabangsa Sistem\nDeskripsi Komoditi Harmonis dan Pengekodan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam\nperenggan 4 Perintah Duti Kastam 2022 [P.U. (A) 114/2022].\n\n (2)   Bagi maksud Jadual A—\n\n (a) hanya barang yang diperihalkan dalam ruang (3) yang ditunjukkan\nbersetentangan dengan kepala dalam ruang (1) hendaklah\ndikecualikan. Barang   lain,   walaupun  mungkin boleh terjumlah\nkepada penjenisan  di bawah kepala yang sama tetapi tidak\ndinyatakan, tidak dikecualikan; dan\n\n (b) jika perihalan barang dalam ruang (3) ditunjukkan secara am\nbersetentangan dengan subkepala dalam ruang (2),\npengecualian hendaklah terpakai bagi semua barang itu\nsebagaimana penjenisan dalam subkepala itu.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1886-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Perintah Cukai Jualan ( Barang yang Dikecualikan daripada Cukai ) 2018\n[P.U. (A) 219/2018] dibatalkan.\n\nSALES TAX ACT 2018\n\nSALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 35(1)(a) of the\nSales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1887"] = {"id":"MY-H1887","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年马来西亚理工大学（校园）（吉隆坡分会）令","en":"UNIVERSITI TEKNOLOGI MALAYSIA (CAMPUS) (KUALA LUMPUR BRANCH) ORDER 2024","orig":"UNIVERSITI TEKNOLOGI MALAYSIA (CAMPUS) (KUALA LUMPUR BRANCH) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Universiti Teknologi Malaysia (Kampus) (Cawangan Kuala Lumpur) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Đại học Công nghệ Malaysia (Cơ sở học xá) (Chi nhánh Kuala Lumpur) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งมหาวิทยาลัยเทคโนโลยีมาเลเซีย (วิทยาเขต) (สาขากัวลาลัมเปอร์) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Universitas Teknologi Malaysia (Kampus) (Cabang Kuala Lumpur) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2024_P.U.(A)175-2024_UNIVERSITI TEKNOLOGI MALAYSIA (CAMPUS) (KUALA LUMPUR BRANCH) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1887-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Universiti Teknologi Malaysia\n\n(Kampus) (Cawangan Kuala Lumpur) 2024.\n\nPenubuhan Kampus"}},{"id":"MY-H1887-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Apabila Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa—\n\n(a) suatu Kampus bagi Universiti Teknologi Malaysia tertubuh;\n\n(b) nama Kampus yang disebut dalam subsubperenggan (a) ialah\n\n\"Universiti Teknologi Malaysia — (Kampus)(Cawangan Kuala Lumpur)\";\n\n(c) Kampus yang disebut dalam subsubperenggan (a) bertempat\n\ndi Lot 4582 Mukim Setapak, Daerah Kuala Lumpur,\n\nWilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur; dan\n\n(d) Fakulti Kecerdasan Buatan, Sekolah Perniagaan Antarabangsa\n\nAzman Hashim, Malaysia-Japan Institute of Technology dan apa-apa Fakulti,\n\nSekolah, Pusat, Akademi dan Institut lain yang ditubuhkan\n\nbagi maksud Kampus yang disebut dalam subsubperenggan (a)\n\nhendaklah ditempatkan di Kampus itu.\n\nDibuat 27 Mei 2024\n\n[KPT.PUU(S).100-1/21/4(18); PN(PU2)75E/JLD.4]\n\nDATO' SERI DIRAJA DR. ZAMBRY BIN ABD KADIR\n\nMenteri Pendidikan Tinggi\n\nUNIVERSITIES AND UNIVERSITY COLLEGES ACT 1971\n\nUNIVERSITI TEKNOLOGI MALAYSIA (CAMPUS)\n\n(KUALA LUMPUR BRANCH) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(1)\n\nof the Universities and University Colleges Act 1971 [Act 30], the Minister,\n\nafter consultation with the Board, makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1888"] = {"id":"MY-H1888","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年联邦直辖区（规划）（土地与建筑物用途类别）（吉隆坡联邦直辖区）（废止）规则","en":"FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS) (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (REVOCATION) RULES 2025","orig":"FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS) (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (REVOCATION) RULES 2025","vi":"Quy tắc về Lãnh thổ Liên bang (Quy hoạch) (Các loại mục đích sử dụng đất và công trình) (Lãnh thổ Liên bang Kuala Lumpur) (Bãi bỏ) năm 2025","th":"กฎเขตการปกครองสหพันธ์ (การผังเมือง) (ประเภทการใช้ประโยชน์ที่ดินและอาคาร) (เขตการปกครองสหพันธ์กัวลาลัมเปอร์) (การเพิกถอน) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Tata Tertib Wilayah Persekutuan (Penataan Ruang) (Kelas Penggunaan Tanah dan Bangunan) (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) (Pencabutan) Tahun 2025","ms":"Kaedah Wilayah Persekutuan (Perancangan) (Kelas Penggunaan Tanah dan Bangunan) (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) (Pembatalan) 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2025_P.U.(A)175-2025_FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS) (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1888-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah (Perancangan )\nWilayah Persekutuan (Kelas Kegunaan Tanah dan Bangunan)\n(Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) (Pembatalan) 2025.\n\n (2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 11 Jun 2025.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1888-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah (Perancangan ) Wilayah Persekutuan (Kelas Kegunaan Tanah\ndan Bangunan) (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) 2018 [ P.U. (A) 276/2018 ]\ndibatalkan.\n\nDibuat 9 Jun 2025\n[DBKL/JUP/BPPP/GN 1486 JLD 4; PN(PU2)396/JLD.9]\n\nDATO' SERI TPr (DR.) MAIMUNAH BINTI MOHD SHARIF\nDatuk Bandar Kuala Lumpur\n\nDiluluskan 10 Jun 2025\n[KWP(S): 24/PUU/698/1/1/59 JLD 5; PN(PU2)396/JLD.9]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. ZALIHA BINTI MUSTAFA\nMenteri di Jabatan Perdana Menteri\n(Wilayah Persekutuan)\n\nFEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) ACT 1982\n\nFEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS)\n(FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (REVOCATION) RULES 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 64(2) (b) of the\nFederal Territory (Planning) Act 1982 [ Act 267 ], the Commissioner,\nwith the approval of the Minister, makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1889"] = {"id":"MY-H1889","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 175/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年娱乐税（豁免）（第17号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 17) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 17) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 17) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 17) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA175","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2026_P.U.(A)175-2026_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1889-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 17) 2026.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1889-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan tiket masuk bagi persembahan\n\n陈慧琳 Season 2 万人结界演唱会 KELLY CHEN Season 2 Live in Kuala Lumpur 2026\n\nyang telah diadakan di Axiata Arena Bukit Jalil, Kuala Lumpur pada 28 Mac 2026\n\ndaripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 8 April 2026\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/37; PN(PU2)174/JLD.14]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b)\n\nof the Entertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
