  FT["MY-H1890"] = {"id":"MY-H1890","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2011&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年关税（计价）（棕榈油）（第22号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 22) ORDER 2011","orig":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 22) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Nilai) (Minyak Sawit) (Bilangan 22) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Trị giá) (Dầu cọ) (số 22) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (มูลค่า) (น้ำมันปาล์ม) (ฉบับที่ 22) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Nilai) (Minyak Kelapa Sawit) (Nomor 22) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2011_P.U.(A)176-2011_CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 22) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1890-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Nilai -Nilai) (Minyak\nKelapa Sawit) (No. 22 ) 2011 dan hendaklah mula berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari\n30 Mei 2011 hingga 5 Jun 2011.\nPemungutan dan pembayaran duti kastam"}},{"id":"MY-H1890-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Bagi maksud pemungutan dan pembayaran duti -duti kastam, menurut\nperuntukan-peruntukan Perintah Duti Kastam 2007 [ P.U. (A) 441/2007 ], nilai bagi tiap -\ntiap satu barang berduti yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) dan (2) Jadu al mengikut\nunitnya yang tersebut dalam ruang (3) hendaklah nilai yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (4).\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\nCUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 22) ORDER 2011\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 12 of the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235], the\nMinister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\nBarang\n(Goods)\n(1)\nSubkepala\n(Subheading)\n(2)\nUnit\n(Unit)\n(3)\nNilai\n(Value)\n(4)\nCrude Palm Oil 1511.10 100 tonne RM3,345.69\nDibuat 27 Mei 2011\nMade 27 May 2011\n[KE.HT(94)819/03-6/KLT. 10(27); Perb.(8.20)116/1-4; PN(PU2)338/XXVIII]\nDengan arahan Menteri Kewangan/\nBy direction of the Minister of Finance\nBagi pihak dan atas nama Menteri Kewangan/\nOn behalf and in the name of the Minister of Finance\nDATO' SITI HALIMAH BINTI ISMAIL\nSetiausaha/Secretary\nBahagian Analisa Cukai/\nTax Analysis Division"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1891"] = {"id":"MY-H1891","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年贷款担保（法人团体宣告）（国家基建基金有限公司）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (DANAINFRA NASIONAL BERHAD) ORDER 2012","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (DANAINFRA NASIONAL BERHAD) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Pengisytiharan Badan Korporat) (DanaInfra Nasional Berhad) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Tuyên bố pháp nhân) (DanaInfra Nasional Berhad) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (การประกาศนิติบุคคล) (ดานา อินฟรา นาซิออนนัล เบอร์ฮัด) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Penetapan Badan Hukum) (DanaInfra Nasional Berhad) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2012_P.U.(A)176-2012_LOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (DANAINFRA NASIONAL BERHAD) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1891-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Penetapan\n\nPertubuhan Perbadanan) (DanaInfra Nasional Berhad) 2012.\n\n(2) Perintah ini hendaklah disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2012.\n\nPenetapan pemakaian Akta"}},{"id":"MY-H1891-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pertubuhan perbadanan yang dikenali sebagai DanaInfra Nasional Berhad\n\nditetapkan sebagai suatu pertubuhan perbadanan yang baginya Akta terpakai.\n\nDibuat 31 Mei 2012\n\n[KK/BPKA/M/(S)/889/7/1; PN(PU2)232/VII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (DANAINFRA NASIONAL\n\nBERHAD) ORDER 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Loans Guarantee (Bodies\n\nCorporate) Act 1965 [Act 96], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1892"] = {"id":"MY-H1892","coverage":"partial","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":13,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年烟草产品管制（修正）条例","en":"CONTROL OF TOBACCO PRODUCT (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013","orig":"CONTROL OF TOBACCO PRODUCT (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013","ms":"Peraturan Kawalan Produk Tembakau (Pindaan) 2013","vi":"Quy định về Kiểm soát sản phẩm thuốc lá (Sửa đổi) năm 2013","th":"ข้อบังคับการควบคุมผลิตภัณฑ์ยาสูบ (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Peraturan Pengendalian Produk Tembakau (Perubahan) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 18 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en；已清除正文中的 4 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2013_P.U.(A)176-2013_CONTROL OF TOBACCO PRODUCT (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1892-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKawalan Hasil Tembakau (Pindaan) 2013.\n\n(2) Kecuali peraturan 15, 16, 16A dan 21A, Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula\n\nberkuat kuasa pada 15 Jun 2013.\n\n(3) Peraturan 15, 16, 16A dan 21A mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2014.\n\nPindaan peraturan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Kawalan Hasil Tembakau 2004 [P.U. (A) 324/2004], yang\n\ndisebut \"Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan-Peraturan ini, dipinda dalam\n\nperaturan 2, dalam takrif \"karton\", dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dua atau lebih\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"sepuluh\".\n\nPeraturan baru 5A"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas peraturan 5\n\nperaturan yang berikut:\n\n \"Larangan penjualan hasil tembakau melalui promosi"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5A. (1) Tiada seorang pun boleh―\n\n(a) mempromosikan penjualan apa-apa hasil tembakau secara\n\nlangsung atau tidak langsung; atau\n\n(b) menggunakan mana-mana orang sama ada melalui apa-apa\n\nkontrak, perjanjian, persefahaman atau persetujuan, sama\n\nada terikat di sisi undang-undang atau selainnya,\n\nmempromosikan jualan apa-apa hasil tembakau secara\n\nlangsung atau tidak langsung.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang yang melanggar subperaturan (1) melakukan\n\nsuatu kesalahan dan apabila disabitkan boleh didenda tidak melebihi sepuluh\n\nribu ringgit atau dipenjarakan selama tempoh tidak melebihi dua tahun atau\n\nkedua-duanya.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 8\n\n4. Subperaturan 8(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan\n\nselepas perkataan \"tahun\" perkataan \"atau kedua-duanya\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 8A\n\n5. Peraturan 8A Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda―\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan subperaturan (2) dengan subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(2) Pengilang atau pengimport itu hendaklah mengemukakan\n\npermohonan secara bertulis kepada Pengarah pada tiap-tiap kali\n\nberlakunya suatu perubahan kepada harga jualan runcit apa-apa hasil\n\ntembakau yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) disebabkan oleh apa-apa\n\nkenaikan harga jualan runcit suatu hasil tembakau itu.\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memotong subperaturan (5).\n\nPindaan peraturan 8C"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Peraturan 8C Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nsubperaturan (1) dengan subperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"(1) Harga minimum rokok bagi setiap paket rokok dua puluh batang\n\nadalah RM 7.00.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 8D"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. Subperaturan 8D(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nperkataan \"bagi paket rokok itu sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual\n\nKesembilan\" dengan perkataan \"sebagaimana yang dinyatakan di bawah\n\nsubperaturan 8C(1)\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 9"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Subperaturan 9(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda―\n\n(a) dengan memotong perkataan \"sekurang-kurangnya\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan perkataan \"hanya\" sebelum perkataan \"dua puluh\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 11"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Subperaturan 11(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda―\n\n(a) dalam perenggan (b), (h) dan (q), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"di\n\ndalam mana-mana\" dengan perkataan \"dalam mana-mana kawasan\";\n\n(b) dalam perenggan (i), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"atau\n\npersendirian\" perkataan \"atau di mana-mana tempat awam\";\n\n(c) dalam perenggan (j), (k), (o), (p), (r), (s) dan (t) dengan memotong\n\nperkataan \"di dalam suatu\";\n\n(d) dalam perenggan (n), dengan memotong perkataan \"dalam\" di manamana jua terdapat di dalam perenggan itu; dan\n\n(e) dengan memasukkan selepas subperaturan (1), subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(1A) Bagi maksud subperaturan (1)―\n\n(a) mana-mana kawasan sesuatu premis adalah merujuk\n\nkepada keseluruhan kawasan premis itu, termasuk manamana kawasan di dalam bangunan dan kawasan sekitar\n\nbangunan itu yang berada di dalam lingkungan sempadan\n\npagar atau tanah lot premis itu;\n\n(b) mana-mana kawasan dalam suatu bangunan adalah\n\nmerujuk kepada mana-mana kawasan di dalam bangunan\n\nitu dan termasuklah kawasan kaki lima bangunan di dalam\n\nsempadan kawasan litupan bumbung kekal kawasan\n\nbangunan itu, dan juga termasuklah kawasan yang dilitupi\n\noleh apa-apa bumbung kekal tambahan yang\n\nbersambungan dengan bangunan utama itu; dan\n\n(c) mulai 1 Januari 2014, mana-mana kawasan dalam suatu\n\nbangunan adalah merujuk kepada mana-mana kawasan di\n\ndalam bangunan itu dan termasuklah kawasan kaki lima\n\ndan di dalam lingkungan jarak tiga meter daripada garisan\n\nbangunan itu, dan termasuklah kawasan litupan apa-apa\n\nbumbung kekal tambahan yang bersambungan dengan\n\nbangunan utama itu.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 15"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"ms":"10. Peraturan 15 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda―\n\n(a) dalam subperaturan (1)―\n\n(i) dalam subperenggan (a)(ii), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"empat puluh\" dengan perkataan \"lima puluh\"; dan\n\n(ii) dalam subperenggan (b)(ii), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"empat puluh\" dengan perkataan \"lima puluh\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas subperaturan (4) subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n \"(4A) Tiada seorang pun boleh menjual atau menawarkan untuk\n\nmenjual, membeli atau berada dalam milikannya apa-apa paket rokok\n\natau karton rokok yang tidak dicetak dengan set teks dan imej amaran\n\nkesihatan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Kelima.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 16"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"ms":"11. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan peraturan 16 dengan\n\nperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"Pembungkusan rokok"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A16","no":16,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 16"},"text":{"ms":"16. (1) Pengilang hendaklah membungkus rokok di dalam suatu paket\n\nyang mengandungi hanya dua puluh batang rokok atau di dalam suatu karton\n\nyang mengandungi hanya sepuluh paket rokok.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang yang dalam menjalankan apa-apa perniagaan\n\natau urus niaga membekalkan atau menawarkan untuk membekal apa-apa rokok\n\ndi dalam mana-mana paket atau karton hendaklah mematuhi subperaturan (1),\n\nperaturan 15, 15A, 15B, 15C dan 16A .\n\n(3) Mana-mana orang yang melanggar subperaturan (1) atau (2)\n\nmelakukan suatu kesalahan dan apabila disabitkan boleh didenda tidak melebihi\n\nsepuluh ribu ringgit atau dipenjarakan selama tempoh tidak melebihi dua tahun\n\natau kedua-duanya.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 16A\n\n12. Peraturan 16A Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nsubperaturan (2) dengan subperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"(2) Bagi maksud subperaturan (1)―\n\n(a) larangan termasuklah, tetapi tidak terhad kepada penggunaan apaapa istilah, perkataan atau perihalan seperti \"light\", \"ultra light\",\n\n\"mild\", \"cool\", \"extra\", \"low tar\", \"special\", \"full flavour\", \"premium\",\n\n\"rich\", \"famous\", \"slim\", \"gred A\" atau apa-apa istilah, perkataan,\n\natau perihalan atau perkataan lain yang sama erti dengannya yang\n\nsecara langsung atau tidak langsung mewujudkan tanggapan yang\n\nsalah atau palsu bahawa sesuatu hasil tembakau itu adalah kurang\n\nberbahaya daripada suatu hasil tembakau yang lain; dan\n\n(b) larangan juga termasuk apa-apa istilah, perkataan, perihalan,\n\ntuntutan, representasi atau grafik yang menyatakan penggredan,\n\nkualiti atau keunggulan hasil tembakau itu atau yang menarik atau\n\nyang tiada kaitan dengan ciri-ciri fizikal hasil tembakau itu atau\n\napa-apa perkataan yang mempunyai maksud bagi tujuan\n\nmempromosikan penjualan atau pelupusan suatu hasil tembakau\n\nsecara langsung atau tidak langsung.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 21A\n\n13. Peraturan 21A Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda―\n\n(a) dalam subperaturan (1) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"tar\"\n\nperkataan \"atau karbon monoksida\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan subperaturan (2) dengan subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(2) Bagi maksud subperaturan (1)―\n\n(a) paras maksimum yang dibenarkan bagi nikotina adalah\n\n1.3 mg bagi sebatang rokok, paras maksimum yang\n\ndibenarkan bagi tar adalah 15 mg bagi sebatang rokok dan\n\nparas maksimum bagi karbon monoksida adalah 15 mg bagi\n\nsebatang rokok; dan\n\n(b) mulai 1 Jun 2015, paras maksimum yang dibenarkan bagi\n\nnikotina adalah 1.0 mg bagi sebatang rokok, paras\n\nmaksimum yang dibenarkan bagi tar adalah 10 mg bagi\n\nsebatang rokok dan paras maksimum bagi karbon\n\nmonoksida adalah 10 mg bagi sebatang rokok.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 23\n\n14. Subperaturan 23(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan\n\nselepas perkataan \"14(1)\" perkataan \"15(4A)\", dan selepas perkataan \"21(2)\",\n\nperkataan \"22(2)\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Kelima\n\n15. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Kelima dengan memasukkan\n\nselepas amaran kesihatan 6 amaran kesihatan yang berikut:\n\n\"AMARAN KESIHATAN 7\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 8\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 9\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 10\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 11\n\n\".\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 12\n\nPindaan Jadual Keenam\n\n16. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Keenam dengan memasukkan\n\nselepas amaran kesihatan 6 amaran kesihatan yang berikut :\n\n\"AMARAN KESIHATAN 7\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 8\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 9\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 10\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 11\n\nAMARAN KESIHATAN 12\n\nPemotongan Jadual Kesembilan"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A17","no":17,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 17"},"text":{"ms":"17. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memotong Jadual Kesembilan.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kesepuluh"}},{"id":"MY-H1892-A18","no":18,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 18"},"text":{"ms":"18. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual Kesepuluh\n\ndengan Jadual yang berikut:\n\n\".\n\n\"JADUAL KESEPULUH\n\n[Subperaturan 8C(2)]\n\nAKTA MAKANAN 1983\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN KAWALAN HASIL TEMBAKAU 2004\n\nNOTIS HARGA MINIMUM ROKOK\n\nBAHAN BENTUK/SAIZ /\n\nORIENTASI\n\nPERIHAL REKA BENTUK\n\nKertas putih\n\natau apa-apa\n\nbahan yang\n\nsesuai\n\n(a) Notis\n\nhendaklah\n\ndalam\n\nbentuk segi\n\nempat tepat\n\n(b) Saiz\n\nminimum\n\nnotis\n\nhendaklah\n\n297 mm\n\nlebar x 210\n\nmm panjang\n\n(c) Notis\n\nhendaklah\n\ndicetak\n\ndengan\n\norientasi\n\nlandskap\n\nNotis hendaklah mempunyai\n\nlatar belakang putih dengan\n\nmaklumat yang berikut ditulis\n\npada notis tersebut:\n\n(a) \"NOTIS HARGA MINIMUM\n\nROKOK\" –\n\nset teks hendaklah dalam\n\nwarna merah dan dalam huruf\n\ntebal tulisan huruf Arial\n\nbersaiz 36 poin.\n\n(b) \"HARGA MINIMUM ROKOK\n\nYANG DITETAPKAN OLEH\n\nKERAJAAN ADALAH\" –\n\nset teks hendaklah dalam\n\nwarna hitam dan dalam\n\nhuruf tebal tulisan huruf\n\nArial bersaiz 24 poin.\n\n(c) \"RM 7.00\" –\n\nset teks hendaklah dalam\n\nwarna merah dan dalam\n\nhuruf tebal tulisan huruf\n\nArial dan bersaiz 36 poin.\n\n(d) \"BAGI SEPAKET ROKOK 20\n\nBATANG\" –\n\nset teks hendaklah dalam\n\nwarna hitam dan dalam\n\nhuruf tebal tulisan huruf\n\nArial dan bersaiz 28 poin;\n\nNOTIS HARGA MINIMUM ROKOK\n\nHARGA MINIMUM ROKOK YANG DITETAPKAN\n\nOLEH KERAJAAN ADALAH\n\nRM 7.00\n\nBAGI SEPAKET ROKOK 20 BATANG\n\nROKOK TIDAK BOLEH DIJUAL DENGAN HARGA\n\nLEBIH RENDAH DARIPADA\n\nHARGA MINIMUM INI\n\nNO. ADUAN: 03-8883 4400 (INFOLINE,\n\nKEMENTERIAN KESIHATAN MALAYSIA)\n\nATAU\n\nHUBUNGI MANA-MANA PEJABAT KESIHATAN\n\nDAERAH YANG BERHAMPIRAN\n\n(e) \"ROKOK TIDAK BOLEH\n\nDIJUAL DENGAN HARGA\n\nLEBIH RENDAH DARIPADA\n\nHARGA MINIMUM INI\" –\n\nset teks hendaklah dalam\n\nwarna merah dan dalam\n\nhuruf tebal tulisan huruf\n\nArial bersaiz 28 poin.\n\n(f) \"NO. ADUAN: 03-8883 4400\n\n(INFOLINE, KEMENTERIAN\n\nKESIHATAN MALAYSIA)\n\nATAU HUBUNGI MANAMANA PEJABAT KESIHATAN\n\nDAERAH YANG\n\nBERHAMPIRAN\" –\n\nset teks hendaklah dalam\n\nwarna hitam dan dalam huruf\n\ntebal tulisan huruf Arial\n\nbersaiz 16 poin.\n\nDibuat 30 Mei 2013\n\n[K.K.(S) 280/5/7; PN(PU2)418/XVIV]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\n\".\n\nFOOD ACT 1983\n\nCONTROL OF TOBACCO PRODUCT (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 36 of the Food Act 1983 [Act 281], the\n\nMinister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1893"] = {"id":"MY-H1893","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年高等法院的设立（司法专员）令","en":"CONSTITUTION OF THE HIGH COURTS (JUDICIAL COMMISSIONER) ORDER 2014","orig":"CONSTITUTION OF THE HIGH COURTS (JUDICIAL COMMISSIONER) ORDER 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Thành lập các Tòa án Cấp cao (Ủy viên Tư pháp) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งการจัดตั้งศาลสูง (ผู้พิพากษาสมทบ) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Pembentukan Pengadilan Tinggi (Komisioner Yudisial) Tahun 2014","ms":"Perintah Penubuhan Mahkamah Tinggi (Pesuruhjaya Kehakiman) 2014"},"level":"constitution","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\2014_P.U.(A)176-2014_CONSTITUTION OF THE HIGH COURTS (JUDICIAL COMMISSIONER) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1893-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1.  (1)  Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Keanggotaan Mahkamah\nTinggi (Pesuruhjaya Kehakiman) 2014.\n\n  (2)  Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 2 Disember 2013.\n\nPelantikan Pesuruhjaya Kehakiman"}},{"id":"MY-H1893-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2.  Dato' Che Mohd Ruzima bin Ghazali, Dato' Haji AB . Karim bin Haji AB. Rahman,\nTuan Azhahari Kamal bin Ramli dan Tuan Mairin bin Idang @ Martin dilantik menjadi\nPesuruhjaya Kehakiman bagi tempoh dua tahun berkuat kuasa mulai 2 Disember 2013.\n\nDibuat 20 Jun 2014\n[JK (04)951/1; PN(PU2)171A/V]\n\n  Dengan Titah Perintah\n\nTAN SRI DR. ALI HAMSA\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nFEDERAL CONSTITUTION\n\nCONSTITUTION OF THE HIGH COURTS (JUDICIAL COMMISSIONER) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by Clause (1) of Article 122AB of the Federal\nConstitution, the Yang di-Pertuan Agong acting on the advice of the Prime Minister, after\nconsulting the Chief Justice of the Federal Court, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1894"] = {"id":"MY-H1894","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（北海外环公路）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (BUTTERWORTH OUTER RING ROAD) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (BUTTERWORTH OUTER RING ROAD) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Jalan Lingkaran Luar Butterworth) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường vành đai ngoài Butterworth) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ถนนวงแหวนรอบนอกบัตเตอร์เวิร์ธ) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Lingkar Luar Butterworth) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)176-2015_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (BUTTERWORTH OUTER RING ROAD) (AMENDME.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1894-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Lingkaran Luar\n\nButterworth) (Pindaan) (No. 2) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Ogos 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1894-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuh Raya Lingkaran Luar Butterworth) 2007 [P.U. (A) 12/2007] dipinda dalam\n\nJadual Pertama dengan menggantikan perkataan \"31 JULAI 2015\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"31 OGOS 2015\".\n\nDibuat 30 Julai 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/16 Jld.2; PN(PU2)426/LVIII]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(BUTTERWORTH OUTER RING ROAD) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of\n\nthe Federal Roads (Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1895"] = {"id":"MY-H1895","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）；已清除正文中的 4 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2016_P.U.(A)176-2016_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1895-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) 2016.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 18 Jun 2016.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H1895-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua,\n\nmelainkan di atas jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama, bagi tempoh\n\nyang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh larangan\n\n18 Jun 2016 hingga\n\n15 September 2016\n\n16 September 2016\n\nhingga 31 Disember\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya larangan\n\nterpakai\n\n1. Jambatan darat\n\nkilometer 3.1 hingga\n\nkilometer 2.8 arah timur\n\n(Batu Maung ke Batu\n\nKawan) yang\n\nmenghubungkan\n\nJambatan Sultan Abdul\n\nHalim Mu'adzam Shah\n\ndengan Lebuh Raya\n\nJuru-Jalan Duta-Bukit\n\nRaja, Lebuh Raya Utara\n\nSelatan Hubungan\n\nTengah dan Lebuh Raya\n\nKuala Lumpur-Johor\n\nBahru sebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\n2. Jambatan darat\n\nkilometer 2.8 hingga\n\nkilometer 3.1 arah barat\n\n(Batu Kawan ke Batu\n\nMaung) yang\n\nmenghubungkan Lebuh\n\nRaya Juru-Jalan DutaBukit Raja, Lebuh Raya\n\nUtara Selatan Hubungan\n\nTengah dan Lebuh Raya\n\nKuala Lumpur-Johor\n\nBahru dengan Jambatan\n\nSultan Abdul Halim\n\nMu'adzam Shah\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\n(2)\n\nJalan arah\n\nKenderaan dari Lebuh Raya\n\nJuru-Jalan Duta-Bukit Raja,\n\nLebuh Raya Utara Selatan\n\nHubungan Tengah dan\n\nLebuh Raya Kuala LumpurJohor Bahru menuju ke arah\n\nJambatan Sultan Abdul\n\nHalim Mu'adzam Shah\n\nhendaklah menggunakan\n\njalan lencongan\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\nKenderaan dari Jambatan\n\nSultan Abdul Halim\n\nMu'adzam Shah menuju ke\n\narah Lebuh Raya Juru-Jalan\n\nDuta-Bukit Raja, Lebuh\n\nRaya Utara Selatan\n\nHubungan Tengah dan\n\nLebuh Raya Kuala LumpurJohor Bahru hendaklah\n\nmenggunakan jalan\n\nlencongan sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam\n\npeta dalam Jadual Kedua\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nBATU KAWAN\n\nKM 3.1 KM 2.8\n\nKAWASAN KERJA\n\na) PENUTUPAN DUA LORONG KM 3.1 HINGGA KM 2.8 ARAH TIMUR\n\nBATU MAUNG\n\nPERINGKAT 1: 18 JUN 2016 HINGGA 15 SEPTEMBER 2016\n\nBATU KAWAN\n\nBATU MAUNG\n\nKM 3.1 KM 2.8\n\nc) PENUTUPAN DUA LORONG KM 3.1 HINGGA KM 2.8 ARAH BARAT\n\nd) (WB)\n\nPERINGKAT 2: 16 SEPTEMBER 2016 HINGGA 31 DISEMBER 2016\n\nKAWASAN KERJA\n\nPETUNJUK: JALAN YANG BAGINYA PERINTAH LARANGAN TERPAKAI LALUAN LENCONGAN TIDAK MENGIKUT SKALA\n\nDibuat 17 Jun 2016\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15 Jld. 2; PN(PU2)460/LXXXVI]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) ORDER 2016\n\nWHEAREAS by P.U. (B) 269/2016 published on 2 June 2016, notice was given of the\n\nintention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333]:\n\n AND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the\n\nmaking of such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Minister of Works, after taking consideration the matters referred to in\n\nsubsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport\n\n(Prohibition of Use of Road) (Federal Roads) Order 2016.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 18 June 2016.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road as specified in column (1) of the\n\nFirst Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than on the\n\nroutes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified in\n\ncolumn (3) of the First Schedule is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which prohibition\n\napplies\n\n1. Land bridge kilometre\n\n3.1 to kilometre 2.8\n\neast bound (Batu\n\nMaung to Batu Kawan)\n\nwhich connects the\n\nJambatan Sultan Abdul\n\nHalim Mu'adzam Shah\n\nwith Juru-Jalan DutaBukit Raja Expressway,\n\nNorth South\n\nExpressway Central\n\nLink and Kuala\n\nLumpur-Johore Bahru\n\nExpressway as shown\n\non the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\n2. Land bridge kilometre\n\n2.8 to kilometre 3.1\n\nwest bound (Batu\n\nKawan to Batu Maung)\n\nwhich connects the\n\nJuru-Jalan Duta-Bukit\n\nRaja Expressway, North\n\nSouth Expressway\n\nCentral Link and Kuala\n\nLumpur-Johore Bahru\n\nExpressway with\n\nJambatan Sultan Abdul\n\nHalim Mu'adzam Shah\n\nas shown on the map in\n\nthe Second Schedule\n\n (2)\n\nRoutes\n\nVehicles from the\n\nJuru-Jalan Duta-Bukit\n\nRaja Expressway, North\n\nSouth Expressway\n\nCentral Link and Kuala\n\nLumpur-Johore Bahru\n\nExpressway to Jambatan\n\nSultan Abdul Halim\n\nMu'adzam Shah shall use\n\nthe diverted route as\n\nshown on the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nVehicles from the\n\nJambatan Sultan Abdul\n\nHalim Mu'adzam Shah to\n\nJuru-Jalan Duta-Bukit\n\nRaja Expressway, North\n\nSouth Expressway\n\nCentral Link and Kuala\n\nLumpur-Johore Bahru\n\nExpressway shall use the\n\ndiverted route as shown\n\non the map in the Second\n\nSchedule\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition period\n\n18 June 2016 to 15\n\nSeptember 2016\n\n16 September 2016\n\nto 31 December\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nBATU KAWAN\n\nKM 3.1 KM 2.8\n\nWORKING AREA\n\na) DUAL CARRIAGEWAY CLOSURE KM 3.1 TO KM 2.8 EAST BOUND\n\nBATU MAUNG\n\nSTAGE 1: 18 JUNE 2016 TO 15 SEPTEMBER 2016\n\nLEGEND: ROAD TO WHICH PROHIBITION ORDER IS APPLICABLE DIVERSION NOT AS PER SCALE\n\nBATU KAWAN\n\nBATU MAUNG\n\nKM 3.1 KM 2.8\n\nb) DUAL CARRIAGEWAY CLOSURE KM 3.1 TO KM 2.8 WEST BOUND\n\nSTAGE 2: 16 SEPTEMBER 2016 TO 31 DECEMBER 2016\n\nWORKING AREA\n\nMade 17 June 2016\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15 Jld. 2;PN(PU2)460/LXXXVI]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1896"] = {"id":"MY-H1896","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年全国限速（暂时停止）（第2号）令","en":"NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (TEMPORARY CESSATION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","orig":"NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (TEMPORARY CESSATION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan (Pemberhentian Sementara) (Bilangan 2) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ quốc gia (Tạm ngừng) (số 2) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วแห่งชาติ (การหยุดชั่วคราว) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Nasional (Penghentian Sementara) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2017_P.U.(A)176-2017_NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (TEMPORARY CESSATION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1896-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan\n\n(Pemberhentian Sementara) (No. 2) 2017.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa mulai 18 Jun 2017 hingga 2 Julai 2017.\n\nPemberhentian sementara"}},{"id":"MY-H1896-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Subperenggan 2(1) Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan 1989\n\n[P.U. (A) 18/1989] yang memperuntukkan had laju 90 kilometer sejam bagi semua jalan\n\ndi Malaysia, selain jalan yang diperihalkan dalam Jadual kepada Perintah Had Laju\n\nKebangsaan 1989, hendaklah terhenti berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 18 Jun 2017\n\nhingga 2 Julai 2017.\n\n(2) Apabila habis tempoh Perintah ini, subperenggan 2(1)\n\nPerintah Had Laju Kebangsaan 1989 hendaklah berkuat kuasa seolah-olah Perintah\n\nini tidak dibuat.\n\nDibuat 9 Jun 2017\n\n[KP.PUU/W/BD/9; PN(PU2)460/XCI]\n\nDATO' SRI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\nMenteri Pengangkutan\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nNATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (TEMPORARY CESSATION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(1) of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1897"] = {"id":"MY-H1897","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年最低退休年龄（豁免）令","en":"MINIMUM RETIREMENT AGE (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2018","orig":"MINIMUM RETIREMENT AGE (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Umur Persaraan Minimum (Pengecualian) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Tuổi nghỉ hưu tối thiểu (Miễn trừ) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งอายุเกษียณขั้นต่ำ (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Usia Pensiun Minimum (Pembebasan) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)176-2018_MINIMUM RETIREMENT AGE (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1897-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Umur Persaraan Minimum\n\n(Pengecualian) 2018.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1897-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan Pembinaan BLT Sdn. Bhd. dengan nombor\n\npendaftaran 704498-D daripada semua peruntukan Akta berkenaan dengan orang\n\nyang dinamakan dalam Jadual yang diambil kerja untuk suatu kontrak perkhidmatan\n\nbertempoh tetap, termasuk apa-apa pelanjutan, yang melebihi enam puluh bulan\n\nbagi jawatan Pengurus Besar Kanan.\n\nJADUAL\n\n1. Nor Khairiah binti Abdul Halim\n\n2. Noor Azman bin Embi\n\nDibuat 24 Julai 2018\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/5/2; PN(PU2)722/IV]\n\nM. KULA SEGARAN\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nMINIMUM RETIREMENT AGE ACT 2012\n\nMINIMUM RETIREMENT AGE (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 18 of the\n\nMinimum Retirement Age Act 2012 [Act 753], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Minimum Retirement Age (Exemption)\n\nOrder 2018.\n\nExemption\n\n2. The Minister exempts Pembinaan BLT Sdn. Bhd. with the registration\n\nnumber 704498-D from all provisions of the Act in respect of the persons named in the\n\nSchedule who are employed on a fixed term contract of service, inclusive of any\n\nextension, of more than sixty months for the position as Senior General Manager.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Nor Khairiah binti Abdul Halim\n\n2. Noor Azman bin Embi\n\nMade 24 July 2018\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/5/2; PN(PU2)722/IV]\n\nM. KULA SEGARAN\n\nMinister of Human Resources"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1898"] = {"id":"MY-H1898","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年消费税（含糖饮料）（付款）令","en":"EXCISE DUTIES (SWEETENED BEVERAGES) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2019","orig":"EXCISE DUTIES (SWEETENED BEVERAGES) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Duti Eksais (Minuman Bergula) (Pembayaran) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tiêu thụ đặc biệt (Đồ uống có đường) (Thanh toán) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งภาษีสรรพสามิต (เครื่องดื่มที่มีน้ำตาล) (การชำระเงิน) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Cukai (Minuman Berpemanis) (Pembayaran) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)176-2019_EXCISE DUTIES (SWEETENED BEVERAGES) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1898-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Eksais (Minuman Bergula)\n(Bayaran) 2019.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Julai 2019.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H1898-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n \"minuman bergula\" ertinya barang-barang yang diperihalkan dalam ruang (1), (2)\ndan (3) di bawah kepala 20.09 Bab 20 dan kepala 22.02 Bab 23 Jadual kepada\nPerintah Duti Eksais 2017  [P.U. (A) 92/2017];\n\n\"pemegang lesen\" ertinya orang yang kepadanya lesen penggudangan\nminuman bergula dikeluarkan di bawah subseksyen 25(1) Akta;\n\n \"pengilang berlesen \" ertinya orang yang  kepadanya lesen mengilang\nminuman bergula dikeluarkan di bawah subseksyen 20(1) Akta;\n\n\"tempat yang dilesen\" ertinya mana -mana tempat penggilangan\nminuman bergula yang dinyatakan dalam lesen yang dikeluarkan kepada pengilang\nberlesen di bawah subseksyen 20(1) Akta.\n\nDuti Eksais"}},{"id":"MY-H1898-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ini hendaklah terpakai kepada pengilang berlesen dan pemegang lesen\nberkenaan dengan minuman bergula yang dikilangkan di Malaysia.\n\nTempoh bercukai bagi minuman bergula"}},{"id":"MY-H1898-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Tempoh bercukai bagi minuman bergula yang dikilangkan di Malaysia ialah\nsatu bulan kalendar.\n\nDuti eksais menjadi genap masa dan kena dibayar"}},{"id":"MY-H1898-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Duti eksais menjadi genap masa:\n\n(a) bagi pengilang berlesen di Malaysia, pada masa minuman bergula\ndipindahkan dari tempat yang dilesen  untuk kegunaan\ndalam Malaysia; dan\n\n(b) bagi minuman bergula yang disimpan oleh pemegang lesen dalam\ngudang berlesen, pada masa minuman bergula  itu dipindahkan dari\ngudang berlesen untuk kegunaan dalam Malaysia.\n\n(2) Duti eksais menjadi kena dibayar, berhubung dengan apa-apa duti eksais yang\nmenjadi genap masa  di bawah subperenggan (1)  dalam mana -mana bulan kalendar,\ntidak lewat daripada hari terakhir bulan berikutnya dari tamatnya tempoh bercukai itu.\n\nCara pembayaran bagi pemindahan minuman bergula dari tempat yang dilese n\natau gudang berlesen"}},{"id":"MY-H1898-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Jika duti eksai s minuman bergula menjadi kena dibayar di bawah\nsubperenggan 5(2), pengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen hendaklah menyerahkan\nkepada pegawai yang hak suatu akuan dalam borang yang ditetapkan  sebagai\nEksais No. 7 dalam Jadual Pertama kepada Peratur an-Peraturan Eksais 1977\n[P. U. (A) 161/1977 ] dan apa -apa butir lain sebagaimana yang dikehendaki\noleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\n(2) Akuan yang diserahkan di bawah subperenggan (1) hendaklah disahkan oleh\npengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen dalam  suatu penyata sebagaimana yang\nditentukan oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\n(3) Ketua Pengarah boleh, ji ka berpuas hati sedemikian, mem benarkan suatu\nsekuriti diberikan oleh pengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen bagi pembayaran\nduti eksais bagi minuman bergula yang dipindahkan dari tempat yang dilesen atau\ngudang berlesen.\n\n(4) Sekuriti yang diberikan di bawah subperenggan ( 3) hendaklah menjadi kena\ndibayar oleh pengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen bagi  minuman bergula yang\ndipindahkan dari tempat yang dilesen atau gudang berlesen dengan syarat bahawa—\n\n(a) pengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen pada setiap masa adalah\nbertanggungan bagi duti eksais ke atas  minuman  bergula  yang\ndipindahkan dari tempat yang dilesen atau gudang berlesen; dan\n\n(b) Ketua Pengarah boleh menuntut bayaran duti eksais daripada\npengilang berlesen atau pemegang lesen ke atas minuman bergula yang\ndipindahkan dari tempat yang dilesen atau gudang berlesen jika Ketua\nPengarah mempunyai sebab untuk mempercayai bahawa minuman\nbergula itu tidak dapat diakaunkan.\n\nDibuat 28 Jun 2019\n[Sulit KE.HT (96)669/19-8 Klt.3 SK.27; MOF.TAX(S) 700-2/1/60; PN(PU2)337/XXIII]\n\n                                          LIM GUAN ENG\n                                                 Menteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 6(2) Akta Eksais 1976]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE DUTIES (SWEETENED BEVERAGES) (PAYMENT) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 6(1) of the Excise Act 1976 [Act 176],\nthe Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1899"] = {"id":"MY-H1899","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年货币服务业（豁免费用）令","en":"MONEY SERVICES BUSINESS (EXEMPTION OF FEES) ORDER 2020","orig":"MONEY SERVICES BUSINESS (EXEMPTION OF FEES) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Perniagaan Perkhidmatan Wang (Pengecualian Fi) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Dịch vụ kinh doanh tiền tệ (Miễn phí) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งธุรกิจบริการเงินตรา (การยกเว้นค่าธรรมเนียม) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Usaha Jasa Keuangan (Pembebasan Biaya) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)176-2020_MONEY SERVICES BUSINESS (EXEMPTION OF FEES) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1899-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perniagaan Perkhidmatan\nWang (Pengecualian Fi) 2020.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2020.\n\nPengecualian fi"}},{"id":"MY-H1899-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan pemegang lesen daripada kehendak seksyen 8\nAkta berkenaan dengan pembayaran fi tahunan yang dinyatakan dalam butiran 3\nperenggan 1 Jadual Kedua kepada  Peraturan-Peraturan Perniagaan Perkhidmatan\nWang (Pelesenan) 2012 [P.U. (A) 70/2012] bagi tahun 2020.\n\n Dibuat 29 Mei 2020\n [BNM/JUN/1119/65/03; PN(PU2)701/IV]\n\nTENGKU DATO' SRI ZAFRUL TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nMONEY SERVICES BUSINESS ACT 2011\n\nMONEY SERVICES BUSINESS (EXEMPTION OF FEES) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 91 of the\nMoney Services Business Act 2011 [Act 731], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H190"] = {"id":"MY-H190","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=190&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":14,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1960年联邦首都法","en":"FEDERAL CAPITAL ACT 1960","orig":"FEDERAL CAPITAL ACT 1960","vi":"Luật về Thủ đô Liên bang năm 1960","th":"พระราชบัญญัติเมืองหลวงสหพันธ์ ค.ศ. 1960","id":"Undang-Undang Ibu Kota Federal Tahun 1960","ms":"Akta Ibu Kota Persekutuan 1960"},"level":"law","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT190","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1960","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 21 条；逐字未改写（AI 自行 OCR）；已清除正文中的 5 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-ai","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\1960_190_FEDERAL CAPITAL ACT 1960.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H190-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Federal Capital Act, short title\n1960, and shall come into force on|such date as the Minister *\"4¢o\"™\n\n. : : i t.\nmay by notification in the appoint. & pre thee l- LN fe}"}},{"id":"MY-H190-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires— _Interpre-\n\n\"Advisory Board\" means the Advisory Board established \"\"°™\nunder section 5;\n\n\"appointed day\" means the day appointed under section 1;\n\n\"Commissioner\" means the Commissioner appointed\nunder section 3;\n\n\"Minister\" means the Minister flor the time being charged\nwith responsibility for the municipality;\n\n\"municipality\" means the muni¢ipality of Kuala Lumpur.\n\nParT I\nTHE COMMISSIONER AND JADVISORY BOARD"}},{"id":"MY-H190-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"3. (1) The municipal affairs of the municipality of the Appoint-\nFederal capital of Kuala Lumpur shall, on and after the Commis-\n\nappointed day, be administered by a Commissioner. _,§—\n\n(2) The Commissioner shall beé appointed by the Yang\ndi-Pertuan Agong for a term of jfive years or, if the Yang\ndi-Pertuan Agong in any particular case so determines, for\nsuch shorter term as may be so determined.\n\n(3) Subject to the provisions pf this Act, the Commis-\nsioner shall hold office upon sugh conditions as the Yang\ndi-Pertuan Agong may from time to time determine.\n\n(4) If at any time it appears to the Yang di-Pertuan\nAgong that the removal from office of any person holding;\nthe office of Commissioner is ngcessary in the interests of\nthe effective administration of the affairs of the municipality,\nhe may, without assigning any reason therefor, remove such\nperson from office.\n\nnaa\n312 35 oF 1960\n\n(5) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may from time to time\naccept the resignation of the, Commissioner.\n\n(6) Where by or under this Act or any other written law\nthe Commissioner is empowered to exercise any powers or\nperform any duties he may |by instrument in writing dele-\ngate, subject to such conditipns and restrictions as may be\nprescribed in such instrumert, the exercise of such powers\nor the performance of such duties to any person described\nby name or office:\n\nProvided that nothing in this section shall apply to any\npower to make any subsidiary legislation conferred upon\nhim by or under this Act orjany other written law.\n\nCommis- 4. (1) The Commissioner} shall be for' all purposes a\nbeabody corporation sole under the) name of the \"Pesuroh Jaya\ncorporate. Jbu Kota Kuala Lumpur\" pr, in English, the \"Commis-\n\n4 sioner of the Federal Capital of Kuala Lumpur\".\n\n(2) The Commissioner shall have an official seal which\nshall be authenticated by the signature of the person for\nthe time being holding the Office of Commissioner, or by\nwel other person authorised} by the Commissioner in that\n\nehalf.\n\n(3) The seal of the Commissioner shall be officially and\njudicially noticed, and every document purporting ‘to be\nissued or made by the Comimissioner‘and sealed with the\nseal of the Commissioner, aythenticated as provided under\nsub-section (2), shall in any litigation or proceeding be\ndeemed to be so made or |issued without further proof,\nunless the contrary is shown\n\n(4) A certificate signed by the Commissioner certifying\nthat any instrument purporting to be made or issued by\nhim was so made or issued shall be conclusive evidence of\nthe fact so certified. ,\n\nAdvisory 5. (1) There shall be established for the purpose of this\n\nBoard. Act a body, to be known] as the \"Lembaga Penasehat\nKuala Lumpur\" or, in English, the Advisory Board of the\nFederal Capital, to advise the Commissioner upon such\nmatters connected with the} administration of the muni-\ncipality as the Yang di-Perthan Agong may by order pre-\nscribe, and upon any questions referred to the Board by\nthe Minister or the Commissioner.\n\n(2) Subject to the provisions of this Act and any regula-\ntions made thereunder, the meetings and procedure of the\nAdvisory Board shall be determined by the Board.\n\n(3) All members of the Advisory Board shall be deemed\nto be public servants within the meaning of the Penal Code.\nFEDERAL CAPITAL 313"}},{"id":"MY-H190-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"6. (1) The Advisory Board shal consist of such persons oe\n\nthereof by ie Yang Advisory\ndi-Pertuan Agong by notification|in the Gazette? Board.\n\n(2) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may, subject to the\nprovisions of this Act, by regulations provide for the\nnumber, nature, appointment, term of office, qualifications,\ndisqualifications, seniority and conditions of retirement of\nmembers of the Advisory Board,}jand.for the meetings and\nprocedure of the Board.\n_ 7. (1) The Commissioner shall so far as is practicable Commis-\nattend and preside at all meetings of the Advisory Board, recat\nand in his absence any member of the Board appointed by meetings of\nthe Minister in that behalf in wiiting or, in the absence of $V\"\nany such member, the senior ember of the Advisory\nBoard actually present shall preside. ~\n\n(2) The Commissioner or other person presiding at any\nmeeting of the Advisory Board shall cast his vote whenever\nnecessary to avoid an equality of votes, but shall not vote\nin any other case:"}},{"id":"MY-H190-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"8. (1) Minutes shall be mepi of all proceedings of the Minutes.\nAdvisory Board.\n\n(2) At every ordinary meeting of the Advisory Board the\n\nMinutes of the last preceding meeting shall be confirmed,\n\nwith or without amendment,‘jas the case may require,\n\nbefore proceeding to the desp tch of any other business.\nfter consultation with the Commis-"}},{"id":"MY-H190-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"9. The Commissioner may,\nMinister, act in opposition to |the advice given to him by ie in\nthe Advisory Board, if in any case he shall think fit to do gy a\nSO; but i in any such case— to Advisory\n\nBoard,\n(a) he shall record fully in| writing, for inclusion in the\nMinutes, the grounds and reasons for his deci-\n\nsion;\n\n(5) it' shall be competent for any member of the\nAdvisory Board to/require that there shall be\nrecorded in the Minutes any advice or opinion\nthat he may have jgiven upon the question in\ndispute, and the grounds therefor."}},{"id":"MY-H190-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"10. The Public Authorities Protection Ordinance, 1948, ne\n_ Shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceeding protection.\nagainst the Commissioner or the Advisory Board or against /9 of 1948.\nany member, officer, servant or agent of the Commissioner\nin respect of any act, neglect or default done or committed\nby him in such capacity.\nPowers and\nduties of\nCommis-\nsioner.\n\nPower of\nMinister to\nissue |\ndirections,\n\n314 35 oF 1960\n\n» 11. (1) The Commissioner Shall, subject to the provisions\n\nof. this Act, have and may) exercise all the powers and\n\nperform all the duties conferred or ‘imposed upon the\n\nMunicipal Councillors of Kuala Lumpur, the President\nand any Councillor or officer thereof immediately before\n\nthe appointed day,\n(2) Subject to the provisi\n\nons of this Act and any order\nmade under sub-section (2)\n\nf section 16, wherever in any\nwritten law, deed, document or other instrument, — the\n\noperation of which has not lapsed or been discharged\nprior to the appointed day, there appears the name of the\nMunicipal Councillors of K ‘ala Lumpur, such law, deed,\ndocument or other instrument shall, unless the context\notherwise requires, be read} and construed as if there\n\nwere substituted therefor the corporate name. of the\nCommissioner."}},{"id":"MY-H190-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"12. (1) The Minister may, from time to time give the\nCommissioner directions of | general character, and not\ninconsistent with the provisions of this Act, on the policy\n\n__, to be followed in the exercise |of the powers conferred and\n\nAnnual\nreport.\n\nLaw Officers,\netc., ¢m-\npowered\n\nto appear\nfor Com-\nmissioner.\n\nthe duties imposed on the Commissioner by or under this\n\nAct in relation to matters which appear to him to affect\nthe interests of the municipality, and the Commissioner shall\nas soon as possible giye effect |to all such directions.\n\n(2) The Commissioner shall furnish the Minister with\nsuch returns, accounts and otHer information with Tespect\nto the property and activities bf the Commissioner as the\nMinister may from time to \"t require. ,"}},{"id":"MY-H190-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"13. (1) The Commissioner shall. as soon as practicable\nafter the end of each year, cause to be made and transmitted\nto the Minister a report dealing] generally with the activities\nof the Commissioner during the preceding year, and contain-\ning such information relating td the policy of the Commis-\nsioner and the affairs of the municipality as the Minister may\n\nfrom time to time direct.\n\n(2) The Minister shall cause a copy of every such report\nto be laid on the table of the Dewan Negara and the Dewan\nRa‘ayat.\n\n14, The Attorney-General, th Solicitor-General, and any\nFederal Counsel may appear at d plead. and' do all other\nthings necessary in respect of any litigation or proceeding\nin any court in the Federation in respect: of. any matter\naffecting the Commissioner or the affairs of the municipality.\n\n\"\n\nx\nhg a SS\n\n———————\n\nTransfer of\nproperty, etc.\n\nExisting\ncontracts\nand pro-\nceedings.\n\nContinuance\nof agree-\nments of\nservice, etc.\n\na si rat\n\n316 - 35 oF 1960\n\n(2) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may within the period of\ntwo years beginning with the appointed day by order amend,\n\n. adapt or repeal any written Jaw affecting the municipality\n\nand in force immediately before the appointed day if he shall\nconsider it expedient or necessary to do so for the purpose\nof bringing the provisions of such written law into accord\nwith the provisions of this Act.pr of removing any difficulties\n\n'. arising with respect to the transitional provisions ofthis Act."}},{"id":"MY-H190-A17","no":17,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 17"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"17. (1) Subject to the provisions of this section and to any\ndirection of the Yang di-Pertwan Agong, all property and\nassets which immediately before the appointed day were\nvested in the Municipal Coun\nany person on behalf of su h Councillors shall on the\nappointed day vest in the Commissioner.\n\n(2) All land immediately before the appointed day vested _\n\n«in or reserved under the provisions of any written law relat-\ning to land for the purpose of the Municipal Councillors of\nKuala Lumpur shall, upon the appointed day, as: the case\nmay be vest in or be deemed to, be reserved for the purpose\nof the Commissioner."}},{"id":"MY-H190-A18","no":18,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 18"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"18. (1) Subject to the provisions of this Part, all deeds,\nbonds, agreements, instruments} and working arrangements\n\n. subsisting immediately beforé the appointed day and\n\naffecting any of the property transferred under section 17\nshall be of full force and effect|against or in favour of the\nCommissioner, and enforceable as fully and effectually as if,\ninstead of the Municipal Councillors of Kuala Lumpur, or\nany person acting on behalf lof such Councillors, the\nCommissioner had been named therein or had been a\nparty thereto. i.\n\n(2) Subject to the provisions of this Act, any y proceedings\nor cause of action pending or existing immediately before\nthe appointed day by or against! the Municipal Councillors\nof Kuala Lumpur or any person acting on behalf of such\nCouncillors may: be continued or instituted by or against\nthe Commissioner as it might have been by or against the\nMunicipal Councillors of Kuala |Lumpur or ‘such person if\nthis Act had not been enacted."}},{"id":"MY-H190-A19","no":19,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 19"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"19. Every person who immediately before the appointed\nday was employed by the Munidipal Councillors of Kuala\nLumpur shall upon the appointed day be deemed to be\ntransferred to the service of th Commissioner upon the\nsame terms and conditions of service as those obtaining\nimmediately before the appointed day.\n'\n\nFEDERAL CAPITAL 317"}},{"id":"MY-H190-A20","no":20,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 20"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"20. All the powers conferred upon the Ruler in Council\nof the State of Selangor by section 8 of the Municipal\nOrdinance (Extended Application) Ordinance, 1948, shall in\nrelation to the municipality, be deemed to be conferred, on\nand after the appointed day, upon the Yang di-Pertuan\nAgong."}},{"id":"MY-H190-A21","no":21,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 21"},"chapter":{"en":"ParT I"},"text":{"en":"21. (1) On the coming into force of|this Act Parts I and R\n\nII of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, 1950, shall\ncease to apply to the municipality, andj any order then sub-\nsisting under section 52 of such Ordinance in relation to\nthe municipality shall thereupon determine.\n\n(2) The Constitution of the Municipality of Kuala Lum-\npur, promulgated under section 4 of the Local Authorities\nElections Ordinance, 1950, as from time to time amended,\nis hereby repealed, and any person whp immediately before\nthe appointed day was the President or a Councillor of the\nCouncil established under the Municipal Ordinance and\nsuch Constitution shall on the appoimted day cease to be\nsuch President or Councillor, as the fase may be.\n\n(3) The Federal Capital (Municipal Elections) Ordinance,\n1958, is hereby repealed.\n\nthe Royal Assent\non the 7th daf of October;\n\nPowers re-\nlating to\nthe Munici-\npal Ordi-\nnance,\nP.M.\n\n3 of 1948.\n\nepeal\n52 of 1950.\n\nSel. G.N.\n194/60.\n\nSel. G.N.\n351/51,\n\n32 of 1958.\n\nSection\n\nIl.\n\n19,\nal.\n\nPON AAD w\n\n- 35 oF 1960\n\nTABLE OF CONTENTS\n\nShort title and commencement.\nInterpretation.\nParr I'\n‘THE COMMISSIONER AND ADVISORY BOARD\nAppointment of Commissioner.\nCommissioner to be a body corporate.\n\n. Advisory Board.\n‘Constitution of Advisory Board.\n\nCommissioner to preside at meetings of Advisory Board.\nMinutes.\n\n‘Cofnmissioner' may act in opposition to Advisory tl\n\nPublic authorities protection.\n\nPowers arid duties of Commissioner.\nPower of Minister to issue directions.\nAnnual report.\n\nLaw Officers, etc., empowered to appear for Commissioner.\n~~\n\nPart II\nBOUNDARIES OF THE MUNICIPALITY\nPower to determine boundaries of Federal Capital.\n\nPart Il\n\nTRANSITIONAL PROVISIONS\nExisting laws, etc.\nTransfer of property, etc.\nExisting contracts and proceedings.\nContinuance of agreements of service, etc.\nPowers relating to the Municipal Ordinance.\nRepeal.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\n\nPRINTED BY THE GOVERNMENT PRINTER AND PUBLISHED BY AUTHORITY ON 13TH OCTOBER, 1960\n\nPrice: 50 cts."}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1900"] = {"id":"MY-H1900","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2021&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年雇员公积金局（修正）（第2号）规则","en":"EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) RULES 2021","orig":"EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) RULES 2021","ms":"Kaedah Kumpulan Wang Simpanan Pekerja (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2021","vi":"Quy tắc về Quỹ Tiết kiệm Nhân viên (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2021","th":"กฎกองทุนสำรองเลี้ยงชีพพนักงาน (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Tata Tertib Dana Simpanan Karyawan (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2021_P.U.(A)176-2021_EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) RULES 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1900-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Kumpulan Wang\n\nSimpanan Pekerja (Pindaan) (No. 2) 2021.\n\n (2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Mei 2021.\n\nPindaan kaedah 41"}},{"id":"MY-H1900-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Kumpulan Wang Simpanan Pekerja 1991 [P.U. (A) 493/1991]\n\ndipinda dalam kaedah 41—\n\n(a) dalam subkaedah (10A)—\n\n(i) dalam nota birai, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"atau anaknya\"\n\ndengan perkataan \", anaknya, suami atau isterinya atau ibu atau\n\nbapanya\";\n\n(ii) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"atau bagi anaknya,\" dengan\n\nperkataan \", anaknya, suami atau isterinya atau ibu atau bapanya,\";\n\n(iii) dalam perenggan (a), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"atau anaknya\"\n\ndengan perkataan \", anaknya, suami atau isterinya atau ibu atau\n\nbapanya\"; dan\n\n(iv) dengan menggantikan perenggan (c) dengan perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(c) anak, suami atau isteri atau ibu atau bapa ahli Kumpulan Wang\n\nitu telah mengambil pinjaman bagi pembiayaan bagi pengajian\n\ntinggi anak, suami atau isteri atau ibu atau bapa ahli Kumpulan\n\nWang itu dan pinjaman itu masih belum dibayar.\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subkaedah (10E)—\n\n(i) dengan memasukkan selepas takrif \"anak\" takrif yang berikut:\n\n‘ \"ibu atau bapa\" mempunyai erti yang diberikan kepadanya dalam\n\nsubkaedah (10M) Kaedah-Kaedah ini;';\n\n(ii) dengan menggantikan takrif \"institusi pengajian\" dengan takrif yang\n\nberikut:\n\n‘ \"institusi pengajian\" ertinya suatu institusi yang berdaftar atau\n\nditubuhkan di bawah mana-mana undang-undang bertulis\n\ndi dalam atau di luar Malaysia yang menyediakan pengajian tinggi;';\n\n(iii) dengan menggantikan takrif \"pengajian tinggi\" dengan takrif yang\n\nberikut:\n\n‘ \"pengajian tinggi\" ertinya kursus pengajian tinggi di peringkat\n\nsijil, peringkat diploma atau yang setaraf dengannya, peringkat\n\nijazah atau yang setaraf dengannya, peringkat ijazah lanjutan atau\n\nyang setaraf dengannya, atau kursus profesional atau kemahiran;';\n\ndan\n\n(iv) dengan memasukkan selepas takrif \"pengajian tinggi\" takrif yang\n\nberikut:\n\n‘ \"suami atau isteri\" mempunyai erti yang diberikan kepadanya\n\ndalam subkaedah (10M) Kaedah-Kaedah ini.'.\n\nDibuat 7 April 2021\n\n[KWSP/JUU/015/24; PN(PU2)498/Jld.17]\n\n TAN SRI AHMAD BADRI BIN MOHD ZAHIR\n\n Pengerusi\n\n Lembaga Kumpulan Wang Simpanan Pekerja\n\nEMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND ACT 1991\n\nEMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) RULES 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 73 of the\n\nEmployees Provident Fund Act 1991 [Act 452], the Board makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1901"] = {"id":"MY-H1901","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年销售税（税率）令","en":"SALES TAX (RATES OF TAX) ORDER 2022","orig":"SALES TAX (RATES OF TAX) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Cukai Jualan (Kadar-Kadar Cukai) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế bán hàng (Các thuế suất) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งภาษีขาย (อัตราภาษี) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Pajak Penjualan (Tarif-Tarif Pajak) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)176-2022_SALES TAX (RATES OF TAX) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1901-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Jualan\n(Kadar Cukai) 2022.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2022.\n\nKadar cukai jualan"}},{"id":"MY-H1901-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Kadar cukai jualan yang hendak dikenakan dan dilevikan hendaklah\nditetapkan pada sepuluh peratus ke atas semua barang kecuali—\n\n(a) barang yang termasuk dalam mana -mana perintah penge cualian\nyang dibuat di bawah seksyen 35 Akta; dan\n\n(b) barang yang diimport pada atau dengan mana -mana orang\nyang memasuki Malaysia atau dalam bagasi orang itu dan barang itu\nbukan bagi kegunaan perdagangan, tidak termasuk kenderaan\nbermotor, minuman keras, spirit, tembakau, rokok, tayar dan tiub.\n\n (2) Walau apa pun subperenggan 2(1), cukai jualan yang hendak dikenakan\ndan dilevikan ke atas barang yang terdapat—\n\n(a) dalam Jadual Pertama  hendaklah ditetapkan  pada kadar\nlima peratus; dan\n\n(b) dalam Jadual Kedua hendaklah ditetapkan pada kadar yang\ndinyatakan dalam ruang (4) Jadual Kedua.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H1901-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Cukai Jualan (Kadar Cukai) 2018 [P.U. (A) 221/2018] dibatalkan.\n\nSALES TAX ACT 2018\n\nSALES TAX (RATES OF TAX ) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(2) of the\nSales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1902"] = {"id":"MY-H1902","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年印花税（豁免）令","en":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2023","orig":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tem (Miễn trừ) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งอากรแสตมป์ (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Bea Meterai (Pembebasan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)176-2023_STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1902-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)     Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Setem\n(Pengecualian) 2023.\n\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2022.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1902-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1)  Menteri mengecualikan d uti setem berkenaan dengan mana -mana\nperjanjian pinjaman untuk membiayai pembelian harta kediaman menerusi\nInisiatif Pemilik an Kediaman Malaysia (i -Miliki) di bawah Program Pemilikan\nKediaman 2022/2023, yang bernilai tidak melebihi lima ratus ribu ringgit, yang\ndisempurnakan antara seseorang individu yang dinamakan dalam suatu perjanjian jual\nbeli dengan—\n\n(a) suatu bank berlesen di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013\n[Akta 758];\n\n(b) suatu bank Islam berlesen di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan\nIslam 2013 [Akta 759];\n\n(c) suatu institusi kewangan pembangunan yang ditetapkan di bawah\nAkta Institusi Kewangan Pembangunan 2002 [Akta 618];\n\n(d) suatu koperasi yang didaftarkan di bawah Akta Koperasi 1993\n[Akta 502];\n\n(e) mana-mana majikan yang menyediakan suatu skim pinjaman\nperumahan pekerja;\n\n(f) Borneo Housing Mortgage Finance Berhad (Nombor Pendaftaran\nSyarikat: 25457 -V) yang diperbadankan di bawah\nAkta Syarikat 2016 [Akta 777];\n\n(g) Mutiara Mortgage and Credit Sdn Bhd (Nombor Pendaftaran\nSyarikat: 257663 -T) yang diperbadankan di bawah\nAkta Syarikat 2016;\n\n(h) suatu penanggung insurans berlesen yang dibenarkan untuk\nmenyediakan suatu pinjaman perumahan di bawah\nAkta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013; atau\n\n(i) suatu pengendali takaful berlesen yang dibenarkan untuk\nmenyediakan suatu pinjaman perumahan Islam di bawah\nAkta Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam 2013.\n\n(2) Pengecualian duti setem di bawah subperenggan (1) hendaklah hanya\nterpakai sekiranya—\n\n(a) perjanjian jual beli bagi pembelian harta kediaman itu adalah\nantara  seseorang individu dengan suatu pemaju perumahan;\n\n(b) harga belian dalam perjanjian jual beli yang disebut dalam\nsubsubperenggan (a) ialah suatu harga selepas suatu diskaun\nsekurang-kurangnya sepuluh peratus daripada harga asal yang\nditawarkan oleh pemaju perumahan itu sebagaimana yang\ndiluluskan dalam Permit Iklan dan Jualan di bawah Akta Pemajuan\nPerumahan (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 1966 [ Akta 118 ],\nEnakmen Pemajuan Perumahan  (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 1978\n[Sabah No. 24 tahun 1978] atau Ordinan Pemajuan Perumahan\n(Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 2013  Sarawak [Bab 69] kecuali bagi\nsuatu harta kediaman yang tertakluk kepada harga terkawal;\n\n(c) perjanjian jual beli bagi pembelian harta kediaman itu\ndisempurnakan pada atau selepas 1 Jun 2022 tetapi tidak lewat\n daripada 31 Disember 2023 dan disetemkan dengan sewajarnya\ntidak lewat daripada 31 Januari 2024; dan\n\n(d) individu itu tidak pernah memiliki apa -apa harta kediaman\ntermasuk harta kediaman yang diperoleh secara pewarisan\natau pemberian, yang dipegang sama ada secara individu\natau bersesama.\n\n(3) Permohonan bagi pengecualian duti setem di bawah subperenggan (1)\nhendaklah disertakan dengan akuan berkanun di bawah Akta Akuan Berkanun 1960\n[Akta 783] oleh—\n\n(a) pemaju perumahan itu yang mengesahkan pemberian suatu\ndiskaun sekurang-kurangnya sepuluh peratus daripada harga asal\nyang ditawarkan oleh pemaju perumahan itu sebagaimana yang\ndiluluskan dalam Permit Iklan dan Jualan di bawah\nAkta Pemajuan Perumahan (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 19 66\n[Akta 118 ], Enakmen Pemajuan Perumahan (Kawalan dan\nPelesenan) 1978 [ Sabah No. 24 tahun 1978] atau\nOrdinan Pemajuan Perumah an (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 2013\nSarawak [Bab 69] kecuali bagi suatu harta kediaman yang tertakluk\nkepada harga terkawal; dan\n\n(b) individu yang disebut dalam subperenggan (1) yang mengesahkan\nbahawa individu itu tidak pernah memiliki apa -apa harta\nkediaman termasuk suatu harta kediaman yang diperoleh secara\npewarisan atau pemberian, yang dipegang sama ada secara\nindividu atau bersesama.\n(4) Dalam perenggan ini—\n\n(a) \"harta kediaman\" ertinya suatu rumah, suatu unit kondominium,\nsuatu pangsapuri atau suatu rumah pangsa, yang dibeli atau\ndiperoleh semata-mata untuk digunakan sebagai suatu rumah\nkediaman, dan termasuk suatu pangsapuri perkhidmatan dan\npejabat kecil pejabat rumah (SOHO) yang baginya pemaju\nperumahan itu mendapat ke lulusan Lesen Pemaju Perumahan\ndan Permit Iklan dan Jualan di bawah Akta Pemajuan\nPerumahan (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 1966 [ Akta 118 ],\nEnakmen Pemajuan Peruma han (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 1978\n[Sabah No. 24 tahun 1978] atau Ordinan Pemajuan Perumahan\n(Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 2013 Sarawak [Bab 69]; dan\n\n(b) \"individu\" ertinya seorang pembeli suatu harta kediaman yang\nmerupakan seorang warganegara Malaysia atau pembeli  bersama\nsuatu harta kediaman yang merupakan warganegara Malaysia.\n\nDibuat 8 Jun 2023\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/11JLD.3(56); LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1/7(29)-124; PN(PU2)159/JLD.36]\n\nANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nSTAMP ACT 1949\n\nSTAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 80(1) of the Stamp Act 1949\n[Act 378], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1903"] = {"id":"MY-H1903","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年通信与多媒体（许可）（修正）条例","en":"COMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2024","orig":"COMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2024","ms":"Peraturan Komunikasi dan Multimedia (Pelesenan) (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Quy định về Truyền thông và đa phương tiện (Cấp phép) (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"ข้อบังคับการสื่อสารและมัลติมีเดีย (การออกใบอนุญาต) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Peraturan Komunikasi dan Multimedia (Perizinan) (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2024_P.U.(A)176-2024_COMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1903-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKomunikasi dan Multimedia (Pelesenan) (Pindaan) 2024.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Julai 2024.\n\nPindaan peraturan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H1903-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Komunikasi dan Multimedia (Pelesenan) 2000\n\n[P.U. (A) 129/2000], yang disebut \"Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nini, dipinda dalam peraturan 2 dengan menggantikan takrif \"fi lesen tahunan yang\n\nterpakai\" dengan takrif yang berikut:\n\n‘ \"fi lesen tahunan yang terpakai\" ertinya fi lesen tahunan yang terpakai\n\nyang dinyatakan dalam ruang 4 Susunan B Jadual Pertama;'.\n\nPindaan peraturan 33"}},{"id":"MY-H1903-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perenggan 33(3)(a) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nperkataan \"RM50,000.00\" dengan perkataan \"satu ratus ribu ringgit\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1903-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama dalam Susunan B,\n\ndengan menggantikan butir-butir dalam ruang 4 dengan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nFi Lesen Tahunan\n\nYang Terpakai\n\n(RM)\n\nDibawa ke\n\nHadapan\n\n……………………\n\n \"Fi lesen tahunan yang terpakai itu tidak kurang\n\ndaripada 0.15% daripada pusing ganti kasar setiap lesen atau\n\nRM100,000.00 setiap lesen, mengikut mana-mana yang\n\nlebih tinggi dan hendaklah ditentukan mengikut formula\n\nyang berikut:\n\nA – B = C\n\niaitu\n\nA ialah Fi Lesen Tahunan Standard\n\nB ialah Rebet atas Fi Lesen\n\nC ialah Fi Lesen Tahunan Yang Terpakai\".\n\nKecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H1903-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Apa-apa permohonan lesen individu atau pembaharuan lesen individu\n\nyang dibuat di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu yang belum selesai sebaik sebelum\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa hendaklah diuruskan di bawah\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ibu seolah-olah Peraturan-Peraturan ibu tidak dipinda oleh\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini.\n\n(2) Apa-apa lesen individu yang telah dikeluarkan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nibu sebelum tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Peraturan-Peraturan ini hendaklah terus sah\n\nsehingga habis tempoh lesen individu itu atau pembatalan lesen individu itu seolah-olah\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ibu tidak dipinda oleh Peraturan-Peraturan ini.\n\nDibuat 27 Jun 2024\n\n[KKD.BKM.(S).100-1/1/13(3); PN(PU2)601/JLD.13]\n\n AHMAD FAHMI BIN MOHAMED FADZIL\n\n Menteri Komunikasi\n\nCOMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA ACT 1998\n\nCOMMUNICATIONS AND MULTIMEDIA (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT)\n\nREGULATIONS 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 16 of the\n\nCommunications and Multimedia Act 1998 [Act 588], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1904"] = {"id":"MY-H1904","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2025&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（西海岸大道（太平—万津））（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTING)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTING)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc Bờ Tây (Taiping-Banting)) (Sửa đổi) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางด่วนชายฝั่งตะวันตก (ไทปิง-บันติง)) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Tol Pantai Barat (Taiping-Banting)) (Perubahan) Tahun 2025","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuhraya Pantai Barat (Taiping-Banting)) (Pindaan) 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)176-2025_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTIN.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1904-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Ayer\n\nHitam\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19","ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Pesisiran Pantai Barat\n\n(Taiping-Banting)) (Pindaan) 2025.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 13 Jun 2025.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H1904-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. SKVE\n\nSaujana\n\nPutra\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19","ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuh Raya Pesisiran Pantai Barat (Taiping-Banting)) 2020 [P.U. (A) 14/2020], yang\n\ndisebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam perenggan 2—\n\n(a) dalam subperenggan (1)—\n\n(i) dalam subsubperenggan (e), dengan memotong perkataan \"dan\"\n\ndi hujung subsubperenggan itu;\n\n(ii) dalam subsubperenggan (f), dengan menggantikan noktah\n\ndi hujung subsubperenggan itu dengan perkataan \"; dan\"; dan\n\n(iii) dengan memasukkan selepas subsubperenggan (f)\n\nsubsubperenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(g) kilometer 12.51 di koordinat U 324492.234, T 391350.504\n\nGrid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer\n\n19.43 di koordinat U 330516.392, T 388076.946 Grid RSO\n\nGeosentrik (GDM 2000) (kedua-dua jarak diukur dari\n\nkilometer 0.0 Lebuh Raya Pesisiran Pantai Barat\n\n(Taiping–Banting) di Persimpangan Bertingkat Banting)\n\ntermasuklah Persimpangan Bertingkat SKVE, Plaza Tol SAE,\n\nPersimpangan Bertingkat SAE dan jalan-jalan sambungannya,\n\niaitu suatu jarak sepanjang 6.92 kilometer.\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subperenggan (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Peta D dan\n\nPeta E\" dengan perkataan \"Peta D, Peta E dan Peta F\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1904-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Teluk\n\nPanglima\n\nGarang\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19","ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama—\n\n(a) di bawah kepala Plaza Tol Keluar: Banting—\n\n(i) dalam teks bahasa Inggeris, dengan menggantikan kepala\n\n\"Exit Toll: Banting\" dengan kepala \"Exit Toll Plaza: Banting\";\n\n(ii) berhubung dengan butiran 1. Ayer Hitam hingga 4. Pulau Indah,\n\ndengan menggantikan butir-butir dalam ruang (2) dengan\n\nbutir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh\n\nOperasi\n\n\"10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\"\n\n; dan\n\n(iii) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 4. Pulau Indah\n\ndan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya butiran dan\n\nbutir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas kepala Plaza Tol Keluar: Banting, butiran dan\n\nbutir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya kepala, butiran\n\ndan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n\"Plaza Tol Keluar: SAE\n\n(1)\n\nPlaza Tol\n\nMasuk\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh\n\nOperasi\n\n(3)\n\nTol Kena Dibayar (RM) Mengikut Kelas\n\nKenderaan\n\nKelas 1 Kelas 2 Kelas 3 Kelas 4 Kelas 5\n\n\"5. SAE\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n3.53 7.06 10.59 1.76 2.64\"\n\n(1)\n\nPlaza Tol\n\nMasuk\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh\n\nOperasi\n\n(3)\n\nTol Kena Dibayar (RM) Mengikut Kelas\n\nKenderaan\n\nKelas 1 Kelas 2 Kelas 3 Kelas 4 Kelas 5"}},{"id":"MY-H1904-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. Pulau\n\nIndah\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19"}},{"id":"MY-H1904-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Banting\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n3.53 7.06 10.59 1.76 2.64\n\n;\n\n\"; dan\n\n\".\n\n(c) dengan menggantikan kepala \"Plaza Tol Keluar: Ayer Hitam/\n\nSKVE Saujana Putra/Teluk Panglima Garang/Ayer Hitam di Lebuh Raya\n\nLembah Klang Selatan (SKVE)\", butiran dan butir-butir yang berhubungan\n\ndengannya dengan kepala, butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n\"Plaza Tol Keluar: Ayer Hitam/SKVE Saujana Putra/Teluk Panglima Garang/\n\nAyer Hitam di Lebuh Raya Lembah Klang Selatan (SKVE)\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua\n\n4. Perintah ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Kedua dengan memasukkan selepas Peta E\n\npeta yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nPlaza Tol\n\nMasuk\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh\n\nOperasi\n\n(3)\n\nTol Kena Dibayar (RM) Mengikut Kelas\n\nKenderaan\n\nKelas 1 Kelas 2 Kelas 3 Kelas 4 Kelas 5\n\n1. Banting\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n2.34 4.69 7.03 1.17 1.76\n\n 2. SAE\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19\n\n\".\n\n\"PETA F\n\nPERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT SKVE-PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT SAE\n\nDibuat 9 Jun 2025\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/20 Jld.2; PN(PU2)426/JLD.73]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(WEST COAST EXPRESSWAY (TAIPING-BANTING)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of the Federal Roads\n\n(Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (Private Management)\n\n(Collection of Tolls) (West Coast Expressway (Taiping-Banting))\n\n(Amendment) Order 2025.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 13 June 2025.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2\n\n2. The Federal Roads (Private Management) (Collection of Tolls)\n\n(West Coast Expressway (Taiping-Banting)) Order 2020 [P.U. (A) 14/2020], which\n\nis referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended in paragraph 2—\n\n(a) in subparagraph (1)—\n\n(i) in subsubparagraph (e), by deleting the word \"and\" at the end\n\nof the subsubparagraph;\n\n(ii) in subsubparagraph (f), by substituting for the full stop at\n\nthe end of the subsubparagraph the words \"; and\"; and\n\n(iii) by inserting after subsubparagraph (f) the following\n\nsubsubparagraph:\n\n\"(g) kilometre 12.51 at coordinates N 324492.234,\n\nE 391350.504 of the RSO Geocentric (GDM 2000)\n\nGrid and ending at kilometre 19.43 at coordinates\n\nN 330516.392, E 388076.946 of the RSO Geocentric\n\n(GDM 2000) Grid (both distances measured from\n\nkilometre 0.0 of the West Coast Expressway\n\n(Taiping-Banting) at the Banting Interchange)\n\nincluding SKVE Interchange, SAE Toll Plaza,\n\nSAE Interchange and its link roads, being a distance\n\nof 6.92 kilometre.\"; and\n\n(b) in subparagraph (2), by substituting for the words \"Map D\n\nand Map E\" the words \"Map D, Map E and Map F\".\n\nAmendment of First Schedule\n\n3. The principal Order is amended in the First Schedule—\n\n(a) under the heading of Exit Toll: Banting—\n\n(i) in the English language text, by substituting for the heading\n\n\"Exit Toll: Banting\" the heading \"Exit Toll Plaza: Banting\";\n\n(ii) in relation to items 1. Ayer Hitam until 4. Pulau Indah,\n\nby substituting for particulars in column (2) the following\n\nparticulars:\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod of\n\nOperation\n\n\"10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\" ; and\n\n(iii) by inserting after item 4. Pulau Indah and the particulars\n\nrelating to it the following item and particulars:\n\n(b) by inserting after the heading of Exit Toll Plaza: Banting, items and\n\nparticulars relating to it the following heading, items and particulars:\n\n\"Exit Toll Plaza: SAE\n\n(1)\n\nEntry Toll\n\nPlaza\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod of\n\nOperation\n\n(3)\n\nToll Payable (RM) According to Classes of\n\nVehicles\n\nClass 1 Class 2 Class 3 Class 4 Class 5\n\n\"5. SAE\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n3.53 7.06 10.59 1.76 2.64\"\n\n(1)\n\nEntry Toll\n\nPlaza\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod of\n\nOperation\n\n(3)\n\nToll Payable (RM) According to Classes of\n\nVehicles\n\nClass 1 Class 2 Class 3 Class 4 Class 5\n\n1. Ayer\n\nHitam\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19\n\n2. SKVE\n\nSaujana\n\nPutra\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19\n\n3. Teluk\n\nPanglima\n\nGarang\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19\n\n4. Pulau\n\nIndah\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19\n\n5. Banting\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n3.53 7.06 10.59 1.76 2.64\n\n;\n\n\"; and\n\n(c) by substituting for the heading \"Exit Toll Plaza: Ayer Hitam/\n\nSKVE Saujana Putra/Teluk Panglima Garang/Ayer Hitam at South\n\nKlang Valley Expressway (SKVE)\", item and particulars relating to it\n\nthe following heading, items and particulars:\n\n\"Exit Toll Plaza: Ayer Hitam/SKVE Saujana Putra/Teluk Panglima Garang/\n\nAyer Hitam at South Klang Valley Expressway (SKVE)\n\nAmendment of Second Schedule\n\n4. The principal Order is amended in the Second Schedule by inserting after\n\nMap E the following map:\n\n(1)\n\nEntry Toll\n\nPlaza\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod of\n\nOperation\n\n(3)\n\nToll Payable (RM) According to Classes of\n\nVehicles\n\nClass 1 Class 2 Class 3 Class 4 Class 5\n\n1. Banting\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n2.34 4.69 7.03 1.17 1.76\n\n2. SAE\n\n10.6.2025-\n\n19.12.2063\n\n1.59 3.18 4.77 0.79 1.19\n\n\".\n\n\".\n\n\"MAP F\n\nSKVE INTERCHANGE-SAE INTERCHANGE\n\nMade 9 June 2025\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/20 Jld.2; PN(PU2)426/JLD.73]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Minister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1905"] = {"id":"MY-H1905","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 176/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年费用（数字广告）（马来西亚广播局）令","en":"FEES (DIGITAL ADVERTISEMENT) (DEPARTMENT OF BROADCASTING MALAYSIA) ORDER 2026","orig":"FEES (DIGITAL ADVERTISEMENT) (DEPARTMENT OF BROADCASTING MALAYSIA) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Fi (Iklan Digital) (Jabatan Penyiaran Malaysia) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Phí (Quảng cáo số) (Cục Phát thanh Truyền hình Malaysia) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งค่าธรรมเนียม (โฆษณาดิจิทัล) (กรมประชาสัมพันธ์มาเลเซีย) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Biaya (Iklan Digital) (Departemen Penyiaran Malaysia) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA176","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)176-2026_FEES (DIGITAL ADVERTISEMENT) (DEPARTMENT OF BROADCASTING MALAYSIA) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1905-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Fi (Iklan Digital)\n\n(Jabatan Penyiaran Malaysia) 2026.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 20 April 2026.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H1905-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini —\n\n\"iklan digital\" ertinya kaedah pemasaran dalam pelbagai bentuk termasuklah\n\ntetapi tidak terhad kepada imej, audio, video, teks atau sepanduk yang menggunakan\n\nplatform digital atau papan elektronik untuk mempromosikan suatu produk,\n\nperkhidmatan, jenama, aktiviti, apa-apa perkara lain atau maklumat lain bagi\n\nmenyampaikan mesej kepada pengguna;\n\n\"Ketua Pengarah\" ertinya Ketua Pengarah Jabatan Penyiaran Malaysia;\n\n\"papan elektronik\" ertinya suatu sistem paparan yang menggunakan komponen\n\nelektronik untuk memaparkan maklumat dalam bentuk imej, audio, video atau teks\n\nkecuali sepanduk yang melibatkan penggunaan Paparan Diod Pemancar Cahaya (LED),\n\nPaparan Hablur Cecair (LCD) atau teknologi paparan lain untuk menunjukkan\n\nkandungan dalam format digital yang kandungannya boleh dikemas kini dan\n\nmempunyai ciri interaktif dan keupayaan multimedia; dan\n\n\"platform digital\" ertinya aplikasi yang menggunakan perkhidmatan capaian\n\ninternet yang membolehkan interaksi, penciptaan dan perkongsian kandungan\n\ntermasuklah tetapi tidak terhad kepada penstriman langsung video, penstriman\n\nlangsung audio, video atas permintaan (VOD) atau audio atas permintaan (AOD) yang\n\ndidaftarkan di bawah akaun Jabatan Penyiaran Malaysia.\n\nFi dan pembayaran fi"}},{"id":"MY-H1905-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Fi yang ditetapkan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama hendaklah dibayar\n\nkepada Ketua Pengarah bagi tempahan slot perkhidmatan untuk iklan digital yang\n\ndipaparkan di platform digital mengikut kategori yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) dan\n\nkuantiti yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\n(2) Fi yang ditetapkan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Kedua hendaklah dibayar\n\nkepada Ketua Pengarah bagi tempahan slot perkhidmatan untuk iklan digital yang\n\ndipaparkan di papan elektronik mengikut kategori yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\ndan hendaklah dikenakan mengikut tempoh paparan bagi setiap hari pengiklanan.\n\nPeremitan fi"}},{"id":"MY-H1905-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Ketua Pengarah boleh meremitkan fi yang ditetapkan di bawah Perintah ini\n\nsecara keseluruhan atau sebahagian, dan sama ada secara am atau dalam mana-mana\n\nhal atau kelas hal yang tertentu.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[Subperenggan 3(1)]\n\n1. Fi yang dikenakan bagi tempahan slot perkhidmatan untuk iklan digital yang\n\ndipaparkan di platform digital adalah seperti yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nKategori\n\n(2)\n\nKuantiti\n\n(3)\n\nFi (RM)\n\n1. Semua jenis iklan digital kecuali\n\nsepanduk\n\n1 CPM 50.00\n\n2. Sepanduk 1 CPM 40.00\n\n2. Bagi maksud Perintah ini, metrik yang digunakan adalah seperti yang berikut:\n\n(a) CPM adalah kos bagi seribu paparan dan 1 CPM bersamaan dengan 1,000\n\npaparan;\n\n(b) jika 1 CPM = RM50.00, ini bermakna pelanggan membayar RM50.00\n\nuntuk 1,000 paparan.\n\n3. Jumlah pengiraan fi bagi iklan digital yang dipaparkan di platform digital\n\nditentukan berdasarkan formula yang berikut:\n\n(a) paparan = jumlah bayaran X 1,000\n\n CPM\n\n(b) sebagai contoh, jika pelanggan membayar untuk iklan digital dengan\n\namaun RM100.00:\n\nPaparan = 100 X 1,000 = 2,000 paparan\n\nBagi amaun yang dibayar sebanyak RM100.00, pelanggan itu akan\n\nmendapat 2,000 paparan di platform digital.\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Subperenggan 3(2)]\n\nFi yang dikenakan bagi tempahan slot perkhidmatan untuk iklan digital yang\n\ndipaparkan di papan elektronik adalah seperti yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nKategori\n\n(2)\n\nFi (RM)\n\nSemua jenis\n\niklan digital\n\nkecuali\n\nsepanduk\n\nTempoh paparan\n\n15 saat\n\nTempoh paparan\n\n30 saat\n\nTempoh paparan\n\n60 saat\n\n500.00 sehari 900.00 sehari 1,700.00 sehari\n\nDibuat 3 April 2026\n\n[KKD.BKSK.(R).100-1/1/11(23); PN(PU2)86/JLD.30]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\n TAN SRI SHAMSUL AZRI BIN ABU BAKAR\n\n Setiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di hadapan Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Fi 1951]\n\nFEES ACT 1951\n\nFEES (DIGITAL ADVERTISEMENT)\n\n(DEPARTMENT OF BROADCASTING MALAYSIA) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by sections 3 and 10 of the Fees Act 1951 [Act 209],\n\nthe Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Fees (Digital Advertisement)\n\n(Department of Brodcasting Malaysia) Order 2026.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 20 April 2026.\n\nInterpretation\n\n2. In this Order—\n\n\"digital advertisement\" means a marketing method in various forms including\n\nbut not limited to images, audios, videos, texts or banners which use a digital platform\n\nor an electronic board to promote a product, service, brand, activity, any other matter or\n\nother information to convey messages to users;\n\n\"Director General\" means the Director General of the Department of\n\nBroadcasting Malaysia;\n\n\"electronic board\" means a display system which uses electronic components to\n\ndisplay information in forms of image, audio, video or text except banners that involve\n\nthe use of Light Emitting Diode Display (LED), Liquid Crystal Display (LCD) or other\n\ndisplay technology to indicate content in a digital format of which its contents can be\n\nupdated and has interactive features and multimedia capabilities; and\n\n\"digital platform\" means an application which utilizes internet access service\n\nthat enables interaction, creation and sharing of content including but not limited to live\n\nvideo streaming, live audio streaming, video on demand (VOD) or audio on demand\n\n(AOD) that is registered under the account of the Department of Broadcasting Malaysia.\n\nFees and payments of fees\n\n3. (1) The fees prescribed in column (3) of the First Schedule shall be paid to the\n\nDirector General for reservation of a service slot for a digital advertisement displayed\n\non a digital platform in accordance with the category specified in column (1) and the\n\nquantity specified in column (2).\n\n(2) The fees prescribed in columns (2) of the Second Schedule shall be paid to\n\nthe Director General for reservation of a service slot for a digital advertisement\n\ndisplayed on an electronic board in accordance with the category specified in\n\ncolumn (1) and shall be charged in accordance with the display duration for each day of\n\nadvertising.\n\nRemission of fees\n\n4. The Director General may remit the fees prescribed under this Order wholly or\n\nin part, and either generally or in any particular case or class of cases.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Subparagraph 3(1)]\n\n1. The fee imposed for reservation of a service slot for a digital advertisement\n\ndisplayed on a digital platform is as follows:\n\n[1]\n\nCategory\n\n[2]\n\nQuantity\n\n[3]\n\nFee (RM)\n\n1. All types of digital\n\nadvertisement except\n\nbanners\n\n1 CPM 50.00\n\n2. Banners 1 CPM 40.00\n\n2. For the purposes of this Order, the metric used is as follows:\n\n(a) CPM is cost per thousand impressions and 1 CPM is equivalent to 1,000\n\nimpressions;\n\n(b) if 1 CPM = RM50.00, this means the customer pays RM50.00 for 1,000\n\nimpressions.\n\n3. The total fee calculation for a digital advertisement displayed on a digital platform\n\nis determined based on the following formula:\n\n(a) impression = total payment X 1,000;\n\n CPM\n\n(b) for example, if a client pays for a digital advertisement with the amount of\n\nRM100.00:\n\nImpression = 100 X 1,000 = 2,000 Impressions\n\nFor the paid amount of RM100.00, the client will get 2,000 impressions on\n\nthe digital platform.\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[Subparagraph 3(2)]\n\nThe fee imposed for reservation of a service slot for a digital advertisement displayed\n\non an electronic board is as follows:\n\n(1)\n\nCategory\n\n(2)\n\nFee (RM)\n\nAll types of digital\n\nadvertisement\n\nexcept banners\n\n15 second\n\ndisplay duration\n\n30 second\n\ndisplay duration\n\n60 second\n\ndisplay duration\n\n500.00 per day 900.00 per day 1,700.00 per day\n\nMade 3 April 2026\n\n[KKD.BKSK.(R).100-1/1/11(23); PN(PU2)86/JLD.30]\n\nBy Command\n\n TAN SRI SHAMSUL AZRI BIN ABU BAKAR\n\n Secretary to the Cabinet\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Fees Act 1951]"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1906"] = {"id":"MY-H1906","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 177/2011&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年联邦道路（西马来西亚）（修正）（第6号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) ORDER 2011","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Semenanjung Malaysia) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 6) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Malaysia Barat) (Sửa đổi) (số 6) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (มาเลเซียตะวันตก) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Malaysia Barat) (Perubahan) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA177","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2011_P.U.(A)177-2011_FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 6) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1906-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Malaysia\n\nBarat) (Pindaan) (No. 6) 2011.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 31 Mei 2011.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1906-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Malaysia Barat) 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] dipinda\n\ndalam Jadual Pertama di bawah kepala \"Negeri Perlis Indera Kayangan\"―\n\n(a) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 9 butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"10. (Laluan 79): Jalan Ulu Pauh Chuping-Padang Besar\n\nDari Jalan Kuala Perlis-Changlun (Laluan 194) di Persimpangan\n\nBertingkat Ulu Pauh termasuk jalan-jalan susurnya di koordinat Utara\n\n(U) 714686.89, Timur (T) 262953.37 dan berakhir di persimpangan\n\nJalan Kangar-Padang Besar (Laluan 7) di koordinat Utara (U)\n\n736794.59, Timur (T) 259371.23 sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan\n\ndalam Peta 7: Jalan Ulu Pauh Chuping-Padang Besar, Negeri Perlis.\n\nJarak sepanjang 28.5 km.\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas \"Peta 6: Jalan Kaki Bukit-Wang Kelian, Negeri\n\nPerlis\" peta yang berikut:\n\nU 736794.59\n\nT 259371.23\n\nU 714686.89\n\nT 262953.37\n\nSempadan Negeri\n\nNegeri Perlis/\n\nNegeri Kedah\n\nSempadan\n\nAntarabangsa\n\nMalaysia/Thailand\n\nJalan Kangar-Padang Besar\n\nJalan Ulu Pauh-Padang Besar\n\nJalan Kuala Perlis-Changlun\n\nR123\n\nR116\n\n7 R116\n\nR122\n\nR129\n\nR131\n\nR9\n\n194 194\n\nR122\n\nR116\n\nR135\n\nR135\n\nR113\n\nR113 R9\n\nR116\n\nR131\n\nR116 R139\n\nR126 R126\n\nPetunjuk:\n\nJalan Yang Diwartakan\n\nJalan Persekutuan\n\nJalan Negeri\n\nSempadan Negeri\n\nSempadan\n\nAntarabangsa\n\nMalaysia/Thailand\n\nNombor Laluan\n\nPersimpangan\n\nBertingkat Ulu Pauh\n\nDibuat 12 Mei 2011\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/6; PN(PU2)391/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SHAZIMAN BIN ABU MANSOR\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat di bawah seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\n\"PETA 7: JALAN ULU PAUH CHUPING-PADANG BESAR, NEGERI PERLIS\n\n\".\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT)\n\n(NO. 6) ORDER 2011\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Federal Roads Act 1959\n\n[Act 376], the Minister, after consultation with the State Government of Perlis, makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H1907"] = {"id":"MY-H1907","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 177/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年贷款担保（法人团体）（税收与印花税豁免）（第3号）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 3) ORDER 2012","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 3) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Korporat) (Remisi Cukai dan Duti Setem) (Bilangan 3) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Pháp nhân) (Giảm miễn thuế và thuế tem) (số 3) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (นิติบุคคล) (การงดเว้นภาษีและอากรแสตมป์) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Hukum) (Pembebasan Pajak dan Bea Meterai) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA177","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)177-2012_LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 3) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1907-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan P injaman\n(Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Peremitan Cukai dan Duti Setem) (No. 3) 2012.\n(2) Perintah ini hendaklah disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa p ada\n1 Jun 2012.\nPeremitan cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H1907-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Apa-apa cukai yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967\n[Akta 53 ] hendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya berkenaan dengan apa -apa wang yang\nkena dibayar di bawah apa -apa perjan jian, nota, surat cara atau dokumen berhubung\ndengan—\n(a) mana-mana Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam dan Kertas Komersial\nIslamik yang diterbitkan menurut Program Nota Jangka Sederhana\nIslam dan Kertas Komersial Islamik dengan nilai nominal sehingga\nlapan bilion ringgit (RM8,000,000,000.00) (\"Program IMTN dan\nICP\") oleh DanaInfra Nasional Berhad (\"Penerbit\" atau\n\"Peminjam\") termasuk lah tetapi tidak terhad kepada apa -apa\nperjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan\njaminan (\"Jaminan\") yang diberikan at au akan diberikan oleh\nKerajaan Malaysia (\"Kerajaan\"), yang kena dibayar oleh—\n(i) Penerbit, yang baginya Akta ini terpakai menurut kuasa\nPerintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Penetapan Pertubuhan\n\nPerbadanan) (DanaInfra Nasional Berhad ) 2012\n[P.U. (A) 176/2012];\n(ii) mana-mana pemegang Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam dan\nKertas Komersial Islamik;\n(iii) mana-mana pihak lain kepada apa-apa perjanjian, nota,\nsurat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan Program IMTN\ndan ICP , termasuk lah mana-mana pihak yang kepad anya\nperjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen itu dipindahkan\natau diserahhakkan; atau\n(iv) mana-mana pihak lain kepada apa-apa perjanjian, nota,\nsurat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan Jaminan itu,\ntermasuklah mana-mana pihak yang kepadanya perjanjian,\nnota, surat cara dan dokumen itu dipindahkan atau\ndiserahhakkan; dan\n(b) Pembiayaan Pinjaman Bersindiket Revolving Credit Islam dengan\namaun agregat prinsipal sehingga lapan bilion ringgit\n(RM8,000,000,000.00) (\" Pembiayaan SFF -i\") yang diperoleh oleh\nPeminjam, termasuklah tetapi tidak terhad kepada apa -apa\nperjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan\nJaminan itu, yang kena dibayar oleh Peminjam, yang baginya Akta\nini terpakai menurut kuasa Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Penetapan\nPertubuhan Perbadanan) ( DanaInfra Nasional Berhad ) 201 2\n[P.U. (A) 176/2012].\n(2) Bagi maksud subperenggan (1), agregat—\n(a) nilai nominal belum berbayar Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam dan\nKertas Komersial Islamik yang diterbitkan di bawah Program\nIMTN dan ICP;\n\n(b) amaun prinsipal belum berbayar di bawah Pembiayaan SFF-i;\n(c) nilai nominal belum berbayar Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam dan\nKertas Komersial Islamik yang diterbitkan di bawah Program\nIMTN dan ICP; dan\n(d) amaun prinsipal belum berbayar di bawah Pembiayaan SFF -i yang\ndijamin oleh Kerajaan di bawah Jaminan itu,\ntidak boleh melebihi lapan bilion ringgit (RM8,000,000,000.00).\nPeremitan duti setem"}},{"id":"MY-H1907-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Apa-apa duti setem yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Setem 1949\n[Akta 378 ] berkenaan dengan apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat c ara atau dokumen\nberhubung dengan Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam dan Kertas Komersial Islamik,\nProgram IMTN dan ICP yang diterbitkan oleh Penerbit atau Pembiayaan SFF -i yang\ndiperoleh oleh Peminjam, atau berhubung dengan Jaminan itu hendaklah diremitkan\nsepenuhnya.\n(2) Bagi maksud subperenggan (1), agregat—\n(a) nilai nominal belum berbayar Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam dan\nKertas Komersial Islamik yang diterbitkan di bawah Program\nIMTN dan ICP;\n(b) amaun prinsipal belum berbayar di bawah Pembiayaan SFF-i;\n(c) nilai nominal belum berbayar Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam dan\nKertas Komersial Islamik yang diterbitkan di bawah Program\nIMTN dan ICP; dan\n(d) amaun prinsipal belum berbayar di bawah Pembiayaan SFF -i yang\ndijamin oleh Kerajaan di bawah Jaminan itu,\n\ntidak boleh melebihi lapan bilion ringgit (RM8,000,000,000.00).\nDibuat 31 Mei 2012\n[KK/BPKA/M/(S)/889/7/1; PN(PU2)232/VII]\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY)\n(NO. 3) ORDER 2012\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(1) of the Loans Guarantee\n(Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 [Act 96], the Minister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
