  FT["MY-H1998"] = {"id":"MY-H1998","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 182/2011&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年联邦道路（西马来西亚）（修正）（第7号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2011","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Semenanjung Malaysia) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 7) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Malaysia Barat) (Sửa đổi) (số 7) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (มาเลเซียตะวันตก) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 7) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Malaysia Barat) (Perubahan) (Nomor 7) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA182","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2011_P.U.(A)182-2011_FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1998-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Malaysia\n\nBarat) (Pindaan) (No. 7) 2011.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 7 Jun 2011.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H1998-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Malaysia Barat) 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] dipinda\n\ndalam Jadual Pertama—\n\n(a) di bawah kepala \"Negeri Selangor Darul Ehsan\", dengan memotong butiran 6;\n\n(b) di bawah kepala \"Negeri Pahang Darul Makmur\", dengan menggantikan\n\nbutiran 1 dengan butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"1. (Laluan 2): Jalan Kuala Lumpur-Kuantan\n\nDari had sempadan penyelenggaraan Lebuhraya Kuala Lumpur-Karak\n\ndi koordinat Utara (U) 378965.64, Timur (T) 447275.00 dan berakhir\n\ndi persimpangannya dengan Jalan Kuantan-Pelabuhan Kuantan di\n\nkoordinat Utara (U) 421593.01, Timur (T) 593272.12 sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam Peta 18: Negeri Pahang.\n\nJarak sepanjang 180.45 km.\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas PETA 17: JALAN-JALAN PERSEKUTUAN\n\nNEGERI PAHANG peta yang berikut:\n\nPetunjuk:\n\nJalan Yang Diwartakan\n\nJalan Persekutuan\n\nJalan Negeri\n\nLebuh Raya\n\nNombor Laluan\n\nE 8\n\nE 8\n\nE 8\n\nE 8\n\nC 19\n\nC 141\n\nC 125\n\nC 8 10\n\nC 108\n\nU 378965.64\n\nT 447275.00\n\nU 421593.01\n\nT 593272.12\n\nJalan Kuala Lumpur -Kuantan\n\nJalan Kuantan-Pelabuhan Kuantan\n\nHad sempadan penyelenggaraan\n\nLebuhraya Kuala Lumpur-Karak\n\nLebuhraya Pantai Timur\n\nDibuat 24 Mei 2011\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/10; PN(PU2)391/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SHAZIMAN BIN ABU MANSOR\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat di bawah seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\n\"PETA 18: NEGERI PAHANG\n\n\".\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2011\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Federal Roads Act 1959 [Act 376],\n\nthe Minister, after consultation with the State Government of Selangor and State\n\nGovernment of Pahang, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
