  FT["MY-H2050"] = {"id":"MY-H2050","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年道路交通（禁止驾驶货车）（第2号）规则","en":"ROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) (NO. 2) RULES 2017","orig":"ROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) (NO. 2) RULES 2017","ms":"Kaedah Lalu Lintas Jalan (Larangan Memandu Kenderaan Barang) (Bilangan 2) 2017","vi":"Quy tắc về Lưu thông đường bộ (Cấm điều khiển xe chở hàng) (số 2) năm 2017","th":"กฎการจราจรทางถนน (การห้ามขับรถบรรทุกสินค้า) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Tata Tertib Lalu Lintas Jalan (Larangan Mengemudikan Kendaraan Barang) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)185-2017_ROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) (NO. 2) RULES 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2050-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan (Larangan Pemanduan Kenderaan Barangan) (No. 2) 2017.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 23 Jun 2017.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2050-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Pemanduan mana-mana jenis kenderaan barangan yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama di mana-mana bahagian mana-mana jalan dilarang\n\npada 23 dan 24 Jun 2017 dan 1 dan 2 Julai 2017 pada masa yang dinyatakan dalam\n\nruang (2) Jadual Pertama.\n\n(2) Larangan dalam subkaedah (1) tidak terpakai bagi jenis kenderaan\n\nbarangan yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Kedua.\n\n(3) Walau apa pun larangan dalam subkaedah (1), Menteri boleh\n\nmengecualikan mana-mana jenis kenderaan barangan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama daripada larangan itu tertakluk kepada apa-apa syarat yang ditentukan\n\nolehnya.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[Subkaedah 2(1)]\n\n(1) (2)\n\nJenis Kenderaan Barangan Masa Larangan\n\n(a) Lori pengangkut rendah, lori balak,\n\nlori pembancuh simen, lori jongket dan lori\n\nyang mengangkut simen, besi, keluli, batu,\n\npasir, tanah dan bahan binaan yang lain\n\nsepanjang masa\n\n(b) Jentera berat beroda, traktor dan trak tunda sepanjang masa\n\n(c) Lori yang mengangkut amang, bijih timah,\n\narang batu dan bahan galian yang lain\n\nsepanjang masa\n\n(d) Lori pembawa yang mengangkut kenderaan\n\nmotor yang berat dengan muatannya\n\nmelebihi 5,000 kg\n\nsepanjang masa\n\n(e) Lori kontena atau kargo yang mengangkut\n\nbarangan elektronik atau elektrik\n\ndari 12.00 tengah malam hingga 6.00\n\npagi\n\n(f) Kren bergerak dari 6.00 petang hingga 6.00 pagi di\n\ndalam kawasan Lembah Klang, Johor\n\nBahru, Ipoh dan Kuantan (25 km dari\n\ntapak pembinaan) tertakluk kepada\n\nhad masa operasi yang dibenarkan di\n\njalan tertentu\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Subkaedah 2(2)]\n\n1. Lori yang mengangkut gas dan kimia bagi bekalan perubatan dan industri kimia\n\n2. Lori kontena atau kargo yang mengangkut barangan dari pelabuhan atau\n\nlapangan terbang ke kawasan industri dan sebaliknya\n\n3. Lori kargo yang mengangkut—\n\n(a) makanan dan minuman dari kilang, buah-buahan, sayur-sayuran\n\ndan barangan keperluan harian yang lain;\n\n(b) kelapa sawit, produk kelapa sawit, getah sekerap, susu getah dan\n\nbahan mentah yang lain;\n\n(c) barang runcit, surat khabar, ternakan dan kotak\n\n4. Lori mengangkut sampah dan kumbahan\n\n5. Kenderaan barangan yang berat dengan muatannya tidak melebihi 5,000 kg atau\n\nkenderaan barangan tanpa muatan yang dalam perjalanan pulang\n\n6. Lori kontena atau kargo yang berulang-alik di antara terminal dalam kawasan\n\npelabuhan\n\n7. Lori kontena atau kargo yang berulang-alik—\n\n(a) dari pelabuhan ke gudang dan sebaliknya; atau\n\n(b) dalam kawasan perindustrian yang berhampiran dengan\n\npelabuhan\n\n8. Lori tangki yang mengangkut petroleum, diesel, gas dan gas petroleum cecair\n\n(LPG)\n\n9. Lori dan jentera berat bagi maksud operasi kecemasan dan menyelamat\n\n10. Lori perkhidmatan pos\n\nDibuat 20 Jun 2017\n\n[KP/BD/PJ/0.109/31 Jld. 2 (39); PN(PU2)460/XLI]\n\nDATO' SERI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\nMenteri Pengangkutan\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) (NO. 2) RULES 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 88(1)(c) of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister, after consultation with the Minister\n\ncharged with the responsibility for works, makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Road Traffic (Prohibition on Driving of\n\nGoods Vehicles) (No. 2) Rules 2017.\n\n(2) These Rules come into operation on 23 June 2017.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. (1) The driving of any types of goods vehicles specified in column (1) of the\n\nFirst Schedule on any part of any road is prohibited on 23 and 24 June 2017\n\nand 1 and 2 July 2017 at the time specified in column (2) of the First Schedule.\n\n(2) The prohibition in subrule (1) does not apply to the types of goods\n\nvehicles specified in the Second Schedule.\n\n(3) Notwithstanding the prohibition in subrule (1), the Minister may exempt\n\nany types of goods vehicles specified in column (1) of the First Schedule from the\n\nprohibition subject to such conditions as he may determine.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Subrule 2(1)]\n\n(1) (2)\n\nTypes of Goods Vehicles Time of Prohibition\n\n(a) Low loader lorry, timber lorry, cement mixer\n\nlorry, tipper lorry and lorry transporting cement,\n\niron, steel, stones, sand, earth and other\n\nconstruction materials\n\nat all times\n\n(b) Wheeled heavy machinery, tractor and tow truck at all times\n\n(c) Lorry transporting tailing, tin, coal and other\n\nmineral materials\n\nat all times\n\n(d) Carrier lorry transporting motor vehicles of which\n\nits laden weight exceeding 5,000 kg\n\nat all times\n\n(e) Container or cargo lorry transporting electronic\n\nor electrical goods\n\nfrom 12.00 a.m. to 6.00 a.m.\n\n(f) Mobile crane from 6.00 p.m. to 6.00 a.m. in the\n\narea of Klang Valley, Johor Bahru,\n\nIpoh and Kuantan (25 km from the\n\nconstruction site) subject to the\n\nlimit of the operation time allowed\n\non certain roads\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[Subrule 2(2)]\n\n1. Lorry transporting gas and chemical for medical and chemical industry supplies\n\n2. Container or cargo lorry transporting goods from a port or airport to an\n\nindustrial area and vice versa\n\n3. Cargo lorry transporting—\n\n(a) food and beverages from a factory, fruits, vegetables and other\n\ndaily consumption goods;\n\n(b) palm oil, palm oil products, scrap rubber, latex and other raw\n\nmaterials;\n\n(c) groceries, newspapers, livestock and boxes\n\n4. Lorry transporting garbage and sewage\n\n5. Goods vehicle of which its laden weight not exceeding 5,000 kg or unladen goods\n\nvehicle on a return journey\n\n6. Container or cargo lorry plying between terminals within a port area\n\n7. Container or cargo lorry plying—\n\n(a) from a port to a warehouse and vice versa; or\n\n(b) within an industrial area close to a port\n\n8. Tanker lorry transporting petroleum, diesel, gas and liquefied petroleum gas\n\n(LPG)\n\n9. Lorry and heavy machinery for the purposes of emergency and rescue\n\noperations\n\n10. Postal service lorry\n\nMade 20 June 2017\n\n[KP/BD/PJ/0.109/31 Jld. 2 (39); PN(PU2)460/XLI]\n\nDATO' SERI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\nMinister of Transport"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2051"] = {"id":"MY-H2051","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）（第6号）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2018","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Bilangan 6) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) (số 6) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)185-2018_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2051-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) (No. 6) 2018.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 3 Ogos 2018.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2051-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua,\n\nmelainkan di atas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama,\n\nbagi tempoh yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya\n\nLarangan Terpakai\n\n(2)\n\nJalan Arah\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh Larangan\n\nSebahagian Laluan 31,\n\nJalan Banting-Semenyih\n\nbermula dari seksyen 46.0\n\nhingga seksyen 46.1\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta dalam\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nKenderaan dari Taman\n\nSemenyih Sentral ke\n\nKajang/Semenyih dan\n\nsebaliknya hendaklah\n\nmenggunakan jalan alternatif\n\nsebagaimana yang ditunjukkan\n\ndalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua\n\n3 Ogos 2018 hingga\n\n31 Oktober 2019\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nDibuat 2 Ogos 2018\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15 Jld.5; PN(PU2)460/XCVII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nSemenyih/Kajang\n\nKajang/Kuala Lumpur\n\nBandar\n\nRinching\n\nTaman\n\nSemenyih\n\nSentral\n\nseksyen 46.0\n\nseksyen 46.1\n\nPETUNJUK:\n\nJALAN YANG BAGINYA PERINTAH LARANGAN TERPAKAI\n\nJALAN ALTERNATIF\n\nBeranang\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2018\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 400/2018 published on 20 July 2018, notice was given of the\n\nintention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the\n\nmaking of such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to in\n\nsubsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport\n\n(Prohibition of Use of Road) (Federal Roads) (No. 6) Order 2018.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 3 August 2018.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road as specified in column (1) of the\n\nFirst Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than on the\n\nroutes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified in\n\ncolumn (3) of the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which\n\nProhibition Applies\n\n(2)\n\nRoutes\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition\n\nPeriod\n\nPart of Route 31,\n\nBanting-Semenyih Road\n\nstarting from section 46.0 to\n\nsection 46.1 as shown on the\n\nmap in the Second Schedule\n\nVehicles from Taman Semenyih\n\nSentral to Kajang/Semenyih\n\nand vice versa shall use the\n\nalternative road as shown on\n\nthe map in the Second Schedule\n\n3 August 2018 to\n\n31 October 2019\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nMade 2 August 2018\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/15 Jld.5; PN(PU2)460/XCVII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMinister of Works\n\nSemenyih/Kajang\n\nKajang/Kuala Lumpur\n\nBandar\n\nRinching\n\nTaman\n\nSemenyih\n\nSentral\n\nsection 46.0\n\nsection 46.1\n\nLEGEND:\n\nROAD TO WHICH PROHIBITION ORDER IS APPLICABLE\n\nALTERNATIVE ROAD\n\nBeranang"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2052"] = {"id":"MY-H2052","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年地方限速（联邦道路）（西马来西亚）（修正）令","en":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019","orig":"LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Semenanjung Malaysia) (Pindaan) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ địa phương (Đường bộ liên bang) (Malaysia Barat) (Sửa đổi) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วท้องถิ่น (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (มาเลเซียตะวันตก) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Lokal (Jalan Raya Federal) (Malaysia Barat) (Perubahan) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2019_P.U.(A)185-2019_LOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2052-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Tempatan\n\n(Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) (Pindaan) 2019.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 5 Julai 2019.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2052-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) 1992\n\n[P. U. (A) 462/1991] dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama di bawah kepala\n\n\"NEGERI PAHANG\", dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 98 butiran yang berikut:\n\n (1) (2)\n\nNama jalan dan lokasi Had laju\n\n(km/j)\n\n\"99. Laluan 8 – Jalan Bentong ̶Gua Musang dari\n\nKampung Durian Sebatang T 101.894035,\n\nU 3.889986 hingga Kampung Kuala Gali\n\nT 101.894735, U 3.916093 (jarak sepanjang\n\n2.984 km)\n\n 60\".\n\nDibuat 3 Julai 2019\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/8/1 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/CII]\n\nBARU BIAN\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nLOCAL SPEED LIMIT (FEDERAL ROADS) (WEST MALAYSIA)\n\n(AMENDMENT) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2053"] = {"id":"MY-H2053","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2020&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年版权（版权审裁处）（修正）条例","en":"COPYRIGHT (COPYRIGHT TRIBUNAL) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"COPYRIGHT (COPYRIGHT TRIBUNAL) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Hak Cipta (Tribunal Hak Cipta) (Pindaan) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Quyền tác giả (Tòa án Bản quyền) (Sửa đổi) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับลิขสิทธิ์ (คณะตุลาการลิขสิทธิ์) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Hak Cipta (Tribunal Hak Cipta) (Perubahan) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)185-2020_COPYRIGHT (COPYRIGHT TRIBUNAL) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2053-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)  Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nHak Cipta (Tribunal Hak Cipta) (Pindaan) 2020.\n\n(2)  Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Julai 2020.\n\nPindaan peraturan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H2053-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Hak Cipta (Tribunal Hak Cipta) 2012 [P.U. (A) 212 /2012],\nyang disebut \"Peraturan -Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan -Peraturan ini, dipinda dalam\nperaturan 2 dalam takrif \"Pemohon\", dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan\n\"perbadanan\" perkataan \", anggota badan pelesenan\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 5"}},{"id":"MY-H2053-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Subperaturan 5(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam perenggan (c), dengan memotong perkataan \"atau\" di hujung\nperenggan itu;\n\n(b) dalam perenggan (d), dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung perenggan\nitu dengan perkataan \"; atau\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (d) perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(e) suatu permohonan untuk pendengaran pertikaian yang\nberhubungan dengan royalti di bawah seksyen 59C Akta.\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2053-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Jadual Pertama kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam butiran 1 dengan\nmemasukkan selepas subbutiran d dan butir -butir yang berhubungan dengannya\nsubbutiran yang berikut:\n\nButiran Perihalan Fi\n(RM)"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2054"] = {"id":"MY-H2054","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年价格管制与反暴利（管制商品标价）（第2号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barang Kawalan Harga) (Bilangan 2) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Niêm yết giá hàng hóa thuộc diện kiểm soát giá) (số 2) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การแสดงราคาสินค้าควบคุมราคา) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barang yang Dikendalikan Harganya) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2021_P.U.(A)185-2021_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 202.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2054-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penandaan Harga Barangan Harga Terkawal) (No. 2) 2021.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini b erkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai  21 April 2021\nhingga 20 Mei 2021.\n\nPenandaan harga"}},{"id":"MY-H2054-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Mana-mana orang yang menjual atau menawarkan untuk menjual apa-apa\nbarangan harga terkawal yang disiarkan dalam Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan ( Penentuan Harga Maksimum)  (No. 2) 2021 [P.U. (A) 184/2021]\nhendaklah meletakkan label berwarna merah jambu yang menunjukkan harga\nbagi setiap unit atau setiap unit timbangan, nama yang memerihalkan barangan  harga\nterkawal itu dan gred atau kualiti, jika ada, bagi barangan harga terkawal itu.\n\n (2) Mana-mana orang  yang tidak mematuhi subperenggan (1) melakukan\nsuatu kesalahan dan boleh, apabila disabitkan—\n\n(a) jika orang itu suatu pertubuhan perbadanan,\ndidenda tidak melebihi dua puluh ribu ringgit dan,\nbagi kesalahan kali yang kedua atau yang berikutnya,\ndidenda tidak melebihi lima puluh ribu ringgit; atau\n\n(b) jika orang itu bukan suatu pertubuhan perbadanan,\ndidenda tidak melebihi sepuluh ribu ringgit dan,\nbagi kesalahan kali yang kedua atau yang berikutnya,\ndidenda tidak melebihi dua puluh ribu ringgit.\n\nDibuat 16 April 2021\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)26/0.5001/1 Jld.12; PN(PU2)695/Jld. 28]\n\n            DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n Menteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(PRICE MARKING OF PRICE-CONTROLLED GOODS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 10\nof the Price Control  and Anti -Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Minister  makes\nthe following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2055"] = {"id":"MY-H2055","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年关税（反倾销税）（行政复审）（第2号）（2019年）（修正）令","en":"CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW) (NO. 2) 2019 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022","orig":"CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW) (NO. 2) 2019 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti-Lambakan) (Semakan Pentadbiran) (Bilangan 2) (Tahun 2019) (Pindaan) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Thuế chống bán phá giá) (Rà soát hành chính) (Số 2) (năm 2019) (Sửa đổi) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (ภาษีตอบโต้การทุ่มตลาด) (การทบทวนทางปกครอง) (ฉบับที่ 2) (ค.ศ. 2019) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Bea Anti-Dumping) (Peninjauan Administratif) (Nomor 2) (Tahun 2019) (Perubahan) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2022_P.U.(A)185-2022_CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW) (NO. 2) 2019 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2055-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti-Lambakan)\n(Kajian Semula Pentadbiran) (No. 2) 2019 (Pindaan) 2022.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2022.\n\nPindaan perenggan 4"}},{"id":"MY-H2055-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti-Lambakan) (Kajian Semula Pentadbiran) (No. 2) 2019\n[P.U. (A) 263/2019] dipinda dalam subperenggan 4(1), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"Perintah Duti Kastam 2017 [P.U. (A) 5/2017]\" dengan perkataan \"Perintah Duti Kastam 2022\n[P.U. (A) 114/2022]\".\n\nDibuat 31 Mei 2022\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249 Klt.11 Sk. 3; Perb.: MOF.TAX(S) 700-2/1/55 JLD. 3; PN(PU2)338D/JLD. 6]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 11(2) Akta Kastam 1967]\n\nCOUNTERVAILING AND ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES ACT 1993 AND CUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW) (NO. 2) 2019\n(AMENDMENT) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the p owers conferred by section 25  of the\nCountervailing and Anti-Dumping Duties Act 1993 [Act 504] and subsection 11(1) of the\nCustoms Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2056"] = {"id":"MY-H2056","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年贷款担保（法人团体）（税收与印花税豁免）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) ORDER 2023","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Korporat) (Remisi Cukai dan Duti Setem) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Pháp nhân) (Giảm miễn thuế và thuế tem) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (นิติบุคคล) (การงดเว้นภาษีและอากรแสตมป์) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Hukum) (Pembebasan Pajak dan Bea Meterai) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)185-2023_LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2056-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman\n(Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Peremitan Cukai dan Duti Setem) 2023.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H2056-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah ini hendaklah terpakai bagi—\n\n(a) perjanjian kemudahan induk berhubung dengan Pembiayaan Berjangka -i\nBersindikasi berjumlah tiga bilion lima ratus juta ringgit\n(RM3,500,000,000.00) yang dibuat antara Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan\nTinggi Nasional dengan CIMB Investment Bank Berhad, CIMB Islamic Bank\nBerhad dan AmBank Islamic Berhad  yang disebut sebagai\n\"Perjanjian Kemudahan Induk\" dalam Perintah ini;\n\n(b) jaminan yang diberikan oleh Kerajaan Malaysia yang berhubungan dengan\nPerjanjian Kemudahan Induk yang disebut sebagai \"Jaminan Kerajaan\"\ndalam Perintah ini; dan\n\n(c) sijil perpindahan atau dokumen lain ber hubung dengan penyerahan ,\nperpindahan atau novasi hak, manfaat  atau obligasi di bawah\nPerjanjian Kemudahan Induk yang disebut sebagai \"Sijil Perpindahan\"\ndalam Perintah ini.\n\nPeremitan cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H2056-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa cukai yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967\n[Akta 53] oleh mana-mana individu atau entiti berikut berkenaan dengan apa-apa wang\nyang kena dibayar di bawah  Perjanjian Kemudahan Induk, Jaminan Kerajaan dan\nSijil Perpindahan dan apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen\nberhubung dengan Perjanjian Kemudahan Induk , Jaminan Kerajaan dan\nSijil Perpindahan hendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya:\n\n(a) Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional;\n\n(b) CIMB Investment Bank Berhad, CIMB Islamic Bank Berhad  atau\nAmBank Islamic Berhad;\n\n(c) mana-mana pihak lain kepada Perjanjian Kemudahan Induk,\nJaminan Kerajaan dan Sijil Perpindahan  termasuk mana-mana pihak lain\nyang kepadanya Perjanjian Kemudahan Induk, Jaminan Kerajaan dan\nSijil Perpindahan dipindahkan, diserahhakkan atau dinovasikan; atau\n\n(d) mana-mana pihak lain kepada  apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan\ndokumen berhubung denga n Perjanjian Kemudahan Induk,\nJaminan Kerajaan dan Sijil Perpindahan  termasuk mana-mana pihak lain\nyang kepadanya perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen itu dipindahkan,\ndiserahhakkan atau dinovasikan.\n\nPeremitan duti setem"}},{"id":"MY-H2056-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Apa-apa duti setem yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Setem 1949 [ Akta 378 ]\nberkenaan dengan Perjanjian Kemudahan Induk, Jaminan Kerajaan dan Sijil Perpindahan\ntermasuk apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan  dokumen berhubung dengan\nPerjanjian Kemudahan Induk, Jaminan Kerajaan dan  Sijil Perpindahan  hendaklah\ndiremitkan sepenuhnya.\n\nDibuat pada 31 Mei 2023\n[MOF.SID(S)700-14/2/11 JLD 6(4); PN(PU2)232/JLD.17]\n\nANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\nMenteri Kewangan\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE)\n(REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(1)\nof the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 [ Act 96 ], the Minister makes\nthe following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2057"] = {"id":"MY-H2057","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年价格管制与反暴利（持牌旅游经营商服务类别的固定收费核定）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF FIXED CHARGE FOR CLASS OF SERVICE OF LICENSED TOUR OPERATOR) ORDER 2024","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF FIXED CHARGE FOR CLASS OF SERVICE OF LICENSED TOUR OPERATOR) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penentuan Caj Tetap bagi Kelas Perkhidmatan Pengendali Pelancongan Berlesen) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định phí cố định theo loại hình dịch vụ của công ty lữ hành được cấp phép) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดค่าบริการคงที่ตามประเภทบริการของผู้ประกอบการนำเที่ยวที่ได้รับใบอนุญาต) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Biaya Tetap untuk Klasifikasi Jasa Biro Perjalanan Wisata Berizin) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2024_P.U.(A)185-2024_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF FIXED CHARGE FOR CLASS OF SERVICE OF LICE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2057-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga\ndan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Caj Tetap bagi Kelas Pe rkhidmatan Pengendali\nPelancongan Berlesen) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 10 Julai 2024.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H2057-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini, \"pengendali pelancongan berlesen\" hendaklah mempunyai\nerti yang sama yang diberikan kepadanya dalam Akta Industri Pelancongan 1992\n[Akta 482].\n\nCaj tetap bagi kelas perkhidmatan pengendali pelancongan berlesen"}},{"id":"MY-H2057-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Bagi maksud Program Malaysia My Second Home  (MM2H), caj tetap\nbagi kelas perkhidmatan pengendali pelancongan berlesen  yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1 ) Jadual bagi peserta yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) ditentukan mengikut\namaun sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF FIXED CHARGE\nFOR CLASS OF SERVICE OF LICENSED TOUR OPERATOR) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by sec tion 5 of the Price Control\nand Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval of the Minister,\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n[Perenggan 3/Paragraph 3]\n\nBil./\nNo.\n(1)\nKelas Perkhidmatan Pengendali Pelancongan\nBerlesen/\nClass of Service\nof Licensed Tour Operator\n(2)\nPeserta/\nParticipant\n(3)\nCaj Tetap/\nFixed Charge\n1. Platinum/\nPlatinum\n\nPrinsipal/\nPrincipal\nRM 70,000.00\n2. Emas/\nGold\n\nRM 55,000.00\n3. Perak/\nSilver\n\nRM 40,000.00\n4.  Zon ekonomi khas dan zon kewangan khas/\nSpecial economic zone and special financial zone\n\nRM 40,000.00\n\nDibuat 3 Julai 2024\nMade 3 July 2024\n[KPDNKK.100-1/4/6; PN(PU2)695/JLD.35]\n\nDATO' SERI MOHD SAYUTHI BIN BAKAR\nPengawal Harga/Price Controller\n\nDiluluskan 3 Julai 2024\nApproved 3 July 2024\n[KPDNKK.100-1/4/6; PN(PU2)695/JLD.35]\n\nDATUK ARMIZAN BIN MOHD ALI\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Kos Sara Hidup/\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Cost of Living"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2058"] = {"id":"MY-H2058","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年娱乐税（豁免）（第18号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 18) ORDER 2025","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 18) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 18) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 18) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 18) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 18) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)185-2025_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 18) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2058-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 18) 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H2058-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan tiket masuk bagi persembahan Jaclyn Victor Live Intimate\n\nShowcase yang telah diadakan di Aurum Theatre, The Exchange TRX, Kuala Lumpur\n\npada 22 dan 23 Februari 2025 daripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 16 Jun 2025\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/21; PN(PU2)174/JLD.13]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 18) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b) of the\n\nEntertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2059"] = {"id":"MY-H2059","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 185/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年娱乐税（豁免）（第21号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 21) ORDER 2026","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 21) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 21) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 21) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 21) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 21) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA185","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2026_P.U.(A)185-2026_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 21) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2059-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 21) 2026.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H2059-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan tiket masuk bagi persembahan 2026\n\n李圣杰【One Day 直到那一天】世界巡迴演唱會 - 马来西亚站 yang telah diadakan\n\ndi Axiata Arena Bukit Jalil, Kuala Lumpur pada 21 Februari 2026 daripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 27 April 2026\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/42 JLD. 2; PN(PU2)174/JLD.14]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH BIN AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 21) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b)\n\nof the Entertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H206"] = {"id":"MY-H206","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=221&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":8,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1951年马来西亚民防法","en":"MALAYSIA CIVIL DEFENCE ACT 1951","orig":"MALAYSIA CIVIL DEFENCE ACT 1951","vi":"Luật về Phòng vệ Dân sự Malaysia năm 1951","th":"พระราชบัญญัติการป้องกันภัยฝ่ายพลเรือนมาเลเซีย ค.ศ. 1951","id":"Undang-Undang Pertahanan Sipil Malaysia Tahun 1951","ms":"Akta Pertahanan Awam Malaysia 1951"},"level":"law","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT221","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1951","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 9 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\1951_221_MALAYSIA CIVIL DEFENCE ACT 1951.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H206-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Civil Defence Act 1951."}},{"id":"MY-H206-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—\n\n\"civil defence\" includes any measures not amounting to\nactual combat for affording defences against any form of\nhostile attack or for depriving any form of hostile attack of\nthe whole or part of its effect, whether the measures are\ntaken before, at or after the time of the attack;\n\n\"civil defence forces\" and \"civil defence services\" mean\nrespectively forces and services formed wholly or mainly to\nmeet the needs of civil defence."}},{"id":"MY-H206-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. (1) Whenever it appears to the Minister necessary or\nexpedient so to do he may make such rules as appear to\nhim to be necessary or expedient for the civil defence of\nMalaysia.\n\n(2) Without prejudice to the generality or scope of the\npowers conferred .by subsection .(1) such rules may provide\nfor— -                          a\n\n(a) the  ————  formation, maintenance, equip-\nment, training and discipline of civil defence forces\nand services;\n\nL.N. 201/65.\n\nShort title.\n\nInterpreta-\ntion.\n\nMinister\nmay make\nrules for\ncivil defence.\n\n6                                      AcT 221\n\n(b) the organisation, equipment and training for civil\ndefence purposes of the police force, fire brigades\nand employees of statutory and other bodies,\nwhether corporate or unincorporate, employed\nprimarily for purposes other than civil defence\npurposes;\n\n(c) the instruction of members of the public in civil\ndefence and their equipment for the purposes of\ncivil defence;\n\n(d) the provision, storage and maintenance of commo-\ndities and things required for civil defence;\n\n(e) the provision, construction, maintenance and altera-\ntion of premises, structures and excavations for civil\ndefence purposes;\n\n(f) the requisition, purchase and hire of land, buildings,\nmaterials, property and goods required for civil\ndefence purposes;\n\n(g) the assessment and payment of remuneration or\ncompensation in respect of all matters done in-\ncluding work done and services rendered and\ndamage and injury suffered in consequence of\npowers conferred by or under this Act;\n\n(h) the payment of compensation in respect of any\nphysical injury arising out of and in the performance\nby a member of the civil defence forces or services\nof his duties as such member;\n\n(i) the constitution of bodies and the appointment of\nofficers in States for the purposes of this Act and\nthe delegation to such bodies and officers of all or\nany of the powers conferred by or under this Act;\nand\n\n(j) the imposition of penalties for any act or omission\nin contravention of any rule provided that no such\npenalty shall exceed imprisonment for a term of\nthree years and a fine of five thousand ringgit.\n\n(3) Every rule made by the Minister under this section\nshall be laid, as soon as conveniently possible, on the table\nof the Dewan Rakyat.\n\nAppoitment 4. The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may appoint a Director\nofr' General for Civil Defence and such Assistant Directors\nAssistant   General and officers as he may consider necessary for the\nGeneral    purposes of this Act.\n\nand\n\nofficers.\n\n(S.\n\nCIVIL DEFENCE                 7"}},{"id":"MY-H206-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. The Director General for Civil Defence may make\nregulations consistent with this Act and any rules made\nthereunder providing generally for details connected with\nthe organisation and personnel of civil defence forces and\nservices and for the duties, equipment and training and\ninstruction of persons to whom such rules apply."}},{"id":"MY-H206-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. Members of the civil defence forces and services shall be\nmales to be public servants for the purposes of the Penal\nCode."}},{"id":"MY-H206-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. (1) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may by proclamation,\ncall out for service the whole or any part of the civil defence\nforces or services.\n\n(2) A member of the civil defence forces or services called\nout under subsection (1) shall report for service at such time\nand place as the Director General for Civil Defence may\nby notification in the Gazette or otherwise appoint."}},{"id":"MY-H206-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. (1) The Director General for Civil Defence may with\nthe concurrence of the Minister order the. civil defence\nforces or services or any part thereof to be employed for\nperformance of any relief work or giving protection to, or\ntaking measures for ensuring the safety of the life, person\nor property of the civilian population in the event of any\ndisaster or impending disaster or for effecting or facilitating\ntheir rehabilitation after such disaster.\n\n(2) Members of the civil defence forces and services\nemployed in pursuance of subsection (1) shall be deemed\nto perform civil defence duties."}},{"id":"MY-H206-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. Rule 28 of the Civil Defence (Civil Defence Corps) Rules\n1970 is hereby repealed.\n\n5-9]\n\nDirector\nGeneral for\nCivil\nDefence\nmay make\nregulations.\n\nMembers to\nbe public\nservants.\nF.M.S.\n\nCap 45.\n\nYang di-\nPertuan\nAgong may\ncall out\nthe civil\ndefence\nforces\nand\nservices\nfor\nservice.\n\nCivil\ndefence\nforces may\nbe ordered\nto perform\nrelief and\nrehabilita-\ntion works.\n\nRepeal of\nrule 28.\nP.U. (A)\n74170.\n\n[List of Amendments]\nLAWS OF MALAYSIA\n\nAct 221\n\nCIVIL DEFENCE ACT 1951\n(Revised—1979)\n\nParticulars under section 7 (ii) and (iii) of the Revision of\nLaws Act 1968 (Act /)\n\nLIST OF AMENDMENTS\n\nAmending law                                Short title                          In force from\n\nL.N. 332/1958 ... Federal Constitution (Modifica- 13-11-1958\ntion of Laws) (Ordinance and\nProclamation) Order 1958\n\nP.U. (B) 324/1970 Titles of office—Notification ... 1-1-1971\n\nAct A188     ... Civil Defence (Amendment) Act 30-3-1973\n\nAct 160... ... ‘Malaysian Currency (Ringgit) 29-8-1975\nAct 1975\n\nLIST OF LAWS OR PARTS THEREOF SUPERSEDED\nNo.                      Title\n38 of 1951 ....    Civil Defence Ordinance 1951.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\nDICETAK OLEH KETUA PENGARAH PERCETAKAN DAN DITERBITKAN DENGAN PERINTAH PADA\n24uB MEI 1979\n\nHarga: 50 sen"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2060"] = {"id":"MY-H2060","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 186/2011&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年联邦道路（西马来西亚）（修正）（第8号）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 8) ORDER 2011","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 8) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Semenanjung Malaysia) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 8) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Malaysia Barat) (Sửa đổi) (số 8) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (มาเลเซียตะวันตก) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 8) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Malaysia Barat) (Perubahan) (Nomor 8) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA186","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2011_P.U.(A)186-2011_FEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 8) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2060-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Malaysia Barat) (Pindaan) (No. 8) 2011.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 13 Jun 2011.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2060-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan Persekutuan (Malaysia Barat) 1989 [P.U. (A) 401/1989] dipinda\n\ndalam Jadual Pertama di bawah kepala \"Negeri Pahang Darul Makmur\" —\n\n(a) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 39 butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"40. (Laluan 101): Jalan Pintas Gebeng\n\nDari persimpangan bertingkatnya dengan Laluan 14, Lebuhraya\n\nJerangau-Jabor termasuk jalan susurnya di koordinat Utara (U)\n\n436816.28, Timur (T) 594055.91 dan berakhir di persimpangan\n\nbertingkat dengan Laluan 3, Jalan Kuantan-Cukai termasuk jalan\n\nsusurnya di koordinat Utara (U) 444765.75, Timur (T) 600786.20\n\nsebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam Peta 19: Negeri Pahang.\n\nJarak sepanjang 13.7 km.\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas PETA 18: NEGERI PAHANG peta yang berikut:\n\n\"PETA 19: NEGERI PAHANG\n\nC15 2\n\nC15\n\nPetunjuk:\n\nJalan Yang Diwartakan\n\nJalan Persekutuan\n\nJalan Negeri\n\nLebuh Raya\n\nSempadan Negeri\n\nNombor Laluan\n\nSempadan Negeri\n\nNegeri Pahang/\n\nNegeri Terengganu\n\nSempadan Negeri\n\nNegeri Pahang/\n\nNegeri Terengganu\n\nU 444765.75\n\nT 600786.20\n\nU 436816.28\n\nT 594055.91\n\nJalan Kuantan-Cukai\n\nLebuhraya Jerangau-Jabor\n\nJalan Pintas Gebeng\n\nDibuat 26 Mei 2011\n\n[KKR. PUU.110-1/6/10; PN(PU2)391/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SHAZIMAN BIN ABU MANSOR\n\n Menteri Kerja Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat di bawah seksyen 4 Akta Jalan Persekutuan 1959]\n\n\"\n\n.\n\nFEDERAL ROADS ACT 1959\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (WEST MALAYSIA) (AMENDMENT)(NO. 8 ) ORDER 2011\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Federal Roads Act 1959 [Act 376],\n\nthe Minister, after consultation with the State Government of Pahang, makes the following\n\norder:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2061"] = {"id":"MY-H2061","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 186/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年贷款担保（法人团体）（税收与印花税豁免）（第4号）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 4) ORDER 2012","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 4) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Korporat) (Remisi Cukai dan Duti Setem) (Bilangan 4) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Pháp nhân) (Giảm miễn thuế và thuế tem) (số 4) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (นิติบุคคล) (การงดเว้นภาษีและอากรแสตมป์) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Hukum) (Pembebasan Pajak dan Bea Meterai) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA186","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)186-2012_LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 4) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2061-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pi njaman (Pertubuhan\nPerbadanan) (Peremitan Cukai dan Duti Setem) (No. 4) 2012.\nPeremitan cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H2061-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Apa-apa cukai yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967\n[Akta 53 ] hendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya berkenaan dengan apa -apa wang yang\nkena dibayar di bawah apa -apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara atau dokumen berhubung\ndengan mana-mana Nota Berjangka Sederhana Berasaskan Syariah yang diterbitkan\nmenurut Program Nota Berjangka Sederhana Berasaskan Syariah dengan nilai nominal\nsebanyak tiga bili on ringgit (RM3,000,000,000.00) (\"Program IMTN\") oleh Bank\nPerusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana Malaysia Berhad (\"Penerbit\") termasuklah tetapi tidak\nterhad kepada apa -apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan\njaminan (\"Jaminan\") yang diberik an atau akan diberikan oleh Kerajaan Ma laysia, yang\nkena dibayar oleh—\n(a) Penerbit, yang baginya Akta ini terpakai menurut kuasa Perintah Jaminan\nPinjaman (Penetapan Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Bank Perusahaan Kecil dan\nSederhana Malaysia Berhad) 2008 [P.U. (A) 396/2008];\n(b) mana-mana pemegang Nota Berjangka Sederhana Berasaskan Syariah; atau\n(c) mana-mana pihak lain kepada apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan\ndokumen berhubung dengan Nota Berjangka Sederhana Berasaskan Syariah,\nProgram IMTN atau Jaminan, termasuklah mana-mana pihak yang kepadanya\n\nperjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen itu dipindahkan atau\ndiserahhakkan.\nPeremitan duti setem"}},{"id":"MY-H2061-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa duti setem yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Setem 1949 [ Akta 378 ]\nberkenaan dengan apa-apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan\nNota Jangka Sederhana Berasaskan Syariah, Program IMTN atau Jaminan hendaklah\ndiremitkan sepenuhnya.\nDibuat 13 Jun 2012\n[KK/BPKA/M/(S)/384/180; PN(PU2)232/VII]\nDATO' SERI HAJI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY)\n(NO. 4) ORDER 2012\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(1) of the Loans Gu arantee\n(Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 [Act 96], the Minister makes the following order:\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
