  FT["MY-H2100"] = {"id":"MY-H2100","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 188/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第22号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 22) ORDER 2018","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 22) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 22) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 22) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 22) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 22) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA188","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)188-2018_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2100-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel )\n(No. 22) 2018.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 9 Ogos 2018.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H2100-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2100-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga  Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel ) (No. 21) 2018 [P.U. (A) 183/2018] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 1 Ogos 2018 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 22) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\nClass of petrol and diesel\n\nHarga seliter/\nPrice per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97/\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.61\n\nPetrol RON95/\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.20\n\nDiesel Euro2/\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.18\n\nDiesel Euro5/\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.28\n\nDibuat 8 Ogos 2018\nMade 8 August 2018\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXII]\n\nDATO' SRI JAMIL BIN SALLEH\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 8 Ogos 2018\nApproved 8 August 2018\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXII]\n\nDATO' SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2101"] = {"id":"MY-H2101","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 188/2019&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"马来西亚国家银行（执行联合国安全理事会关于刚果民主共和国的决议）（修正）条例","en":"CENTRAL BANK OF MALAYSIA (IMPLEMENTATION OF THE UNITED NATIONS SECURITY COUNCIL RESOLUTIONS RELATING TO THE DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF CONGO) (AMENDMENT) REGULATION","orig":"CENTRAL BANK OF MALAYSIA (IMPLEMENTATION OF THE UNITED NATIONS SECURITY COUNCIL RESOLUTIONS RELATING TO THE DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF CONGO) (AMENDMENT) REGULATION","ms":"Peraturan Bank Negara Malaysia (Pelaksanaan Resolusi Majlis Keselamatan Pertubuhan Bangsa-Bangsa Bersatu berhubung Republik Demokratik Congo) (Pindaan)","vi":"Quy định về Ngân hàng Trung ương Malaysia (Thực hiện các nghị quyết của Hội đồng Bảo an Liên hợp quốc liên quan đến Cộng hòa Dân chủ Congo) (Sửa đổi)","th":"ข้อบังคับธนาคารกลางมาเลเซีย (การดำเนินการตามข้อมติคณะมนตรีความมั่นคงแห่งสหประชาชาติเกี่ยวกับสาธารณรัฐประชาธิปไตยคองโก) (การแก้ไข)","id":"Peraturan Bank Sentral Malaysia (Pelaksanaan Resolusi Dewan Keamanan Perserikatan Bangsa-Bangsa tentang Republik Demokratik Kongo) (Perubahan)"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA188","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)188-2019_CENTRAL BANK OF MALAYSIA (IMPLEMENTATION OF THE UNITED NATIONS SECURITY COUNCIL RESOLUTIONS REL.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2101-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan Bank\nNegara Malaysia (Pelaksanaan Ketetapan  Majlis Keselamatan\nBangsa-Bangsa Bersatu yang berhubungan dengan Republik Demokratik Congo)\n(Pindaan) 2019.\n\nPindaan peraturan 4"}},{"id":"MY-H2101-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Bank Negara Malaysia (Pelaksanaan Ketetapan -Ketetapan\nMajlis Keselamatan Bangsa -Bangsa Bersatu yang berhubungan dengan\nRepublik Demokratik Congo ) 201 4 [P.U. (A)  80/2014], yang disebut\n\"Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan -Peraturan ini , dipinda dengan\nmenggantikan peraturan 4 dengan peraturan yang berikut:\n\n\"4. Orang yang dite ntukan hendaklah seseorang individu atau sesuatu entiti\nyang telah dite ntukan oleh Majlis Keselamatan atau Jawatankuasa Majlis\nKeselamatan di bawah Ketetapan  sebagaimana yang disenaraikan dalam Senarai\nyang diwuju dkan, disenggarakan dan dikemas kinikan oleh Jawatankuasa Majlis\nKeselamatan dan boleh didapati  di laman sesawang rasmi Bangsa -Bangsa Bersatu\ndi http://www.un.org.\"\n\nPemotongan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H2101-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memotong Jadual.\n\nDibuat 24 Jun 2019\n[BNM.JUN.1119/15/75; PN(PU2)262/XII]\n\nNOR SHAMSIAH BINTI MOHD YUNUS\nGabenor\n\nDiluluskan 28 Jun 2019\n[KK/BPKA/K2/(S)/382/9/6; PN(PU2)262/XII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nCENTRAL BANK OF MALAYSIA ACT 2009\n\nCENTRAL BANK OF MALAYSIA (IMPLEMENTATION OF THE UNITED NATIONS\nSECURITY COUNCIL RESOLUTIONS RELATING TO THE DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF\nCONGO) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 8 2 of\nthe Central Bank of Malaysia Act 2009 [ Act 701 ], Bank Negara Malaysia, with the\napproval of the Minister, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2102"] = {"id":"MY-H2102","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 188/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年辅助医疗专业（费用）条例","en":"ALLIED HEALTH PROFESSIONS REGULATIONS (FEES) 2020","orig":"ALLIED HEALTH PROFESSIONS REGULATIONS (FEES) 2020","ms":"Peraturan Profesion Kesihatan Bersekutu (Fi) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Các ngành y tế đồng minh (Phí) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับวิชาชีพสหเวช (ค่าธรรมเนียม) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Profesi Kesehatan Terkait (Biaya) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA188","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2020_P.U.(A)188-2020_ALLIED HEALTH PROFESSIONS REGULATIONS (FEES) 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2102-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nProfesion Kesihatan Bersekutu (Fi) 2020.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Julai 2020.\n\nFi"}},{"id":"MY-H2102-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Fi yang kena dibayar kepada Majlis berkenaan dengan perkara yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam ruang (1) Jadual adalah sebagaimana yang ditetapkan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPenepian"}},{"id":"MY-H2102-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Majlis boleh mengurangkan atau mengetepikan, jumlah fi yang ditetapkan dalam\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini bagi seseorang pengamal kesihatan bersekutu yang dalam\n\nperkhidmatan awam.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(Peraturan 2)\n\nBil. (1)\n\nPerkara\n\n(2)\n\nFi (RM)\n\n1. Permohonan bagi pendaftaran sebagai pengamal kesihatan\n\nbersekutu\n\n2. Permohonan bagi pendaftaran sebagai pakar\n\n(bagi setiap bidang kepakaran)\n\n3. Permohonan bagi perakuan amalan 50\n\nBil. (1)\n\nPerkara\n\n(2)\n\nFi (RM)\n\n4. Permohonan bagi perakuan amalan sementara 150\n\n5. Permohonan bagi perakuan amalan selepas tamat tempoh\n\nperakuan\n\n6. Permohonan bagi perakuan amalan sementara selepas\n\ntamat tempoh perakuan\n\n7. Permohonan untuk mengesahkan status perakuan amalan\n\ndan perakuan amalan sementara\n\n8. Pengeluaran perakuan pendaftaran 100\n\n9. Pengeluaran perakuan amalan 200\n\n10. Pengeluaran perakuan amalan sementara 300\n\n11. Memeriksa, membuat salinan atau cabutan butiran\n\ndaripada Daftar\n\nDibuat 10 Jun 2020\n\n[KKM.PUU.R/U2/AHPJLD.6(10); PN(PU2)753]\n\n DATUK DR. NOOR HISHAM BIN ABDULLAH\n\nPengerusi\n\nMajlis Profesion Kesihatan Bersekutu\n\nDiluluskan 10 Jun 2020\n\n[KKM.PUU.R/U2/AHPJLD.6(10); PN(PU2)753]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nALLIED HEALTH PROFESSIONS ACT 2016\n\nALLIED HEALTH PROFESSIONS REGULATIONS (FEES) 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 45(2)(b) of the\n\nAllied Health Professions Act 2016 [Act 774], the Council, with the approval of the\n\nMinister, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Allied Health Professions\n\nRegulations (Fees) 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 July 2020.\n\nFees\n\n2. The fees payable to the Council in respect of the matters specified in column (1) of\n\nthe Schedule shall be as prescribed in column (2).\n\nWaiver\n\n3. The Council may reduce or waive, the amount of fees prescribed in these\n\nRegulations for an allied health practitioner in the public services.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(Regulation 2)\n\nNo. (1)\n\nMatter\n\n(2)\n\nFees (RM)\n\n1. Application for registration as an allied health practitioner 50\n\n2. Application for registration as an expert\n\n(for each field of expertise)\n\n3. Application for practising certificate 50\n\n4. Application for temporary practising certificate 150\n\nNo. (1)\n\nMatter\n\n(2)\n\nFees (RM)\n\n5. Application for practising certificate after the expiry\n\nof the certificate\n\n6. Application for temporary practising certificate after the\n\nexpiry of the certificate\n\n7. Application to verify status of practising certificate and\n\ntemporary practising certificate\n\n8. Issuance of certificate of registration 100\n\n9. Issuance of practising certificate 200\n\n10. Issuance of temporary practising certificate 300\n\n11. Inspection, copying or extraction of an entry\n\nfrom the Register\n\nMade 10 June 2020\n\n[KKM.PUU.R/U2/AHPJLD.6(10); PN(PU2)753]\n\nDATUK DR. NOOR HISHAM BIN ABDULLAH\n\nChairman\n\nAllied Health Professions Council\n\nApproved 10 June 2020\n\n[KKM.PUU.R/U2/AHPJLD.6(10); PN(PU2)753]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
  FT["MY-H2103"] = {"id":"MY-H2103","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 188/2021&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":7,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":null,"en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 10) REGULATIONS 202","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 10) REGULATIONS 202"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA188","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 7 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)188-2021_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITION.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2103-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Negeri Johor 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H2103-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Negeri Pulau Pinang 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H2103-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Negeri Sarawak 13.4.2021 – 26.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nKawasan Tempatan Jangkitan/Bahagian/Daerah\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh"}},{"id":"MY-H2103-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. Negeri Selangor 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H2103-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H2103-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. Daerah Kuala Muda, Negeri Kedah 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H2103-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. Daerah Seremban, Negeri Sembilan 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\".\n\nDibuat 22 April 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 6]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT\n\nCONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 10) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342],\n\nthe Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas)\n\n(Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) (Amendment) (No. 10) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 22 April 2021.\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule\n\n2. The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) Regulations 2021\n\n[P.U. (A) 97/2021] are amended by substituting for the First Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\nAPPLICATION\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n1. State of Johore 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n2. State of Penang 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n3. State of Sarawak 13.4.2021 – 26.4.2021\n\n4. State of Selangor 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n5. Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n6. Kuala Muda District, State of Kedah 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\n\n7. Seremban District, State of Negeri Sembilan 15.4.2021 – 28.4.2021\".\n\nMade 22 April 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 6]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-4"};
